export const norwayChildSupportTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"የኖርዌይ የህጻናት ድጋፍ ገምጋሚ","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"የኖርዌይ የልጅ ድጋፍ ማስያ 2026 - የግል ስምምነት ግምት","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"በኖርዌይ 2026 ማጣቀሻ ተመኖች ስር ቀለል ያለ ወርሃዊ የልጅ ድጋፍ ሁኔታን ያስሱ። ግምቶችን እና የተገመተውን መጠን ለማየት የልጅ እድሜ፣ የእያንዳንዱን ወላጅ ገቢ፣ የልጅ እንክብካቤ ወጪዎች፣ የመኖሪያ እና ጉብኝት ያስገቡ።","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"የአንድ ልጅ ወርሃዊ ድጋፍን ለመወያየት ይህንን የግል እቅድ ግምት ይጠቀሙ። በእድሜ ላይ የተመሰረቱ የማጣቀሻ ቁጥሮች እና የጉብኝት ቅናሾች የኖርዌይ 2026 ሰንጠረዦችን ይከተላሉ; የዚህ ገጽ ቋንቋ ሀገሪቱን ወይም ደንቦችን ፈጽሞ አይለውጥም.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይሰራል። የሚያስገቧቸው አሃዞች ወደ አገልጋይ አይላኩም ወይም በዚህ መሳሪያ የተቀመጡ አይደሉም።","Example":"ለምሳሌ","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"ለአረጋዊ ልጅ6–10፣ የ2026ከህጻን እንክብካቤ በፊት የማመሳከሪያ ዋጋ NOK ነው።7,523በፍጆታ እና NOK3,811ለቤት, NOK ያነሰ2,012ተራ የልጅ ጥቅም፡ NOK9,322. ከ NOK ዓመታዊ የወላጅ ገቢ ጋር600,000እና NOK400,000እና የጉብኝት ክፍል2, የቀለለ የአንድ ቤት ግምት ስለ NOK ነው3,900ከ NOK በኋላ በወር1,690ጉብኝት ክሬዲት እና ማጠጋጋት.","How the estimate works":"ግምቱ እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"መሳሪያው የ2026በእድሜ ላይ የተመሰረተ የፍጆታ መጠን እና የመኖሪያ ቤት መጠን፣ የሚያስገቡትን ብቁ የሆነ የተጣራ የህጻን እንክብካቤ ወጪ ይጨምራል፣ እና ተራ የልጅ ጥቅማ ጥቅሞችን ይቀንሳል። ለአንድ የመጀመሪያ ደረጃ ቤት፣ ሁለቱን የገቡትን ዓመታዊ ገቢዎች በመጠቀም ይህንን ወጪ ይመድባል፣ ይተገበራል።5/6የወጪ ጣሪያ እና25% የገቢ ጣሪያ፣ ይቀንሳል2026የጉብኝት ክሬዲት እና ዙሮች ወደ NOK ቅርብ10. ለጋራ መኖሪያ ከላይ ያለውን ከፍተኛ ገቢ ያለው የወላጅ ድርሻ ይገምታል።50%","Common questions":"የተለመዱ ጥያቄዎች","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"ይህ በሕግ አስገዳጅ መጠን ያዘጋጃል?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"ቁ. ወላጆች በግል ሊስማሙ ይችላሉ፣ እና NAV ብቻውን የህዝብ ውሳኔ ያደርጋል። ይህ ቀላል ንጽጽር ነው, አይደለም NAV ውሳኔ ወይም ሙሉ ማስያ.","Does page language change these rules?":"የገጽ ቋንቋ እነዚህን ደንቦች ይለውጣል?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"ቁ. በይነገጹ ተተርጉሟል፣ ግን የሚታየው ተመኖች እና ቀመሮች ኖርዌጂያን እና ቀኑ 2026 ናቸው።","Why do the rates have a date?":"ተመን ለምን ቀን አላቸው?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV እና ሚኒስቴሩ በዓመቱ ውስጥ የማጣቀሻ መጠኖችን አዘምነዋል፣ በተለምዶ ከ1 ጁላይ። ይህ እትም ውጤታማ ተመኖችን ይጠቀማል 1 ጁላይ 2026; በውጤቱ ላይ ከመታመንዎ በፊት የተገናኙትን ኦፊሴላዊ ጠረጴዛዎች ያረጋግጡ.","Scope and limits":"ወሰን እና ገደቦች","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"ኖርዌይ ብቻ; አንድ ልጅ በአንድ ስሌት, በ 18 ስር. ይህ ቀለል ያለ ሁኔታ የ NAVን ሙሉ የገቢ ትርጉም፣ የግብር እና የመክፈል አቅም ስሌት፣ የልጅ እንክብካቤ ድጋፍ/የታክስ እፎይታ፣ የልጅ ገቢ፣ የበርካታ ልጆች ምደባ፣ ያልተለመደ የጉብኝት መርሃ ግብር፣ ተጨማሪ ድጋፍ ወይም አለም አቀፍ ጉዳዮችን አያባዛም። ተጠቃሚው የገባው የሕጻናት እንክብካቤ መጠን ተጠቃሚው የሚያውቀው ማንኛውም ድጋፍ ወይም ተቀናሽ ከተደረገ በኋላ ብቁ የሆነው የተጣራ ወርሃዊ መጠን መሆን አለበት። ገቢ ቀላል ዓመታዊ ጠቅላላ ገቢ ነው, አንድ ኦፊሴላዊ NAV ግምገማ አይደለም. እንደ ሽልማት፣ የህግ ምክር ወይም የትኛውም ወላጅ መክፈል እንዳለበት ቃል ኪዳን አይጠቀሙበት።","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"የግል ስምምነት ሁኔታን ይገምቱ","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"የኖርዌይ ህጎች ብቻ · 2026 ማጣቀሻ ሠንጠረዦች ውጤታማ 1 ሐምሌ · 17 ጥቅምት 2026 ተረጋገጠ · ቋንቋ አገሪቱን አይለውጥም.","Child age group":"የልጆች የዕድሜ ቡድን","0–5 years":"0–5 ዓመታት","6–10 years":"6–10 ዓመታት","11–14 years":"11–14 ዓመታት","15 years and older":"15 ዓመታት እና ከዚያ በላይ","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"የወላጅ ክፍያ ድጋፍ ዓመታዊ ጠቅላላ ገቢ፣ NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"የሌላው ወላጅ ዓመታዊ ጠቅላላ ገቢ፣ NOK","Child residence arrangement":"የልጆች መኖሪያ ዝግጅት","One primary home":"አንድ ዋና ቤት","Shared residence":"የተጋራ መኖሪያ","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"የሚፈቀደው የተጣራ የሕጻናት እንክብካቤ ወጪ በወር፣ NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"አማራጭ። ከማንኛውም ድጋፍ ወይም የግብር እፎይታ በኋላ ሊካተት ይችላል ብለው የሚያምኑትን ወርሃዊ መጠን ብቻ ያስገቡ። መሣሪያው ብቁነትን ሊወስን አይችልም.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"የተራ የልጅ ጥቅማ ጥቅሞች በወር፣ NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"የጉብኝት ክፍል ለቅናሹ ጥቅም ላይ ይውላል","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"ዋጋ የለም / በወር ከ2 ምሽቶች ያነሰ","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"ክፍል 1 · ስለ 2–3 ምሽቶች በወር","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"ክፍል 2 · ስለ 4–8 ምሽቶች በወር","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"ክፍል 3 · ስለ 9–13 ምሽቶች በወር","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"ክፍል 4 · ስለ 14–15 ምሽቶች በወር","Estimate monthly amount":"የወሩን መጠን ግምት","Clear entries":"ግቤቶችን አጽዳ","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"የሁለቱም ወላጆች ዓመታዊ ጠቅላላ ገቢ እና የልጁን የዕድሜ ቡድን ያስገቡ።","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"ሁኔታ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ይሰላል። NAV ኦፊሴላዊ ጉዳዮችን ይወስናል.","Entries cleared.":"ግቤቶች ጸድተዋል።","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"ገቢውን፣ እድሜውን፣ የጉብኝት ክፍልን እና ወርሃዊ ወጪ ግቤቶችን ያረጋግጡ።","Simplified monthly scenario":"ቀላል ወርሃዊ ሁኔታ","Estimated monthly transfer":"የሚገመተው ወርሃዊ ዝውውር","Estimated amount over 12 months":"የተገመተው መጠን ከ12 ወራት በላይ","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"ወርሃዊ የጥገና-ወጪ መሰረት","Age-based consumption reference":"በእድሜ ላይ የተመሰረተ የፍጆታ ማጣቀሻ","Standard housing reference":"መደበኛ የመኖሪያ ቤት ማጣቀሻ","Childcare amount entered":"የህፃናት እንክብካቤ መጠን ገብቷል።","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"የተለመደ የልጆች ጥቅማ ጥቅም ተቀንሷል","Income share before ceilings":"የገቢ ድርሻ ከጣሪያ በፊት","Estimate before visitation credit":"ከጉብኝት ክሬዲት በፊት ግምት","Visitation credit":"የጉብኝት ክሬዲት።","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 የጥገና ወጪ ጣሪያ","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% ዓመታዊ ገቢ ጣሪያ በወር","Parent responsible in this scenario":"በዚህ ሁኔታ ውስጥ ኃላፊነት ያለው ወላጅ","Parent entered as paying":"ወላጅ እንደ ክፍያ ገብቷል።","Other parent":"ሌላ ወላጅ","Higher-income parent":"ከፍተኛ ገቢ ያላቸው ወላጅ","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"ለጋራ መኖሪያነት መሳሪያው ከፍተኛ ገቢ ያላቸውን የወላጆች የገቢ ድርሻ ከ 50% ጋር ያወዳድራል።","Assumptions used":"ያገለገሉ ግምቶች","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"ስታቲክ የኖርዌይ 2026 የማጣቀሻ ተመኖች 1 ሐምሌ; ምንም የጀርባ ዝማኔዎች የሉም.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"ገንዘቡ ወደ NOK 10 የተጠጋጋ ነው። አመታዊ መጠኑ የተጠጋጋ ወርሃዊ ግምትን በ 12 ያባዛል።","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"አንድ ልጅ በአንድ ስሌት; የመክፈል አቅም, ሌሎች ልጆች, ሙሉ ታክስ, የልጆች ገቢ እና ልዩ ጉዳዮች ሞዴል አይደሉም.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"ሁሉም ግቤቶች እና ስሌቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ትር ውስጥ ይቆያሉ። በዚህ መሳሪያ ምንም ነገር አልተሰቀለም ወይም አይከማችም።","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · የልጅ ማሳደጊያ ደንቦች እና መመሪያ","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 የማጣቀሻ ተመኖች እና የጉብኝት ተቀናሾች","Norwegian child support regulation":"የኖርዌይ የልጆች ድጋፍ ደንብ","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"አሁን ያለውን የNAV መመሪያ እና ይፋዊ ካልኩሌተርን ይመልከቱ","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ar":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"مقدر دعم الطفل النرويجي","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"حاسبة دعم الطفل في النرويج 2026 — تقدير الاتفاقية الخاصة","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"استكشف سيناريو دعم الطفل الشهري المبسط بموجب المعدلات المرجعية النرويجية 2026. أدخل عمر الطفل، ودخل كل من الوالدين، وتكاليف رعاية الطفل، والإقامة والزيارة لمعرفة الافتراضات والمبلغ المقدر.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"استخدم تقدير التخطيط الخاص هذا لمناقشة الدعم الشهري لطفل واحد. الأرقام المرجعية على أساس العمر وخصومات الزيارة تتبع جداول 2026 النرويجية المؤرخة؛ لغة هذه الصفحة لا تغير البلد أو القواعد أبدًا.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"يتم تشغيله في هذا المتصفح. لا يتم إرسال الأرقام التي تدخلها إلى الخادم أو حفظها بواسطة هذه الأداة.","Example":"مثال","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"بالنسبة لطفل يبلغ من العمر 6–10، تبلغ التكلفة المرجعية 2026 قبل رعاية الطفل 7,523 كرونة نرويجية في الاستهلاك بالإضافة إلى 3,811 كرونة نرويجية للسكن، مخصومًا منه 2,012 إعانة الطفل العادية: NOK 9,322. مع دخل الوالدين السنوي البالغ NOK 600,000 وNOK 400,000 وفئة الزيارة 2، فإن التقدير المبسط للمنزل الواحد يبلغ حوالي NOK 3,900 شهريًا بعد رصيد الزيارة 1,690 NOK وتقريبه.","How the estimate works":"كيفية عمل التقدير","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"تضيف الأداة مبلغ الاستهلاك ومبلغ السكن 2026 على أساس العمر، وتضيف صافي تكلفة رعاية الطفل المؤهلة التي تدخلها، وتطرح مخصصات الطفل العادية. بالنسبة لمنزل رئيسي واحد، فإنه يخصص هذه التكلفة باستخدام الدخلين السنويين المدخلين، ويطبق سقف التكلفة 5/6 وسقف الدخل 25%، ويطرح رصيد الزيارة 2026 ويقرب إلى أقرب NOK 10. بالنسبة للإقامة المشتركة، تقدر حصة الوالدين ذوي الدخل الأعلى بما يزيد عن 50%.","Common questions":"الأسئلة الشائعة","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"هل يحدد هذا مبلغًا ملزمًا قانونيًا؟","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"لا. يمكن للوالدين الموافقة بشكل خاص، ويقوم NAV وحده باتخاذ القرار العلني. هذه مقارنة مبسطة، وليست قرار صافي قيمة الأصول أو حاسبتها الكاملة.","Does page language change these rules?":"هل تغير لغة الصفحة هذه القواعد؟","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"رقم. الواجهة مترجمة، لكن الأسعار والصيغة المعروضة هي نرويجية ومؤرخة 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"لماذا الأسعار لها تاريخ؟\nيقوم","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV والوزارة بتحديث المبالغ المرجعية خلال العام، عادةً من 1 في يوليو. يستخدم هذا الإصدار الأسعار السارية 1 يوليو 2026؛ تحقق من الجداول الرسمية المرتبطة قبل الاعتماد على النتيجة.","Scope and limits":"النطاق والحدود","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"النرويج فقط؛ طفل واحد لكل عملية حسابية، تحت 18. لا يعيد هذا السيناريو المبسط إنتاج تعريف الدخل الكامل لصافي قيمة الأصول، أو حساب الضرائب والقدرة على الدفع، أو دعم رعاية الأطفال/الإعفاء الضريبي، أو دخل الطفل، أو تخصيص عدة أطفال، أو جداول الزيارات غير العادية، أو الدعم الإضافي، أو الحالات الدولية. يجب أن يكون مبلغ رعاية الطفل الذي أدخله المستخدم هو صافي المبلغ الشهري المؤهل بعد أي دعم أو خصومات يعرف المستخدم أنها تنطبق. الدخل هو إجمالي الدخل السنوي المبسط، وليس تقييم صافي قيمة الأصول. لا تستخدمه كجائزة أو نصيحة قانونية أو وعد بما يجب على أحد الوالدين دفعه.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"تقدير سيناريو الاتفاقية الخاصة","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"القواعد النرويجية فقط · الجداول المرجعية 2026 سارية 1 يوليو · محدد 17 أكتوبر 2026 · اللغة لا تغير البلد.","Child age group":"الفئة العمرية للأطفال","0–5 years":"0–5 سنة","6–10 years":"6–10 سنة","11–14 years":"11–14 سنة","15 years and older":"15 سنة فما فوق","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"الدخل الإجمالي السنوي لدعم الوالدين، كرونة نرويجية","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"الدخل الإجمالي السنوي للشركة الأم الأخرى، NOK","Child residence arrangement":"ترتيب إقامة الطفل","One primary home":"منزل أساسي واحد","Shared residence":"سكن مشترك","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"صافي تكلفة رعاية الأطفال المؤهلة شهريًا، كرونة نرويجية","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"اختياري. أدخل فقط المبلغ الشهري الذي تعتقد أنه قد يتم تضمينه بعد أي دعم أو إعفاء ضريبي؛ لا يمكن للأداة تحديد الأهلية.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"مخصصات الطفل العادية شهريًا، كرونة نرويجية","Visitation class used for the discount":"فئة الزيارة المستخدمة للخصم","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"لا يوجد خصم / أقل من 2 ليلة في الشهر","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"الفئة 1 · حوالي 2–3 من الليالي في الشهر","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"الفئة 2 · حوالي 4–8 من الليالي شهريًا","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"الفئة 3 · حوالي 9–13 من الليالي شهريًا","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"الفئة 4 · حوالي 14–15 من الليالي في الشهر","Estimate monthly amount":"تقدير المبلغ الشهري","Clear entries":"مسح الإدخالات","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"أدخل إجمالي الدخل السنوي لكلا الوالدين والفئة العمرية للطفل.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"السيناريو المحسوب على هذا الجهاز. NAV تقرر القضايا الرسمية.","Entries cleared.":"تم مسح الإدخالات.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"التحقق من الدخل والعمر وفئة الزيارة وإدخالات التكلفة الشهرية.","Simplified monthly scenario":"سيناريو شهري مبسط","Estimated monthly transfer":"التحويل الشهري المقدر","Estimated amount over 12 months":"المبلغ المقدر على مدار 12 من الأشهر","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"أساس تكلفة الصيانة الشهرية","Age-based consumption reference":"مرجع الاستهلاك على أساس العمر","Standard housing reference":"مرجع الإسكان القياسي","Childcare amount entered":"تم إدخال مبلغ رعاية الأطفال","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"خصم إعانة الطفل العادية","Income share before ceilings":"حصة الدخل قبل السقوف","Estimate before visitation credit":"التقدير قبل رصيد الزيارة","Visitation credit":"رصيد الزيارة","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 سقف تكلفة الصيانة","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% سقف الدخل السنوي شهريًا","Parent responsible in this scenario":"الوالد المسؤول في هذا السيناريو","Parent entered as paying":"تم إدخال الوالد كدفع","Other parent":"والد آخر","Higher-income parent":"الوالد ذو الدخل المرتفع","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"بالنسبة للإقامة المشتركة، تقوم الأداة بمقارنة حصة دخل الوالدين ذوي الدخل المرتفع مع 50%.","Assumptions used":"الافتراضات المستخدمة","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"المعدلات المرجعية 2026 النرويجية الثابتة سارية المفعول 1 في يوليو؛ لا توجد تحديثات في الخلفية.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"تم تقريب المبلغ إلى أقرب NOK 10. يقوم المبلغ السنوي بضرب التقدير الشهري التقريبي بـ 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"طفل واحد لكل عملية حسابية؛ القدرة على الدفع، والأطفال الآخرون، والضريبة الكاملة، ودخل الطفل، والحالات الخاصة لم يتم تصميمها.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"تبقى جميع الإدخالات والحسابات في علامة تبويب المتصفح هذه. لا يتم تحميل أو تخزين أي شيء بواسطة هذه الأداة.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · قواعد وإرشادات دعم الطفل","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · المعدلات المرجعية وخصومات الزيارة 2026","Norwegian child support regulation":"اللائحة التنظيمية لدعم الطفل النرويجية","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"تحقق من إرشادات الملاحة الحالية والآلة الحاسبة الرسمية","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"bg":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Норвежка програма за оценка на издръжката на деца","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Норвежки калкулатор за издръжка на дете 2026 — Оценка на частно споразумение","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Разгледайте опростен сценарий за месечна издръжка на деца при норвежки 2026 референтни ставки. Въведете възрастта на детето, доходите на всеки родител, разходите за гледане на деца, пребиваване и посещение, за да видите допусканията и прогнозната сума.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Използвайте тази частна прогноза за планиране, за да обсъдите месечната подкрепа на едно дете. Базираните на възрастта референтни цифри и отстъпките за посещения следват датирани норвежки 2026 таблици; езикът на тази страница никога не променя страната или правилата.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Изпълнява се в този браузър. Цифрите, които въвеждате, не се изпращат на сървър или се запазват от този инструмент.","Example":"Пример","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"За дете на възраст 6–10 референтната цена на 2026 преди грижи за деца е NOK 7,523 в потреблението плюс NOK 3,811 за жилище, минус NOK 2,012 обикновени детски надбавки: NOK 9,322. С годишни доходи на родителите от NOK 600,000 и NOK 400,000 и клас на посещение 2, опростената оценка за едно жилище е около 3,900 NOK на месец след кредита за посещение NOK 1,690 и закръглянето.","How the estimate works":"Как работи оценката","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Инструментът добавя 2026 потребление на базата на възрастта и сумата на жилище, добавя допустимите нетни разходи за грижи за деца, които въвеждате, и изважда обикновените детски надбавки. За един основен дом той разпределя тези разходи, като използва двата въведени годишни дохода, прилага 5/6 таван на разходите и 25% таван на доходите, изважда 2026 кредита за посещение и закръгля до най-близката NOK 10. За споделено пребиваване той оценява дела на родителя с по-високи доходи над 50%.","Common questions":"Често срещани въпроси","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Това определя ли правно обвързваща сума?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Бр. Родителите могат да се споразумеят насаме и само NAV взема публично решение. Това е опростено сравнение, а не решение за NAV или неговия пълен калкулатор.","Does page language change these rules?":"Езикът на страницата променя ли тези правила?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Бр. Интерфейсът е преведен, но показаните курсове и формула са норвежки и са с дата 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Защо тарифите имат дата?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV и Министерството актуализират референтните суми през годината, обикновено от 1 юли. Тази версия използва ефективни тарифи 1 юли 2026; проверете свързаните официални таблици, преди да разчитате на резултат.","Scope and limits":"Обхват и ограничения","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Само Норвегия; едно дете на изчисление, под 18. Този опростен сценарий не възпроизвежда пълната дефиниция на дохода на NAV, изчисление на данъка и платежоспособността, подкрепа за отглеждане на деца/данъчни облекчения, детски доходи, разпределение на няколко деца, необичайни графици за посещения, допълнителна подкрепа или международни случаи. Въведената от потребителя сума за грижи за деца трябва да бъде отговарящата на условията нетна месечна сума след всяка подкрепа или удръжки, за които потребителят знае, че се прилагат. Доходът е опростен годишен брутен доход, а не официална оценка на NAV. Не го използвайте като награда, правен съвет или обещание за това какво трябва да плати някой от родителите.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Оценете сценария на частно споразумение","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Само за норвежки правила · 2026 справочни таблици в сила 1 юли · отметнато 17 октомври 2026 · езикът не променя държавата.","Child age group":"Детска възрастова група","0–5 years":"0–5 години","6–10 years":"6–10 години","11–14 years":"11–14 години","15 years and older":"15 години и повече","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Годишен брутен доход на родител, плащащ издръжка, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Годишен брутен доход на другия родител, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Уредба за пребиваване на дете","One primary home":"Един основен дом","Shared residence":"Споделено жилище","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Допустими нетни разходи за грижи за деца на месец, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Optional. Въведете само месечната сума, която смятате, че може да бъде включена след някаква подкрепа или данъчни облекчения; инструментът не може да определи допустимостта.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Обикновена детска надбавка на месец, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Клас на посещение, използван за отстъпката","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Без отстъпка / по-малко от 2 нощувки на месец","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Клас 1 · около 2–3 нощувки на месец","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Клас 2 · около 4–8 нощувки на месец","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Клас 3 · около 9–13 нощувки на месец","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Клас 4 · около 14–15 нощувки на месец","Estimate monthly amount":"Приблизителна месечна сума","Clear entries":"Изчистване на записите","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Въведете годишния брутен доход на двамата родители и възрастовата група на детето.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Сценарий, изчислен на това устройство. NAV решава официални дела.","Entries cleared.":"Записите са изчистени.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Проверете записите за доход, възраст, клас на посещение и месечни разходи.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Опростен месечен сценарий","Estimated monthly transfer":"Очакван месечен трансфер","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Прогнозна сума за 12 месеца","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Месечна база на разходите за поддръжка","Age-based consumption reference":"Справка за консумация въз основа на възрастта","Standard housing reference":"Стандартен корпус","Childcare amount entered":"Въведена сума за грижи за деца","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Извадени обикновени детски надбавки","Income share before ceilings":"Дял от дохода преди тавани","Estimate before visitation credit":"Прогноза преди кредит за посещение","Visitation credit":"Кредит за посещение","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 таван на разходите за поддръжка","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% таван на годишния доход на месец","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Отговорен родител в този сценарий","Parent entered as paying":"Родител, въведен като плащащ","Other parent":"Друг родител","Higher-income parent":"Родител с по-високи доходи","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"За споделено жилище инструментът сравнява дела на дохода на родителя с по-високи доходи със 50%.","Assumptions used":"Използвани предположения","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Статични норвежки 2026 референтни курсове в сила 1 юли; няма фонови актуализации.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Сумата е закръглена до най-близката NOK 10. Годишната сума умножава закръглената месечна оценка по 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Едно дете на изчисление; платежоспособност, други деца, пълен данък, детски доходи и специални случаи не се моделират.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Всички записи и изчисления остават в този раздел на браузъра. Нищо не се качва или съхранява от този инструмент.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · правила и насоки за издръжка на деца","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 референтни ставки и удръжки за посещения","Norwegian child support regulation":"Норвежко законодателство за издръжката на деца","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Проверете текущите насоки за NAV и официалния калкулатор","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"bn":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"নরওয়েজিয়ান চাইল্ড সাপোর্ট এস্টিমেটর","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"নরওয়ে চাইল্ড সাপোর্ট ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — ব্যক্তিগত চুক্তি অনুমান","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"নরওয়েজিয়ান 2026 রেফারেন্স রেটের অধীনে একটি সরলীকৃত মাসিক শিশু-সমর্থন পরিস্থিতি অন্বেষণ করুন। অনুমান এবং আনুমানিক পরিমাণ দেখতে শিশুর বয়স, প্রতিটি পিতামাতার আয়, শিশু যত্নের খরচ, বাসস্থান এবং পরিদর্শন লিখুন।","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"একটি সন্তানের মাসিক সহায়তা নিয়ে আলোচনা করতে এই ব্যক্তিগত পরিকল্পনা অনুমান ব্যবহার করুন। বয়স ভিত্তিক রেফারেন্স পরিসংখ্যান এবং পরিদর্শন ডিসকাউন্ট তারিখের নরওয়েজিয়ান 2026 টেবিল অনুসরণ করে; এই পৃষ্ঠার ভাষা কখনই দেশ বা নিয়ম পরিবর্তন করে না।","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"এই ব্রাউজারে চলে। আপনি যে পরিসংখ্যানগুলি লিখছেন তা কোনও সার্ভারে পাঠানো হয় না বা এই সরঞ্জাম দ্বারা সংরক্ষিত হয় না।","Example":"উদাহরণ","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"বয়সী একটি শিশুর জন্য6-10, the2026শিশু যত্ন আগে রেফারেন্স খরচ NOK7,523খরচ প্লাস NOK3,811আবাসন জন্য, কম NOK2,012সাধারণ শিশু সুবিধা: NOK9,322. NOK এর বার্ষিক পিতামাতার আয় সহ600,000এবং NOK400,000এবং পরিদর্শন ক্লাস2, সরলীকৃত এক-বাড়ির অনুমান NOK সম্পর্কে3,900NOK পরে প্রতি মাসে1,690পরিদর্শন ক্রেডিট এবং রাউন্ডিং।","How the estimate works":"অনুমান কিভাবে কাজ করে","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"টুল যোগ করে2026বয়স-ভিত্তিক খরচের পরিমাণ এবং আবাসনের পরিমাণ, আপনার প্রবেশ করা যোগ্য নেট চাইল্ড কেয়ার খরচ যোগ করে এবং সাধারণ শিশু সুবিধা বিয়োগ করে। একটি প্রাথমিক বাড়ির জন্য, এটি দুটি প্রবেশ করা বার্ষিক আয় ব্যবহার করে এই খরচ বরাদ্দ করে, প্রযোজ্য5/6খরচ সিলিং এবং25% আয়ের সীমা, বিয়োগ করে2026ভিজিটেশন ক্রেডিট এবং নিকটতম NOK তে রাউন্ড10. শেয়ার্ড রেসিডেন্সের জন্য এটি উপরে উচ্চ আয়ের পিতামাতার শেয়ার অনুমান করে50%","Common questions":"সাধারণ প্রশ্ন","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"এটি কি একটি আইনত বাধ্যতামূলক পরিমাণ সেট করে?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"না। পিতামাতা ব্যক্তিগতভাবে সম্মত হতে পারেন, এবং NAV একাই সর্বজনীন সিদ্ধান্ত নেয়। এটি একটি সরলীকৃত তুলনা, একটি NAV সিদ্ধান্ত বা এর সম্পূর্ণ ক্যালকুলেটর নয়।","Does page language change these rules?":"পৃষ্ঠার ভাষা কি এই নিয়ম পরিবর্তন করে?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"না। ইন্টারফেসটি অনুবাদ করা হয়েছে, কিন্তু দেখানো হার এবং সূত্র নরওয়েজিয়ান এবং তারিখের 2026।","Why do the rates have a date?":"কেন হার একটি তারিখ আছে?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV এবং মন্ত্রণালয় আপডেট রেফারেন্স পরিমাণ বছরের মধ্যে, সাধারণত 1 জুলাই থেকে। এই সংস্করণটি কার্যকর 1 জুলাই 2026 হার ব্যবহার করে; ফলাফলের উপর নির্ভর করার আগে লিঙ্কযুক্ত অফিসিয়াল টেবিলগুলি পরীক্ষা করুন।","Scope and limits":"সুযোগ এবং সীমা","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"শুধু নরওয়ে; 18 এর অধীনে হিসাব প্রতি একটি শিশু। এই সরলীকৃত দৃশ্যটি NAV-এর সম্পূর্ণ আয়ের সংজ্ঞা, ট্যাক্স এবং ক্যাপাসিটি-টু-পে হিসাব, ​​চাইল্ড কেয়ার সাপোর্ট/ট্যাক্স রিলিফ, চাইল্ড ইনকাম, মাল্টিপল-চাইল্ড অ্যালোকেশন, অস্বাভাবিক ভিজিটেশন সিডিউল, অতিরিক্ত সাপোর্ট বা আন্তর্জাতিক ক্ষেত্রে পুনরুত্পাদন করে না। ব্যবহারকারীর দ্বারা প্রবেশ করা চাইল্ড কেয়ারের পরিমাণটি যোগ্য নেট মাসিক পরিমাণ হওয়া উচিত যে কোনও সহায়তা বা কর্তনের পরে যা ব্যবহারকারী জানেন প্রযোজ্য৷ আয় হল সরলীকৃত বার্ষিক মোট আয়, কোন সরকারী NAV মূল্যায়ন নয়। এটিকে পুরস্কার, আইনি পরামর্শ বা পিতামাতাকে যা দিতে হবে তার প্রতিশ্রুতি হিসাবে ব্যবহার করবেন না।","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"একটি ব্যক্তিগত চুক্তির পরিস্থিতি অনুমান করুন","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"শুধু নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম · 2026 রেফারেন্স টেবিল কার্যকর 1 জুলাই · চেক করা হয়েছে 17 অক্টোবর 2026 · ভাষা দেশ পরিবর্তন করে না।","Child age group":"শিশু বয়সের গ্রুপ","0–5 years":"0–5 বছর","6–10 years":"6–10 বছর","11–14 years":"11–14 বছর","15 years and older":"15 বছর বা তার বেশি","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"অভিভাবকের অর্থ প্রদানের বার্ষিক মোট আয়, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"অন্য অভিভাবকের বার্ষিক মোট আয়, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"শিশুর বসবাসের ব্যবস্থা","One primary home":"একটি প্রাথমিক বাড়ি","Shared residence":"ভাগ করা বাসস্থান","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"প্রতি মাসে যোগ্য নেট চাইল্ড কেয়ার খরচ, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"ঐচ্ছিক। শুধুমাত্র মাসিক পরিমাণ লিখুন যা আপনি বিশ্বাস করেন যে কোনো সহায়তা বা ট্যাক্স ত্রাণের পরে অন্তর্ভুক্ত করা যেতে পারে; টুলটি যোগ্যতা নির্ধারণ করতে পারে না।","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"সাধারণ শিশু প্রতি মাসে বেনিফিট, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"ছাড়ের জন্য ব্যবহৃত পরিদর্শন ক্লাস","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"কোন ছাড় নেই / প্রতি মাসে 2 রাতের কম","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"ক্লাস 1 · প্রতি মাসে প্রায় 2–3 রাত","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"ক্লাস 2 · প্রতি মাসে প্রায় 4–8 রাত","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"ক্লাস 3 · প্রতি মাসে প্রায় 9–13 রাত","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"ক্লাস 4 · প্রতি মাসে প্রায় 14–15 রাত","Estimate monthly amount":"আনুমানিক মাসিক পরিমাণ","Clear entries":"এন্ট্রি সাফ করুন","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"পিতামাতার বার্ষিক মোট আয় এবং সন্তানের বয়স উভয়ই লিখুন।","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"এই ডিভাইসে গণনা করা দৃশ্যকল্প। NAV সরকারী মামলার সিদ্ধান্ত নেয়।","Entries cleared.":"এন্ট্রিগুলি সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"আয়, বয়স, পরিদর্শন শ্রেণী এবং মাসিক খরচ এন্ট্রি পরীক্ষা করুন।","Simplified monthly scenario":"সরলীকৃত মাসিক দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimated monthly transfer":"আনুমানিক মাসিক স্থানান্তর","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 মাস ধরে আনুমানিক পরিমাণ","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"মাসিক রক্ষণাবেক্ষণ-খরচের ভিত্তিতে","Age-based consumption reference":"বয়স-ভিত্তিক খরচ রেফারেন্স","Standard housing reference":"স্ট্যান্ডার্ড হাউজিং রেফারেন্স","Childcare amount entered":"শিশু যত্নের পরিমাণ প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে৷","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"সাধারণ শিশুর সুবিধা বিয়োগ করা হয়েছে","Income share before ceilings":"সিলিং এর আগে আয়ের ভাগ","Estimate before visitation credit":"ভিজিটেশন ক্রেডিট আগে অনুমান","Visitation credit":"ভিজিটেশন ক্রেডিট","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 রক্ষণাবেক্ষণ-খরচ সিলিং","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% প্রতি মাসে বার্ষিক আয়ের সীমা","Parent responsible in this scenario":"এই পরিস্থিতিতে দায়ী অভিভাবক","Parent entered as paying":"অভিভাবক অর্থপ্রদান হিসাবে প্রবেশ করেছেন৷","Other parent":"অন্যান্য অভিভাবক","Higher-income parent":"উচ্চ আয়ের অভিভাবক","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"শেয়ারড রেসিডেন্সের জন্য, টুলটি 50% এর সাথে উচ্চ-আয়ের পিতামাতার আয়ের ভাগের তুলনা করে।","Assumptions used":"অনুমান ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"স্ট্যাটিক নরওয়েজিয়ান 2026 রেফারেন্স রেট কার্যকর 1 জুলাই; কোনো ব্যাকগ্রাউন্ড আপডেট নেই।","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"পরিমাণটি নিকটতম NOK 10-এ বৃত্তাকার। বার্ষিক পরিমাণ বৃত্তাকার মাসিক অনুমানকে 12 দ্বারা গুণ করে।","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"প্রতি গণনায় একটি শিশু; ক্ষমতা-টু-পে, অন্যান্য শিশু, সম্পূর্ণ কর, শিশু আয় এবং বিশেষ ক্ষেত্রে মডেল করা হয় না।","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"সমস্ত এন্ট্রি এবং গণনা এই ব্রাউজার ট্যাবে থাকে। এই টুল দ্বারা কিছুই আপলোড বা সংরক্ষণ করা হয় না।","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · শিশু সহায়তার নিয়ম এবং নির্দেশিকা","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 রেফারেন্স রেট এবং ভিজিটেশন ডিডাকশন","Norwegian child support regulation":"নরওয়েজিয়ান চাইল্ড সাপোর্ট রেগুলেশন","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"বর্তমান NAV নির্দেশিকা এবং অফিসিয়াল ক্যালকুলেটর চেক করুন","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ca":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Estimador de suport infantil noruec","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Calculadora de suport infantil de Noruega 2026 — Estimació de l'acord privat","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Exploreu un escenari simplificat de manteniment dels fills mensual amb tarifes de referència noruegues 2026. Introduïu l'edat del fill, els ingressos de cada pare, els costos de cura dels fills, la residència i les visites per veure les hipòtesis i l'import estimat.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Utilitzeu aquesta estimació de planificació privada per discutir el suport mensual d'un fill. Les xifres de referència per edat i els descomptes de visites segueixen les taules 2026 noruegues amb data; l'idioma d'aquesta pàgina no canvia mai el país ni les normes.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"S'executa en aquest navegador. Les xifres que introduïu no s'envien a un servidor ni es desen amb aquesta eina.","Example":"Exemple","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Per a un nen d'edat6–10, el2026el cost de referència abans de la guarderia és de NOK7,523en consum més NOK3,811per a l'habitatge, menys NOK2,012prestació ordinària per fills: NOK9,322. Amb ingressos anuals dels pares de NOK600,000i NOK400,000i classe de visita2, l'estimació simplificada d'una sola llar és d'aproximadament NOK3,900al mes després del NOK1,690crèdit de visites i arrodoniment.","How the estimate works":"Com funciona l'estimació","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"L'eina afegeix el2026l'import del consum basat en l'edat i l'import de l'habitatge, afegeix el cost net de cura dels fills elegible que introduïu i resta la prestació ordinària per fills. Per a un habitatge principal, assigna aquest cost utilitzant els dos ingressos anuals introduïts, s'aplica el5/6sostre de costos i25% sostre d'ingressos, resta el2026crèdit de visites i arrodoniments al NOK més proper10. Per a la residència compartida, estima la quota dels progenitors amb més ingressos anterior50%.","Common questions":"Preguntes habituals","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Això estableix un import legalment vinculant?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"No. Els pares poden estar d'acord en privat, i només NAV fa una determinació pública. Aquesta és una comparació simplificada, no una decisió NAV o la seva calculadora completa.","Does page language change these rules?":"L'idioma de la pàgina canvia aquestes regles?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"No. La interfície està traduïda, però les tarifes i la fórmula que es mostren són noruecs i tenen data 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Per què les tarifes tenen data?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV i el Ministeri actualitzen els imports de referència durant l'any, normalment a partir de 1 juliol. Aquesta versió utilitza tarifes efectives 1 juliol 2026; comproveu les taules oficials enllaçades abans de confiar en un resultat.","Scope and limits":"Àmbit i límits","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Només Noruega; un fill per càlcul, sota 18. Aquest escenari simplificat no reprodueix la definició completa d'ingressos de NAV, càlcul d'impostos i capacitat de pagament, suport per a la cura de nens/alleujament fiscal, ingressos per fills, assignació de diversos fills, programes de visites inusuals, suport addicional o casos internacionals. L'import introduït per l'usuari per a la llar d'infants ha de ser l'import net mensual elegible després de qualsevol suport o deduccions que l'usuari sàpiga que s'apliquen. Els ingressos són ingressos bruts anuals simplificats, no una valoració oficial del NAV. No l'utilitzeu com a premi, assessorament legal o com a promesa del que ha de pagar qualsevol dels pares.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Estima un escenari d'acord privat","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Només regles noruegues · 2026 taules de referència vigents 1 juliol · marcat 17 Octubre 2026 · l'idioma no canvia el país.","Child age group":"Grup d'edat infantil","0–5 years":"0–5 anys","6–10 years":"6–10 anys","11–14 years":"11–14 anys","15 years and older":"15 anys i més","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Ingressos bruts anuals dels pares que paguen la manutenció, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Ingressos bruts anuals de l'altre progenitor, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Arranjament de residència infantil","One primary home":"Un habitatge principal","Shared residence":"Residència compartida","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Cost net per a la cura dels nens elegible per mes, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opcional. Introduïu només l'import mensual que creieu que es pot incloure després de qualsevol suport o desgravació fiscal; l'eina no pot determinar l'elegibilitat.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Pressió ordinària per fill al mes, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Classe de visita utilitzada per al descompte","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Sense descompte / menys de 2 nits al mes","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Classe 1 · aproximadament 2–3 nits al mes","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Classe 2 · aproximadament 4–8 nits al mes","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Classe 3 · aproximadament 9–13 nits al mes","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Classe 4 · aproximadament 14–15 nits al mes","Estimate monthly amount":"Import mensual estimat","Clear entries":"Esborra les entrades","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Introduïu els ingressos bruts anuals dels dos pares i el grup d'edat del fill.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Escenari calculat en aquest dispositiu. NAV decideix els casos oficials.","Entries cleared.":"Entrades esborrades.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Comproveu els ingressos, l'edat, la classe de visites i les entrades de costos mensuals.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Escenari mensual simplificat","Estimated monthly transfer":"Transferència mensual estimada","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Import estimat durant 12 mesos","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Cost de manteniment mensual","Age-based consumption reference":"Referència de consum basat en l'edat","Standard housing reference":"Referència d'habitatge estàndard","Childcare amount entered":"S'ha introduït l'import de la cura infantil","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Prestació ordinària per fills restada","Income share before ceilings":"Participació dels ingressos abans dels sostres","Estimate before visitation credit":"Estimació abans del crèdit de visita","Visitation credit":"Crèdit de visita","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 sostre de costos de manteniment","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% màxim d'ingressos anuals per mes","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Pare responsable en aquest escenari","Parent entered as paying":"El pare s'ha introduït com a pagador","Other parent":"Un altre pare","Higher-income parent":"Pare i mare amb ingressos més alts","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Per a la residència compartida, l'eina compara la quota d'ingressos dels pares amb ingressos més alts amb 50%.","Assumptions used":"Hipotecs utilitzats","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Taxes de referència estàtiques noruecs 2026 efectives 1 juliol; sense actualitzacions de fons.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"L'import s'arrodoneix al NOK 10 més proper. L'import anual multiplica l'estimació mensual arrodonida per 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Un fill per càlcul; La capacitat de pagament, altres fills, l'impost complet, la renda dels fills i els casos especials no es modelen.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Totes les entrades i els càlculs es mantenen en aquesta pestanya del navegador. Aquesta eina no carrega ni emmagatzema res.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · Normes i orientació sobre la manutenció dels nens","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 taxes de referència i deduccions de visites","Norwegian child support regulation":"Noruega noruega sobre la manutenció dels fills","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Comproveu la guia NAV actual i la calculadora oficial","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"de":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Norwegischer Kindergeldschätzer","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norwegischer Kindergeldrechner 2026 – Kostenvoranschlag für private Vereinbarungen","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Entdecken Sie ein vereinfachtes monatliches Kindesunterhaltsszenario unter norwegischen 2026-Referenzsätzen. Geben Sie das Alter des Kindes, das Einkommen jedes Elternteils, die Kosten für die Kinderbetreuung, den Wohnort und den Besuch ein, um die Annahmen und den geschätzten Betrag anzuzeigen.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Verwenden Sie diesen privaten Planungsvoranschlag, um den monatlichen Unterhalt eines Kindes zu besprechen. Die altersbezogenen Referenzzahlen und Besuchsermäßigungen folgen datierten norwegischen 2026-Tabellen; Die Sprache dieser Seite ändert niemals das Land oder die Regeln.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Läuft in diesem Browser. Die von Ihnen eingegebenen Zahlen werden von diesem Tool nicht an einen Server gesendet oder gespeichert.","Example":"Beispiel","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Für ein Kind im Alter von 6–10 betragen die Referenzkosten von 2026 vor der Kinderbetreuung NOK 7,523 an Verbrauch plus NOK 3,811 für die Unterkunft, abzüglich NOK 2,012 normales Kindergeld: NOK 9,322. Bei einem jährlichen Elterneinkommen von NOK 600,000 und NOK 400,000 und der Besuchsklasse 2 beträgt die vereinfachte Einfamilienhausschätzung etwa NOK 3,900 pro Monat nach der NOK 1,690-Besuchsgutschrift und Rundung.","How the estimate works":"So funktioniert die Schätzung","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Das Tool fügt das hinzu2026Dabei werden der altersabhängige Verbrauchsbetrag und der Wohnbetrag berücksichtigt, die von Ihnen eingegebenen förderfähigen Nettokosten für die Kinderbetreuung addiert und das normale Kindergeld abgezogen. Für einen Hauptwohnsitz werden diese Kosten anhand der beiden eingegebenen Jahreseinkommen verrechnet5/6Kostenobergrenze und25% Einkommensobergrenze, subtrahiert die2026Besuchsgutschrift und Aufrundung auf die nächste NOK10. Für den gemeinsamen Wohnsitz wird oben der Anteil des Elternteils mit dem höheren Einkommen geschätzt50%.","Common questions":"Häufige Fragen","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Ist damit ein rechtlich verbindlicher Betrag festgelegt?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Nein. Die Eltern können privat zustimmen und NAV allein trifft eine öffentliche Entscheidung. Dies ist ein vereinfachter Vergleich, keine NAV-Entscheidung oder deren vollständiger Rechner.","Does page language change these rules?":"Ändert die Seitensprache diese Regeln?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Nein. Die Benutzeroberfläche ist übersetzt, aber die angezeigten Tarife und Formeln sind norwegisch und datiert 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Warum haben die Tarife ein Datum?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV und das Ministerium aktualisieren die Referenzbeträge im Laufe des Jahres, normalerweise ab 1 Juli. Diese Version verwendet Tarife mit Gültigkeit ab 1 Juli 2026; Überprüfen Sie die verlinkten offiziellen Tabellen, bevor Sie sich auf ein Ergebnis verlassen.","Scope and limits":"Umfang und Grenzen","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Nur Norwegen; ein Kind pro Berechnung, unter 18. Dieses vereinfachte Szenario gibt nicht die vollständige Einkommensdefinition, Steuer- und Zahlungsfähigkeitsberechnung, Kinderbetreuungsunterstützung/Steuererleichterung, Kindereinkommen, Mehrkinderzuteilung, ungewöhnliche Besuchspläne, zusätzliche Unterstützung oder internationale Fälle von NAV wieder. Der vom Benutzer eingegebene Betrag für die Kinderbetreuung sollte dem förderfähigen monatlichen Nettobetrag nach etwaigen Zuschüssen oder Abzügen entsprechen, von denen der Benutzer weiß, dass sie anfallen. Beim Einkommen handelt es sich um ein vereinfachtes jährliches Bruttoeinkommen, nicht um eine offizielle NAV-Bewertung. Verwenden Sie es nicht als Auszeichnung, Rechtsberatung oder Versprechen, was ein Elternteil zahlen muss.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Schätzen Sie ein privates Vereinbarungsszenario","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Nur norwegische Regeln · 2026 Referenztabellen gültig 1 Juli · geprüft 17 Oktober 2026 · Sprache ändert das Land nicht.","Child age group":"Altersgruppe der Kinder","0–5 years":"0–5 Jahre","6–10 years":"6–10 Jahre","11–14 years":"11–14 Jahre","15 years and older":"15 Jahre und älter","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Jährliches Bruttoeinkommen des unterhaltszahlenden Elternteils, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Jährliches Bruttoeinkommen des anderen Elternteils, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Aufenthaltsvereinbarung für Kinder","One primary home":"Ein Hauptwohnsitz","Shared residence":"Gemeinsamer Wohnsitz","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Anrechenbare Netto-Kinderbetreuungskosten pro Monat, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Optional. Geben Sie nur den monatlichen Betrag ein, der Ihrer Meinung nach nach etwaiger Unterstützung oder Steuererleichterung enthalten sein könnte; Das Tool kann die Berechtigung nicht ermitteln.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Normales Kindergeld pro Monat, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Für den Rabatt verwendete Besuchsklasse","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Kein Rabatt / weniger als 2 Nächte pro Monat","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Klasse 1 · etwa 2–3 Nächte pro Monat","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Klasse 2 · etwa 4–8 Nächte pro Monat","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Klasse 3 · etwa 9–13 Nächte pro Monat","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Klasse 4 · etwa 14–15 Nächte pro Monat","Estimate monthly amount":"Schätzen Sie den monatlichen Betrag","Clear entries":"Einträge löschen","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Geben Sie das jährliche Bruttoeinkommen beider Elternteile und die Altersgruppe des Kindes ein.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Szenario auf diesem Gerät berechnet. NAV entscheidet über offizielle Fälle.","Entries cleared.":"Einträge gelöscht.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Überprüfen Sie die Einträge zu Einkommen, Alter, Besuchsklasse und monatlichen Kosten.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Vereinfachtes monatliches Szenario","Estimated monthly transfer":"Geschätzte monatliche Überweisung","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Geschätzter Betrag über 12 Monate","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Monatliche Wartungskostenbasis","Age-based consumption reference":"Altersbezogene Verbrauchsreferenz","Standard housing reference":"Standardgehäusereferenz","Childcare amount entered":"Kinderbetreuungsbetrag eingegeben","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Normales Kindergeld abgezogen","Income share before ceilings":"Einkommensanteil vor Obergrenzen","Estimate before visitation credit":"Kostenvoranschlag vor Besichtigungsgutschrift","Visitation credit":"Besuchsgutschrift","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 Wartungskostenobergrenze","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% Jahreseinkommensobergrenze pro Monat","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Übergeordneter Verantwortlicher in diesem Szenario","Parent entered as paying":"Als zahlender Elternteil eingegeben","Other parent":"Anderes übergeordnetes Element","Higher-income parent":"Elternteil mit höherem Einkommen","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Bei Wohngemeinschaften vergleicht das Tool den Einkommensanteil des Elternteils mit dem höheren Einkommen mit 50 %.","Assumptions used":"Verwendete Annahmen","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Statische norwegische 2026-Referenzkurse gültig 1 Juli; keine Hintergrundaktualisierungen.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Der Betrag wird auf den nächsten NOK 10 gerundet. Der jährliche Betrag multipliziert die gerundete monatliche Schätzung mit 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Ein Kind pro Berechnung; Zahlungsfähigkeit, andere Kinder, Gesamtsteuer, Kindereinkommen und Sonderfälle werden nicht modelliert.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Alle Eingaben und Berechnungen bleiben in diesem Browser-Tab. Von diesem Tool wird nichts hochgeladen oder gespeichert.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · Regeln und Leitlinien zum Unterhalt von Kindern","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 Referenztarife und Besuchsabzüge","Norwegian child support regulation":"Norwegische Kindesunterhaltsregelung","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Überprüfen Sie die aktuelle NAV-Prognose und den offiziellen Rechner","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"el":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Νορβηγικός Εκτιμητής Υποστήριξης Παιδιού","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Εκτίμηση ιδιωτικού συμφωνητικού","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Εξερευνήστε ένα απλοποιημένο μηνιαίο σενάριο υποστήριξης παιδιών σύμφωνα με τα νορβηγικά ποσοστά αναφοράς 2026. Εισαγάγετε την ηλικία του παιδιού, το εισόδημα κάθε γονέα, τα έξοδα παιδικής φροντίδας, τη διαμονή και την επίσκεψη για να δείτε τις υποθέσεις και το εκτιμώμενο ποσό.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε αυτήν την εκτίμηση ιδιωτικού προγραμματισμού για να συζητήσετε τη μηνιαία υποστήριξη ενός παιδιού. Τα στοιχεία αναφοράς βάσει ηλικίας και οι εκπτώσεις επισκέψεων ακολουθούν τους πίνακες 2026 με ημερομηνία Νορβηγίας. η γλώσσα αυτής της σελίδας δεν αλλάζει ποτέ τη χώρα ή τους κανόνες.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Εκτελείται σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Οι αριθμοί που εισάγετε δεν αποστέλλονται σε διακομιστή ούτε αποθηκεύονται από αυτό το εργαλείο.","Example":"Παράδειγμα","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Για ένα παιδί ηλικίας6–10, το2026Το κόστος αναφοράς πριν από τη φροντίδα των παιδιών είναι ΝΟΚ7,523σε κατανάλωση συν ΝΟΚ3,811για στέγαση, λιγότερο NOK2,012συνηθισμένο επίδομα τέκνου: ΝΟΚ9,322. Με ετήσια εισοδήματα γονέων ΝΟΚ600,000και ΝΟΚ400,000και μάθημα επισκέψεων2, η απλοποιημένη εκτίμηση για ένα σπίτι είναι περίπου NOK3,900ανά μήνα μετά τον ΝΟΚ1,690πίστωση επίσκεψης και στρογγυλοποίηση.","How the estimate works":"Πώς λειτουργεί η εκτίμηση","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Το εργαλείο προσθέτει το2026Το ποσό κατανάλωσης με βάση την ηλικία και το ποσό στέγασης, προσθέτει το επιλέξιμο καθαρό κόστος παιδικής μέριμνας που εισάγετε και αφαιρεί το συνηθισμένο επίδομα παιδιού. Για μια κύρια κατοικία, κατανέμει αυτό το κόστος χρησιμοποιώντας τα δύο εισαγόμενα ετήσια εισοδήματα, ισχύει το5/6ανώτατο όριο κόστους και25% εισοδήματος ανώτατο όριο, αφαιρεί το2026πίστωση επίσκεψης και γύρους στον πλησιέστερο NOK10. Για την κοινόχρηστη κατοικία εκτιμά το μερίδιο του γονέα με υψηλότερο εισόδημα παραπάνω50%.","Common questions":"Συνήθεις ερωτήσεις","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Αυτό ορίζει ένα νομικά δεσμευτικό ποσό;","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Όχι. Οι γονείς μπορούν να συμφωνήσουν ιδιωτικά, και η NAV από μόνη της λαμβάνει δημόσια απόφαση. Αυτή είναι μια απλοποιημένη σύγκριση, όχι μια απόφαση NAV ή η πλήρης αριθμομηχανή της.","Does page language change these rules?":"Αλλάζει η γλώσσα της σελίδας αυτούς τους κανόνες;","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Όχι. Η διεπαφή έχει μεταφραστεί, αλλά οι τιμές και ο τύπος που εμφανίζονται είναι νορβηγικά και έχουν ημερομηνία 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Γιατί οι τιμές έχουν ημερομηνία;","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"Η NAV και το Υπουργείο ενημερώνουν τα ποσά αναφοράς κατά τη διάρκεια του έτους, συνήθως από 1 Ιουλίου. Αυτή η έκδοση χρησιμοποιεί ισχύουσες τιμές 1 Ιουλίου 2026; ελέγξτε τους συνδεδεμένους επίσημους πίνακες πριν βασιστείτε σε ένα αποτέλεσμα.","Scope and limits":"Εύρος και όρια","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Μόνο Νορβηγία. ένα παιδί ανά υπολογισμό, κάτω από το 18. Αυτό το απλοποιημένο σενάριο δεν αναπαράγει τον πλήρη ορισμό του εισοδήματος της NAV, τον υπολογισμό του φόρου και της ικανότητας πληρωμής, την υποστήριξη παιδικής φροντίδας/φοροελαφρύνσεις, το εισόδημα παιδιών, την κατανομή πολλών παιδιών, τα ασυνήθιστα προγράμματα επισκέψεων, την πρόσθετη υποστήριξη ή διεθνείς υποθέσεις. Το ποσό παιδικής μέριμνας που έχει καταχωριστεί από τον χρήστη θα πρέπει να είναι το επιλέξιμο καθαρό μηνιαίο ποσό μετά από οποιαδήποτε υποστήριξη ή κρατήσεις που ο χρήστης γνωρίζει ότι ισχύουν. Το εισόδημα είναι το απλοποιημένο ετήσιο ακαθάριστο εισόδημα, όχι μια επίσημη αξιολόγηση ΚΑΕ. Μην το χρησιμοποιείτε ως βραβείο, νομική συμβουλή ή υπόσχεση για το τι πρέπει να πληρώσει ο ένας από τους δύο γονείς.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Εκτιμήστε ένα σενάριο ιδιωτικής συμφωνίας","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Μόνο για νορβηγικούς κανόνες · 2026 πίνακες αναφοράς σε ισχύ 1 Ιούλιος · ελεγμένο 17 Οκτώβριος 2026 · η γλώσσα δεν αλλάζει τη χώρα.","Child age group":"Ηλικιακή ομάδα παιδιών","0–5 years":"0–5 έτη","6–10 years":"6–10 έτη","11–14 years":"11–14 έτη","15 years and older":"15 ετών και άνω","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Ετήσιο ακαθάριστο εισόδημα της γονικής υποστήριξης που καταβάλλει, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Ετήσιο ακαθάριστο εισόδημα της άλλης μητρικής εταιρείας, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Διαρρύθμιση παιδικής κατοικίας","One primary home":"Ένα βασικό σπίτι","Shared residence":"Κοινή κατοικία","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Επιλέξιμο καθαρό κόστος παιδικής μέριμνας ανά μήνα, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Προαιρετικό. Εισαγάγετε μόνο το μηνιαίο ποσό που πιστεύετε ότι μπορεί να συμπεριληφθεί μετά από οποιαδήποτε υποστήριξη ή φορολογική ελάφρυνση. το εργαλείο δεν μπορεί να καθορίσει την καταλληλότητα.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Κανικό επίδομα τέκνων ανά μήνα, ΝΟΚ","Visitation class used for the discount":"Τάξη επίσκεψης που χρησιμοποιείται για την έκπτωση","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Καμία έκπτωση / λιγότερες από 2 διανυκτερεύσεις ανά μήνα","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Κλάση 1 · περίπου 2–3 διανυκτερεύσεις ανά μήνα","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Κλάση 2 · περίπου 4–8 διανυκτερεύσεις ανά μήνα","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Κλάση 3 · περίπου 9–13 διανυκτερεύσεις ανά μήνα","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Κλάση 4 · περίπου 14–15 διανυκτερεύσεις ανά μήνα","Estimate monthly amount":"Εκτίμηση μηνιαίου ποσού","Clear entries":"Διαγραφή καταχωρήσεων","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Εισαγάγετε το ετήσιο ακαθάριστο εισόδημα και των δύο γονέων και την ηλικιακή ομάδα του παιδιού.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Το σενάριο υπολογίζεται σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. Η NAV αποφασίζει επίσημες υποθέσεις.","Entries cleared.":"Οι καταχωρήσεις διαγράφηκαν.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Ελέγξτε το εισόδημα, την ηλικία, την τάξη επισκέψεων και τις καταχωρίσεις μηνιαίου κόστους.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Απλοποιημένο μηνιαίο σενάριο","Estimated monthly transfer":"Εκτιμώμενη μηνιαία μεταφορά","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Εκτιμώμενο ποσό για 12 μήνες","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Μηνιαία βάση κόστους συντήρησης","Age-based consumption reference":"Αναφορά κατανάλωσης βάσει ηλικίας","Standard housing reference":"Τυπική αναφορά περιβλήματος","Childcare amount entered":"Εισήγαγε ποσό παιδικής μέριμνας","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Αφαιρείται το κανονικό επίδομα τέκνου","Income share before ceilings":"Μερίδιο εισοδήματος πριν από τα ανώτατα όρια","Estimate before visitation credit":"Εκτίμηση πριν από την επίσκεψη","Visitation credit":"Πίστωση επίσκεψης","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 ανώτατο όριο κόστους συντήρησης","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% ανώτατο όριο ετήσιου εισοδήματος ανά μήνα","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Γονικός υπεύθυνος σε αυτό το σενάριο","Parent entered as paying":"Ο γονέας καταχωρίστηκε ως πληρωμή","Other parent":"Άλλος γονέας","Higher-income parent":"Γονέας με υψηλότερο εισόδημα","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Για κοινόχρηστη κατοικία, το εργαλείο συγκρίνει το μερίδιο εισοδήματος του γονέα με υψηλότερο εισόδημα με το 50%.","Assumptions used":"Υποθέσεις που χρησιμοποιούνται","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Στατικά νορβηγικά ποσοστά αναφοράς 2026 σε ισχύ 1 Ιούλιος; δεν υπάρχουν ενημερώσεις στο παρασκήνιο.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Το ποσό στρογγυλοποιείται στην πλησιέστερη NOK 10. Το ετήσιο ποσό πολλαπλασιάζει τη στρογγυλοποιημένη μηνιαία εκτίμηση επί 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Ένα παιδί ανά υπολογισμό. ικανότητα πληρωμής, λοιπά τέκνα, πλήρης φόρος, εισόδημα παιδιού και ειδικές περιπτώσεις δεν διαμορφώνονται.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Όλες οι καταχωρίσεις και οι υπολογισμοί παραμένουν σε αυτήν την καρτέλα του προγράμματος περιήγησης. Δεν μεταφορτώνεται ή αποθηκεύεται τίποτα από αυτό το εργαλείο.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · κανόνες και καθοδήγηση για την υποστήριξη παιδιών","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 ποσοστά αναφοράς και μειώσεις επισκέψεων","Norwegian child support regulation":"Νορβηγικός κανονισμός υποστήριξης παιδιών","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Ελέγξτε την τρέχουσα καθοδήγηση NAV και την επίσημη αριθμομηχανή","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"es":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Estimador de manutención infantil noruego","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Calculadora de manutención infantil de Noruega 2026 — Estimación de acuerdo privado","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Explore un escenario simplificado de manutención infantil mensual según las tasas de referencia noruegas 2026. Ingrese la edad del niño, los ingresos de cada padre, los costos de cuidado infantil, la residencia y las visitas para ver las suposiciones y el monto estimado.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Utilice esta estimación de planificación privada para analizar la manutención mensual de un niño. Las cifras de referencia basadas en la edad y los descuentos en visitas siguen las tablas noruegas 2026 fechadas; El idioma de esta página nunca cambia el país ni las reglas.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Se ejecuta en este navegador. Las cifras que ingresas no se envían a un servidor ni se guardan en esta herramienta.","Example":"Ejemplo","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Para un niño de edad 6–10, el coste de referencia 2026 antes del cuidado infantil es NOK 7,523 en consumo más NOK 3,811 para alojamiento, menos NOK 2,012 la prestación ordinaria por hijo: NOK 9,322. Con ingresos anuales de los padres de NOK 600,000 y NOK 400,000 y la clase de visitas 2, la estimación simplificada de una vivienda es de aproximadamente NOK 3,900 por mes después del crédito de visitas NOK 1,690 y el redondeo.","How the estimate works":"Cómo funciona el presupuesto","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"La herramienta suma el monto de consumo basado en la edad 2026 y el monto de vivienda, suma el costo neto elegible de cuidado de niños que ingresa y resta el beneficio por hijo ordinario. Para una vivienda principal, asigna este costo utilizando los dos ingresos anuales ingresados, aplica el techo de costo 5/6 y el techo de ingreso porcentual 25, resta el crédito de visitas 2026 y redondea al NOK 10 más cercano. Para residencia compartida, estima la participación del padre con mayores ingresos por encima del 50%.","Common questions":"Preguntas comunes","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"¿Se establece esto un importe jurídicamente vinculante?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"No. Los padres pueden llegar a un acuerdo en privado y NAV es el único que toma una determinación pública. Esta es una comparación simplificada, no una decisión de NAV ni su calculadora completa.","Does page language change these rules?":"¿El idioma de la página cambia estas reglas?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"No. La interfaz está traducida, pero las tarifas y la fórmula que se muestran son noruegas y tienen fecha 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"¿Por qué las tarifas tienen fecha?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV y el Ministerio actualizan los importes de referencia durante el año, normalmente a partir de 1 julio. Esta versión utiliza tarifas vigentes 1 julio 2026; Consulte las tablas oficiales vinculadas antes de confiar en un resultado.","Scope and limits":"Alcance y límites","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Solo Noruega; un niño por cálculo, bajo 18. Este escenario simplificado no reproduce la definición completa de ingresos, el cálculo de impuestos y capacidad de pago, la ayuda para el cuidado infantil/desgravación fiscal, los ingresos por hijos, la asignación de múltiples hijos, los horarios de visitas inusuales, la ayuda adicional o los casos internacionales de NAV. El monto de cuidado infantil ingresado por el usuario debe ser el monto mensual neto elegible después de cualquier manutención o deducción que el usuario sepa que se aplican. Los ingresos son ingresos brutos anuales simplificados, no una evaluación NAV oficial. No lo utilice como un premio, un consejo legal o una promesa de lo que cualquiera de los padres debe pagar.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Estimar un escenario de acuerdo privado","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Solo reglas noruegas · 2026 tablas de referencia vigentes 1 julio · revisado 17 octubre 2026 · el idioma no cambia el país.","Child age group":"Grupo de edad infantil","0–5 years":"0–5 años","6–10 years":"6–10 años","11–14 years":"11–14 años","15 years and older":"15 años y mayores","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Ingreso bruto anual de los padres que pagan manutención, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Ingresos brutos anuales del otro progenitor, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Arreglo de residencia infantil","One primary home":"Una vivienda principal","Shared residence":"Residencia compartida","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Costo neto mensual de cuidado infantil elegible, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opcional. Ingrese solo el monto mensual que cree que puede incluirse después de cualquier apoyo o desgravación fiscal; la herramienta no puede determinar la elegibilidad.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Beneficio ordinario por hijo al mes, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Clase de visita utilizada para el descuento","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Sin descuento / menos de 2 noches por mes","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Clase 1 · aproximadamente 2–3 noches por mes","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Clase 2 · aproximadamente 4–8 noches por mes","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Clase 3 · aproximadamente 9–13 noches por mes","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Clase 4 · aproximadamente 14–15 noches por mes","Estimate monthly amount":"Monto mensual estimado","Clear entries":"Borrar entradas","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Ingrese el ingreso bruto anual de ambos padres y el grupo de edad del niño.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Escenario calculado en este dispositivo. NAV decide los casos oficiales.","Entries cleared.":"Entradas borradas.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Verifique las entradas de ingresos, edad, clase de visitas y costos mensuales.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Escenario mensual simplificado","Estimated monthly transfer":"Transferencia mensual estimada","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Cantidad estimada durante 12 meses","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Base de costo de mantenimiento mensual","Age-based consumption reference":"Referencia de consumo por edad","Standard housing reference":"Referencia de carcasa estándar","Childcare amount entered":"Monto de cuidado infantil ingresado","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Se resta la prestación ordinaria por hijo","Income share before ceilings":"Participación de ingresos antes de límites máximos","Estimate before visitation credit":"Estimación antes del crédito de visitas","Visitation credit":"Crédito de visita","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 techo de costo de mantenimiento","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% techo de ingreso anual por mes","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Padre responsable en este escenario","Parent entered as paying":"El padre entró como pagador","Other parent":"Otro padre","Higher-income parent":"Padre de mayores ingresos","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Para residencia compartida, la herramienta compara la participación en los ingresos del padre con mayores ingresos con 50%.","Assumptions used":"Supuestos utilizados","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Tasas de referencia estáticas noruegas 2026 vigentes en julio 1; sin actualizaciones en segundo plano.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"El importe se redondea al NOK 10 más cercano. El monto anual multiplica la estimación mensual redondeada por 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Un niño por cálculo; No se modelan la capacidad de pago, otros hijos, impuestos completos, ingresos por hijos y casos especiales.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Todas las entradas y cálculos permanecen en esta pestaña del navegador. Esta herramienta no carga ni almacena nada.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · normas y orientación sobre manutención infantil","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 tarifas de referencia y deducciones por visitas","Norwegian child support regulation":"Reglamento noruego de manutención infantil","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Consulte la guía NAV actual y la calculadora oficial","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"fa":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"برآوردگر حمایت از کودکان نروژی","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"ماشین حساب حمایت از کودک نروژ 2026 — برآورد قرارداد خصوصی","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"سناریوی ماهانه حمایت از کودک را تحت نرخ های مرجع 2026 نروژی کاوش کنید. سن کودک، درآمد هر یک از والدین، هزینه های مراقبت از کودک، محل اقامت و ملاقات را وارد کنید تا مفروضات و مبلغ تخمینی را ببینید.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"از این تخمین برنامه ریزی خصوصی برای بحث در مورد حمایت ماهانه یک کودک استفاده کنید. ارقام مرجع مبتنی بر سن و تخفیف های بازدید از جداول تاریخ نروژی 2026 پیروی می کنند. زبان این صفحه هرگز کشور یا قوانین را تغییر نمی دهد.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"در این مرورگر اجرا می شود. ارقامی که وارد می کنید به سرور ارسال نمی شوند یا توسط این ابزار ذخیره نمی شوند.","Example":"مثال","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"برای یک کودک پیر6–10،2026هزینه مرجع قبل از مراقبت از کودک NOK است7,523در مصرف به علاوه NOK3,811برای مسکن، کمتر NOK2,012مزایای کودک عادی: NOK9,322. با درآمد سالانه والدین NOK600,000و NOK400,000و کلاس بازدید2، تخمین ساده شده یک خانه حدود NOK است3,900در هر ماه پس از NOK1,690اعتبار بازدید و گرد کردن","How the estimate works":"برآورد چگونه کار می کند","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"ابزار اضافه می کند2026مقدار مصرف بر اساس سن و مبلغ مسکن، هزینه خالص مراقبت از کودک واجد شرایطی را که وارد می‌کنید اضافه می‌کند و کمک هزینه عادی کودک را کم می‌کند. برای یک خانه اصلی، این هزینه را با استفاده از دو درآمد سالانه وارد شده اختصاص می دهد، اعمال می شود5/6سقف هزینه و25% سقف درآمد، کم می کند2026اعتبار بازدید و گردش به نزدیکترین NOK10. برای اقامت مشترک، سهم والدین با درآمد بالاتر را در بالا تخمین می زند50٪.","Common questions":"سوالات متداول","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"آیا این مبلغ از نظر قانونی الزام آور است؟","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"خیر. والدین می توانند به طور خصوصی توافق کنند، و NAV به تنهایی تصمیم عمومی می گیرد. این یک مقایسه ساده است، نه یک تصمیم NAV یا ماشین حساب کامل آن.","Does page language change these rules?":"آیا زبان صفحه این قوانین را تغییر می دهد؟","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"نه. رابط ترجمه شده است، اما نرخ ها و فرمول نشان داده شده نروژی و دارای تاریخ 2026 هستند.","Why do the rates have a date?":"چرا نرخ ها تاریخ دارند؟","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV و وزارت مقادیر مرجع را در طول سال به‌روزرسانی می‌کنند، معمولاً از 1 جولای. این نسخه از نرخ موثر 1 جولای 2026 استفاده می کند. قبل از تکیه بر نتیجه، جداول رسمی مرتبط را بررسی کنید.","Scope and limits":"دامنه و محدودیت ها","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"فقط نروژ; یک فرزند در هر محاسبه، زیر 18. این سناریوی ساده شده، تعریف درآمد کامل NAV، محاسبه مالیات و ظرفیت پرداخت، حمایت از مراقبت از کودک/ تخفیف مالیاتی، درآمد کودک، تخصیص چند فرزند، برنامه‌های ملاقات غیرمعمول، حمایت اضافی یا موارد بین‌المللی را بازتولید نمی‌کند. مبلغ مراقبت از کودک وارد شده توسط کاربر باید مبلغ خالص ماهانه واجد شرایط پس از هر گونه حمایت یا کسرهایی باشد که کاربر می داند اعمال می شود. درآمد، درآمد ناخالص سالانه ساده شده است، نه ارزیابی رسمی NAV. از آن به عنوان جایزه، مشاوره حقوقی یا قولی در مورد آنچه یکی از والدین باید بپردازد استفاده نکنید.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"سناریوی قرارداد خصوصی را تخمین بزنید","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"فقط قوانین نروژی · جداول مرجع 2026 موثر 1 جولای · بررسی 17 اکتبر 2026 · زبان کشور را تغییر نمی دهد.","Child age group":"گروه سنی کودک","0–5 years":"0–5 سال","6–10 years":"6–10 سال","11–14 years":"11–14 سال","15 years and older":"15 سال و بالاتر","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"درآمد ناخالص سالانه حمایت پرداخت کننده والدین، NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"درآمد ناخالص سالانه والدین دیگر، NOK","Child residence arrangement":"تدارک اقامتگاه کودک","One primary home":"یک خانه اصلی","Shared residence":"محل سکونت مشترک","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"هزینه خالص مراقبت از کودکان واجد شرایط در ماه، NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"اختیاری. فقط مبلغ ماهیانه ای را وارد کنید که فکر می کنید ممکن است بعد از هر گونه حمایت یا تخفیف مالیاتی شامل شود. ابزار نمی تواند واجد شرایط بودن را تعیین کند.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"مزایای کودک معمولی در ماه، NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"کلاس بازدید برای تخفیف استفاده شده است","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"بدون تخفیف / کمتر از 2 شب در ماه","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"کلاس 1 · حدود 2–3 شب در ماه","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"کلاس 2 · حدود 4–8 شب در ماه","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"کلاس 3 · حدود 9–13 شب در ماه","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"کلاس 4 · حدود 14–15 شب در ماه","Estimate monthly amount":"مبلغ ماهانه را برآورد کنید","Clear entries":"پاک کردن ورودی ها","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"درآمد ناخالص سالانه والدین و گروه سنی کودک را وارد کنید.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"سناریو بر روی این دستگاه محاسبه شده است. NAV در مورد پرونده های رسمی تصمیم گیری می کند.","Entries cleared.":"ورودی ها پاک شدند.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"درآمد، سن، کلاس بازدید و ورودی های هزینه ماهانه را بررسی کنید.","Simplified monthly scenario":"سناریوی ماهانه ساده شده","Estimated monthly transfer":"انتقال ماهانه تخمینی","Estimated amount over 12 months":"مقدار تخمینی بیش از 12 ماه","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"مبنای هزینه نگهداری ماهانه","Age-based consumption reference":"مرجع مصرف بر اساس سن","Standard housing reference":"مرجع مسکن استاندارد","Childcare amount entered":"مقدار مراقبت از کودک وارد شده است","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"مزایای فرزند عادی کم شد","Income share before ceilings":"سهم درآمد قبل از سقف","Estimate before visitation credit":"برآورد اعتبار قبل از بازدید","Visitation credit":"اعتبار بازدید","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% سقف درآمد سالانه در ماه","Parent responsible in this scenario":"والدین مسئول این سناریو هستند","Parent entered as paying":"والدین به عنوان پرداخت کننده وارد شدند","Other parent":"والدین دیگر","Higher-income parent":"والدین با درآمد بالاتر","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"برای اقامت مشترک، ابزار سهم درآمد والدین با درآمد بالاتر را با 50٪ مقایسه می‌کند.","Assumptions used":"فرض های مورد استفاده","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"نرخ های مرجع ثابت نروژی 2026 موثر 1 جولای; بدون به روز رسانی پس زمینه","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"مبلغ به نزدیکترین NOK 10 گرد می شود. مقدار سالانه تخمین گرد شده ماهانه را در 12 ضرب می کند.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"یک فرزند در هر محاسبه. ظرفیت پرداخت، سایر فرزندان، مالیات کامل، درآمد فرزند و موارد خاص مدل سازی نشده است.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"همه ورودی ها و محاسبات در این برگه مرورگر باقی می مانند. هیچ چیزی توسط این ابزار آپلود یا ذخیره نمی شود.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · قوانین و راهنمایی های حمایت از کودک","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · نرخ مرجع 2026 و کسر بازدید","Norwegian child support regulation":"مقررات حمایت از کودک نروژی","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"راهنمای فعلی NAV و ماشین حساب رسمی را بررسی کنید","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"fr":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Estimateur norvégien de pension alimentaire pour enfants","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Calculateur de pension alimentaire pour enfants en Norvège 2026 — Estimation d'un accord privé","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Explorez un scénario simplifié de pension alimentaire mensuelle pour enfants selon les taux de référence norvégiens 2026. Entrez l’âge de l’enfant, le revenu de chaque parent, les frais de garde d’enfants, la résidence et les visites pour voir les hypothèses et le montant estimé.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Utilisez cette estimation de planification privée pour discuter de la pension alimentaire mensuelle d'un enfant. Les chiffres de référence basés sur l'âge et les réductions de visite suivent les tableaux norvégiens datés 2026 ; la langue de cette page ne change jamais le pays ou les règles.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"S'exécute dans ce navigateur. Les chiffres que vous saisissez ne sont pas envoyés à un serveur ni enregistrés par cet outil.","Example":"Exemple","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Pour un enfant âgé de 6 à 10, le coût de référence 2026 avant la garde d'enfants est de NOK 7,523 en consommation plus NOK 3,811 pour le logement, moins NOK 2,012 allocation familiale ordinaire : NOK 9,322. Avec des revenus annuels des parents de NOK 600,000 et NOK 400,000 et une classe de visite 2, l'estimation simplifiée pour un logement est d'environ NOK 3,900 par mois après le crédit de visite NOK 1,690 et l'arrondi.","How the estimate works":"Fonctionnement du devis","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"L'outil additionne le montant de consommation et le montant du logement basés sur l'âge 2026, ajoute les frais de garde d'enfants nets éligibles que vous saisissez et soustrait les allocations familiales ordinaires. Pour une résidence principale, il répartit ce coût en utilisant les deux revenus annuels saisis, applique le plafond de coût 5/6 et le plafond de revenu 25%, soustrait le crédit de visite 2026 et arrondit au NOK 10 le plus proche. Pour la résidence partagée, il estime la part des parents aux revenus les plus élevés au-dessus de 50 %.","Common questions":"Questions courantes","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Est-ce que cela fixe un montant juridiquement contraignant ?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Non. Les parents peuvent se mettre d’accord en privé et NAV seul prend une décision publique. Il s’agit d’une comparaison simplifiée, et non d’une décision NAV ou de son calculateur complet.","Does page language change these rules?":"La langue de la page modifie-t-elle ces règles ?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Non. L'interface est traduite, mais les tarifs et formules affichés sont norvégiens et datés 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Pourquoi les tarifs ont-ils une date ?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV et le Ministère mettent à jour les montants de référence au cours de l'année, normalement à partir du 1 juillet. Cette version utilise les tarifs en vigueur 1 juillet 2026 ; vérifiez les tableaux officiels liés avant de vous fier à un résultat.","Scope and limits":"Portée et limites","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Norvège uniquement ; un enfant par calcul, sous 18. Ce scénario simplifié ne reproduit pas la définition complète du revenu de NAV, le calcul de l’impôt et de la capacité contributive, l’aide à la garde d’enfants/allégement fiscal, le revenu des enfants, l’allocation pour plusieurs enfants, les horaires de visites inhabituels, l’aide supplémentaire ou les cas internationaux. Le montant pour frais de garde saisi par l’utilisateur doit être le montant mensuel net admissible après toute pension alimentaire ou déductions dont l’utilisateur sait qu’elles s’appliquent. Le revenu est un revenu brut annuel simplifié et non une évaluation officielle de la valeur liquidative. Ne l'utilisez pas comme une récompense, un conseil juridique ou une promesse de ce que l'un ou l'autre des parents doit payer.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Estimer un scénario d'accord privé","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Règles norvégiennes uniquement · Tableaux de référence 2026 en vigueur 1 juillet · vérifié 17 octobre 2026 · la langue ne change pas le pays.","Child age group":"Groupe d'âge des enfants","0–5 years":"0–5 années","6–10 years":"6–10 années","11–14 years":"11–14 années","15 years and older":"15 ans et plus","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Revenu brut annuel du parent payeur de pension alimentaire, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Revenu brut annuel de l'autre parent, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Aménagement résidence enfant","One primary home":"Une résidence principale","Shared residence":"Résidence partagée","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Frais de garde d'enfants nets éligibles par mois, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Facultatif. Saisissez uniquement le montant mensuel qui, selon vous, pourrait être inclus après toute aide ou allègement fiscal ; l’outil ne peut pas déterminer l’éligibilité.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Allocation familiale ordinaire par mois, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Classe de visite utilisée pour la réduction","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Aucune remise / moins de 2 nuits par mois","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Classe 1 · environ 2–3 nuits par mois","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Classe 2 · environ 4–8 nuits par mois","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Classe 3 · environ 9–13 nuits par mois","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Classe 4 · environ 14–15 nuits par mois","Estimate monthly amount":"Montant mensuel estimé","Clear entries":"Effacer les entrées","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Saisissez le revenu brut annuel des deux parents et le groupe d’âge de l’enfant.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Scénario calculé sur cet appareil. NAV décide des affaires officielles.","Entries cleared.":"Entrées effacées.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Vérifiez les revenus, l'âge, la classe de visite et les entrées de coûts mensuels.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Scénario mensuel simplifié","Estimated monthly transfer":"Transfert mensuel estimé","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Montant estimé sur 12 mois","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Base des coûts de maintenance mensuels","Age-based consumption reference":"Référence de consommation basée sur l'âge","Standard housing reference":"Référence boîtier standard","Childcare amount entered":"Montant pour garde d'enfants saisi","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Allocations familiales ordinaires soustraites","Income share before ceilings":"Part des revenus avant plafonds","Estimate before visitation credit":"Estimation avant crédit de visite","Visitation credit":"Crédit de visite","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 plafond des coûts de maintenance","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% plafond de revenu annuel par mois","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Parent responsable dans ce scénario","Parent entered as paying":"Parent saisi comme payeur","Other parent":"Autre parent","Higher-income parent":"Parent aux revenus plus élevés","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Pour la résidence partagée, l'outil compare la part du revenu du parent au revenu le plus élevé avec 50 %.","Assumptions used":"Hypothèses utilisées","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Taux de référence norvégiens statiques 2026 en vigueur 1 juillet ; aucune mise à jour en arrière-plan.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Le montant est arrondi au 10 NOK le plus proche. Le montant annuel multiplie l'estimation mensuelle arrondie par 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Un enfant par calcul ; la capacité contributive, les autres enfants, l’impôt complet, le revenu des enfants et les cas particuliers ne sont pas modélisés.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Toutes les entrées et calculs restent dans cet onglet du navigateur. Rien n'est téléchargé ou stocké par cet outil.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · règles et directives en matière de pension alimentaire pour enfants","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · Taux de référence 2026 et déductions de visite","Norwegian child support regulation":"Règlement norvégien sur les pensions alimentaires pour enfants","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Vérifiez les directives NAV actuelles et le calculateur officiel","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"gu":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"નોર્વેજીયન ચાઇલ્ડ સપોર્ટ એસ્ટીમેટર","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"નોર્વે ચાઇલ્ડ સપોર્ટ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — ખાનગી કરાર અંદાજ","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"નોર્વેજીયન 2026 સંદર્ભ દરો હેઠળ એક સરળ માસિક બાળ-સપોર્ટ દૃશ્યનું અન્વેષણ કરો. ધારણાઓ અને અંદાજિત રકમ જોવા માટે બાળકની ઉંમર, દરેક માતાપિતાની આવક, બાળ સંભાળ ખર્ચ, રહેઠાણ અને મુલાકાત દાખલ કરો.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"એક બાળકના માસિક સમર્થનની ચર્ચા કરવા માટે આ ખાનગી આયોજન અંદાજનો ઉપયોગ કરો. વય-આધારિત સંદર્ભ આંકડાઓ અને મુલાકાત ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ તારીખના નોર્વેજીયન 2026 કોષ્ટકોને અનુસરે છે; આ પૃષ્ઠની ભાષા ક્યારેય દેશ અથવા નિયમોમાં ફેરફાર કરતી નથી.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે. તમે દાખલ કરેલા આંકડા સર્વર પર મોકલવામાં આવતા નથી અથવા આ સાધન દ્વારા સાચવવામાં આવતા નથી.","Example":"ઉદાહરણ","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"વયના બાળક માટે6-10, ધ2026બાળ સંભાળ પહેલાં સંદર્ભ ખર્ચ NOK છે7,523વપરાશ વત્તા NOK માં3,811આવાસ માટે, ઓછા NOK2,012સામાન્ય બાળક લાભ: NOK9,322. NOK ની વાર્ષિક પિતૃ આવક સાથે600,000અને NOK400,000અને મુલાકાત વર્ગ2, એક ઘરનો સરળ અંદાજ NOK વિશે છે3,900NOK પછી દર મહિને1,690મુલાકાત ક્રેડિટ અને રાઉન્ડિંગ.","How the estimate works":"અંદાજ કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"સાધન ઉમેરે છે2026વય-આધારિત વપરાશની રકમ અને આવાસની રકમ, તમે દાખલ કરો છો તે પાત્ર નેટ ચાઇલ્ડકેર ખર્ચ ઉમેરે છે અને સામાન્ય બાળ લાભ બાદ કરે છે. એક પ્રાથમિક ઘર માટે, તે બે દાખલ કરેલ વાર્ષિક આવકનો ઉપયોગ કરીને આ ખર્ચ ફાળવે છે, લાગુ પડે છે5/6ખર્ચની ટોચમર્યાદા અને25% આવકની ટોચમર્યાદા, બાદબાકી કરે છે2026મુલાકાતની ક્રેડિટ અને નજીકના NOK સુધીના રાઉન્ડ10. વહેંચાયેલ રહેઠાણ માટે તે ઉપરોક્ત ઉચ્ચ આવકવાળા માતાપિતાના હિસ્સાનો અંદાજ કાઢે છે50%.","Common questions":"સામાન્ય પ્રશ્નો","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"શું આ કાયદેસર રીતે બંધનકર્તા રકમ સેટ કરે છે?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"ના. માતાપિતા ખાનગી રીતે સંમત થઈ શકે છે, અને NAV એકલા જાહેર નિર્ણય કરે છે. આ એક સરળ સરખામણી છે, NAV નિર્ણય અથવા તેનું સંપૂર્ણ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર નથી.","Does page language change these rules?":"શું પૃષ્ઠની ભાષા આ નિયમોમાં ફેરફાર કરે છે?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"ના. ઈન્ટરફેસનું ભાષાંતર કરવામાં આવ્યું છે, પરંતુ દર્શાવેલ દરો અને સૂત્ર નોર્વેજીયન અને તારીખ 2026 છે.","Why do the rates have a date?":"શા માટે દરોની તારીખ હોય છે?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV અને મંત્રાલય વર્ષ દરમિયાન સંદર્ભની રકમ અપડેટ કરે છે, સામાન્ય રીતે 1 જુલાઈથી. આ સંસ્કરણ 1 જુલાઈ 2026 અસરકારક દરોનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે; પરિણામ પર આધાર રાખતા પહેલા લિંક કરેલ સત્તાવાર કોષ્ટકો તપાસો.","Scope and limits":"અવકાશ અને મર્યાદા","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"ફક્ત નોર્વે; 18 હેઠળ, ગણતરી દીઠ એક બાળક. આ સરળ દૃશ્ય NAV ની સંપૂર્ણ આવકની વ્યાખ્યા, કર અને ક્ષમતા-થી-ચુકવણીની ગણતરી, ચાઇલ્ડકેર સપોર્ટ/કર રાહત, બાળકોની આવક, બહુવિધ-બાળકોની ફાળવણી, અસામાન્ય મુલાકાત સમયપત્રક, વધારાની સહાય અથવા આંતરરાષ્ટ્રીય કેસોનું પુનઃઉત્પાદન કરતું નથી. વપરાશકર્તા દ્વારા દાખલ કરાયેલ ચાઇલ્ડકેર રકમ કોઈપણ સમર્થન અથવા કપાત પછી વપરાશકર્તા જાણતા હોય તે લાગુ કરવા માટે પાત્ર ચોખ્ખી માસિક રકમ હોવી જોઈએ. આવક એ વાર્ષિક કુલ આવકને સરળ બનાવે છે, સત્તાવાર NAV આકારણી નથી. તેનો ઉપયોગ એવોર્ડ, કાનૂની સલાહ અથવા માતા-પિતાએ શું ચૂકવવું પડશે તેના વચન તરીકે કરશો નહીં.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"ખાનગી કરારના દૃશ્યનો અંદાજ કાઢો","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"ફક્ત નોર્વેજીયન નિયમો · 2026 સંદર્ભ કોષ્ટકો અસરકારક 1 જુલાઈ · 17 ઑક્ટોબર 2026 ચેક કરેલ · ભાષા દેશ બદલાતી નથી.","Child age group":"બાળ વય જૂથ","0–5 years":"0–5 વર્ષ","6–10 years":"6–10 વર્ષ","11–14 years":"11–14 વર્ષ","15 years and older":"15 વર્ષ અને તેથી વધુ જૂનું","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"પેયન્ટ પેમેન્ટ સપોર્ટની વાર્ષિક કુલ આવક, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"અન્ય માતાપિતાની વાર્ષિક કુલ આવક, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"બાળકના નિવાસની વ્યવસ્થા","One primary home":"એક પ્રાથમિક ઘર","Shared residence":"શેર્ડ રહેઠાણ","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"પાત્ર નેટ ચાઇલ્ડકેર ખર્ચ દર મહિને, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"વૈકલ્પિક. ફક્ત તે જ માસિક રકમ દાખલ કરો જે તમે માનો છો કે કોઈપણ સહાય અથવા કર રાહત પછી સમાવેશ થઈ શકે છે; સાધન યોગ્યતા નક્કી કરી શકતું નથી.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"દર મહિને સામાન્ય બાળક લાભ, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"મુલાકાત વર્ગ ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ માટે વપરાય છે","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"કોઈ ડિસ્કાઉન્ટ નથી / દર મહિને 2 રાત કરતાં ઓછી","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"ક્લાસ 1 · લગભગ 2–3 રાત દર મહિને","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"ક્લાસ 2 · લગભગ 4–8 રાત દર મહિને","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"ક્લાસ 3 · લગભગ 9–13 રાત દર મહિને","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"ક્લાસ 4 · લગભગ 14–15 રાત દર મહિને","Estimate monthly amount":"માસિક રકમનો અંદાજ કાઢો","Clear entries":"એન્ટ્રીઓ સાફ કરો","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"માતાપિતાની વાર્ષિક કુલ આવક અને બાળકની વય જૂથ બંને દાખલ કરો.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર ગણતરી કરેલ દૃશ્ય. NAV સત્તાવાર કેસો નક્કી કરે છે.","Entries cleared.":"એન્ટ્રી સાફ કરી.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"આવક, ઉંમર, મુલાકાત વર્ગ અને માસિક ખર્ચની એન્ટ્રીઓ તપાસો.","Simplified monthly scenario":"સરળ માસિક દૃશ્ય","Estimated monthly transfer":"અંદાજિત માસિક ટ્રાન્સફર","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 મહિનામાં અંદાજિત રકમ","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"માસિક જાળવણી-ખર્ચના આધારે","Age-based consumption reference":"વય-આધારિત વપરાશ સંદર્ભ","Standard housing reference":"સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ હાઉસિંગ સંદર્ભ","Childcare amount entered":"બાળ સંભાળની રકમ દાખલ કરી","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"સામાન્ય બાળ લાભ બાદ કરવામાં આવ્યો","Income share before ceilings":"સીલિંગ પહેલા આવકનો હિસ્સો","Estimate before visitation credit":"વિઝીટેશન ક્રેડિટ પહેલા અંદાજ","Visitation credit":"મુલાકાત ક્રેડિટ","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 જાળવણી-ખર્ચની ટોચમર્યાદા","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% દર મહિને વાર્ષિક આવકની ટોચમર્યાદા","Parent responsible in this scenario":"આ પરિસ્થિતિમાં જવાબદાર માતાપિતા","Parent entered as paying":"માતા-પિતાએ ચૂકવણી તરીકે પ્રવેશ કર્યો","Other parent":"અન્ય માતાપિતા","Higher-income parent":"ઉચ્ચ આવક ધરાવતા માતાપિતા","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"શેર્ડ રહેઠાણ માટે, સાધન ઉચ્ચ-આવકવાળા માતાપિતાની આવકના હિસ્સાને 50% સાથે સરખાવે છે.","Assumptions used":"ઉપયોગી ધારણાઓ","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"સ્ટેટિક નોર્વેજીયન 2026 સંદર્ભ દરો અસરકારક 1 જુલાઈ; કોઈ પૃષ્ઠભૂમિ અપડેટ્સ નથી.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"આ રકમ નજીકના NOK 10 પર ગોળાકાર છે. વાર્ષિક રકમ ગોળાકાર માસિક અંદાજને 12 વડે ગુણાકાર કરે છે.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"ગણતરી દીઠ એક બાળક; ક્ષમતા-થી-ચૂકવણી, અન્ય બાળકો, સંપૂર્ણ કર, બાળકોની આવક અને વિશેષ કેસોનું મોડેલિંગ નથી.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"બધી એન્ટ્રીઓ અને ગણતરીઓ આ બ્રાઉઝર ટેબમાં રહે છે. આ ટૂલ દ્વારા કંઈપણ અપલોડ અથવા સ્ટોર કરવામાં આવતું નથી.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · ચાઇલ્ડ સપોર્ટ નિયમો અને માર્ગદર્શન","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 સંદર્ભ દરો અને મુલાકાત કપાત","Norwegian child support regulation":"નોર્વેજીયન ચાઇલ્ડ સપોર્ટ રેગ્યુલેશન","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"વર્તમાન NAV માર્ગદર્શન અને સત્તાવાર કેલ્ક્યુલેટર તપાસો","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ha":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Ƙididdigar Tallafin Yara na Norwegian","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Ƙididdigar Tallafin Yara na Norway 2026 - Ƙimar Yarjejeniyar Keɓaɓɓu","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Bincika sauƙaƙan yanayin tallafin yara na wata-wata a ƙarƙashin ƙimar ƙimar 2026 na Yaren mutanen Norway. Shigar da shekarun yara, kuɗin shiga kowane iyaye, farashin kula da yara, wurin zama da ziyarar don ganin zato da adadin ƙima.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Yi amfani da wannan kiyasin tsare-tsare na sirri don tattauna tallafin da yaro ɗaya ke bayarwa kowane wata. Ƙididdiga na tushen shekaru da rangwamen ziyara sun biyo bayan jadawalin 2026 na Norwegian; harshen wannan shafi ba ya canza ƙasar ko ƙa'idodi.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Yana aiki a cikin wannan browser. Ba a aika da lambobin da kuka shigar zuwa uwar garken ko adana su ta wannan kayan aiki.","Example":"Misali","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Don yaro mai shekaru6-10, da2026Kudin tunani kafin kula da yara NOK7,523a cikin amfani da NOK3,811don gidaje, ƙasa da NOK2,012amfanin talakawan yara: NOK9,322. Tare da kudaden shiga na iyaye na shekara-shekara na NOK600,000da NOK400,000da kuma ziyara aji2, ƙayyadaddun ƙayyadaddun ƙima na gida ɗaya game da NOK3,900duk wata bayan NOK1,690ziyarar credit da zagaye.","How the estimate works":"Yadda kimantawa ke aiki","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Kayan aikin yana ƙara adadin yawan amfanin shekaru na 2026 da adadin mahalli, yana ƙara ƙimar kuɗin kula da yara masu dacewa da kuka shigar, kuma yana cire fa'idodin yara na yau da kullun. Don gida ɗaya na farko, yana ba da wannan farashi ta amfani da kuɗin shiga na shekara-shekara guda biyu, ya shafi 5 / 6 kudin rufi da kuma 25% rufin kudin shiga, ya rage 2026 ziyarar bashi da zagaye zuwa NOK 10 mafi kusa. Don wurin zama na tarayya yana ƙididdige rabon iyaye masu samun kuɗi sama da 50%.","Common questions":"Tambayoyi gama gari","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Shin wannan yana saita adadin dauri bisa doka?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"A'a. Iyaye za su iya yarda a keɓance, kuma NAV kaɗai ke yin ƙudirin jama'a. Wannan sauƙaƙan kwatancen, ba yanke shawara NAV ba ko cikakken kalkuleta.","Does page language change these rules?":"Shin harshen shafi yana canza waɗannan dokoki?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"A'a. An fassara fassarar, amma ƙididdiga da ƙididdiga da aka nuna sune Yaren mutanen Norway da kwanan wata 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Me yasa rates suna da kwanan wata?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV da Ma'aikatar sun sabunta adadin bayanai a cikin shekara, yawanci daga 1 Yuli. Wannan sigar tana amfani da ƙimar inganci 1 Yuli 2026; duba allunan hukuma masu alaƙa kafin dogaro da sakamako.","Scope and limits":"Mai iyaka da iyaka","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Norway kawai; yaro ɗaya a kowace lissafi, ƙarƙashin 18. Wannan sauƙaƙan yanayin baya sake haifar da cikakken ma'anar samun kudin shiga na NAV, haraji da lissafin iya biyan kuɗi, tallafin kula da yara/taimakon haraji, kuɗin shiga yara, rabon yara da yawa, jadawalin ziyarar da ba a saba gani ba, ƙarin tallafi ko shari'o'in ƙasa da ƙasa. Adadin kulawar yara da aka shigar mai amfani yakamata ya zama adadin kuɗin da aka cancanta kowane wata bayan duk wani tallafi ko ragi da mai amfani ya san ana amfani da shi. Ana sauƙaƙa kuɗin shiga na shekara-shekara, ba ƙima na NAV na hukuma ba. Kar a yi amfani da shi azaman kyauta, shawarar doka ko alƙawarin abin da kowane iyaye dole ne su biya.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Kididdige yanayin yarjejeniya mai zaman kansa","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Dokokin Norwegian kawai · 2026 Tables reference tasiri 1 Yuli · duba 17 Oktoba 2026 · harshe baya canza kasar.","Child age group":"Ƙungiyar shekarun yara","0–5 years":"0–5 shekaru","6–10 years":"6–10 shekaru","11–14 years":"11–14 shekaru","15 years and older":"15 shekaru da girma","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Babban kudin shiga na shekara-shekara na tallafin biyan iyaye, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Babban kuɗin shiga na shekara na ɗayan iyaye, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Tsarin zama na yara","One primary home":"Gida na farko","Shared residence":"Gidan zama na raba","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Cancantar kuɗin kula da yara na wata-wata, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Na zaɓi. Shigar kawai adadin kowane wata da kuka yi imanin ana iya haɗawa bayan kowane tallafi ko tallafin haraji; kayan aiki ba zai iya ƙayyade cancanta ba.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Ribar yara ta yau da kullun kowane wata, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Ajin ziyara da aka yi amfani da shi don rangwame","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Babu rangwame / ƙasa da dare 2 kowane wata","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Class 1 · game da 2–3 dare kowane wata","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Darasi 2 · game da 4–8 dare kowane wata","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Class 3 · game da 9–13 dare kowane wata","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Class 4 · game da 14–15 dare kowane wata","Estimate monthly amount":"Kididdigar adadin kowane wata","Clear entries":"Shirye-shiryen shigarwa","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Shigar da yawan kuɗin shiga na shekara-shekara na iyaye da rukunin shekarun yaran.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Halin da aka ƙididdige akan wannan na'urar. NAV ce ke yanke hukunci a hukumance.","Entries cleared.":"An share abubuwan shigarwa.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Duba kudin shiga, shekaru, ajin ziyara da shigarwar farashin kowane wata.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Sauƙaƙen yanayin kowane wata","Estimated monthly transfer":"Canja wurin wata-wata","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Kididdigar ƙiyasin sama da watanni 12","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Tsarin kula da kuɗi na wata-wata","Age-based consumption reference":"Yin amfani da shekaru","Standard housing reference":"Madaidaicin ma'anar gidaje","Childcare amount entered":"An shigar da adadin kula da yara","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"An rage amfanin yara na yau da kullun","Income share before ceilings":"Rabin kudin shiga kafin rufi","Estimate before visitation credit":"Kimanta kafin kiredit na ziyara","Visitation credit":"Kiredit na ziyara","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 kula da rufi","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% rufin kudin shiga na shekara-shekara kowane wata","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Uban da ke da alhakin wannan yanayin","Parent entered as paying":"Iyaye sun shiga azaman biyan kuɗi","Other parent":"Sauran iyaye","Higher-income parent":"Iyaye mafi girma","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Don zama mai raba, kayan aiki yana kwatanta rabon kuɗin shiga na iyaye masu girma da yawa tare da 50%.","Assumptions used":"Zato da aka yi amfani da su","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Static Norwegian 2026 ƙididdiga masu tasiri 1 Yuli; babu sabunta bayanan baya.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"An haɗa adadin zuwa NOK 10 mafi kusa. Adadin shekara yana ninka ƙididdigewa na kowane wata ta 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Yaro ɗaya a kowace lissafi; iya biyan kuɗi, sauran yara, cikakken haraji, kuɗin shiga na yara da lokuta na musamman ba a tsara su ba.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Duk shigarwar da ƙididdiga sun tsaya a cikin wannan shafin mai lilo. Babu wani abu da aka ɗora ko adana shi ta wannan kayan aikin.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · Dokokin tallafin yara da jagora","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 farashin tunani da ragi na ziyara","Norwegian child support regulation":"Dokokin tallafin yara na Norway","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Duba jagorar NAV na yanzu da ƙididdiga na hukuma","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"hi":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"नॉर्वेजियन बाल सहायता अनुमानक","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"नॉर्वे बाल सहायता कैलकुलेटर 2026 — निजी अनुबंध अनुमान","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"नॉर्वेजियन 2026 संदर्भ दरों के तहत एक सरलीकृत मासिक बाल-सहायता परिदृश्य का अन्वेषण करें। अनुमान और अनुमानित राशि देखने के लिए बच्चे की उम्र, प्रत्येक माता-पिता की आय, बच्चे की देखभाल की लागत, निवास और मुलाक़ात दर्ज करें।","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"एक बच्चे की मासिक सहायता पर चर्चा करने के लिए इस निजी नियोजन अनुमान का उपयोग करें। आयु-आधारित संदर्भ आंकड़े और मुलाक़ात छूट दिनांकित नॉर्वेजियन 2026 तालिकाओं का पालन करते हैं; इस पृष्ठ की भाषा कभी भी देश या नियम नहीं बदलती।","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"इस ब्राउज़र में चलता है। आपके द्वारा दर्ज किए गए आंकड़े सर्वर पर नहीं भेजे जाते हैं या इस टूल द्वारा सहेजे नहीं जाते हैं।","Example":"उदाहरण","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"6-10 आयु वर्ग के बच्चे के लिए, चाइल्डकैअर से पहले 2026 संदर्भ लागत खपत में NOK 7,523 है और आवास के लिए NOK 3,811 है, सामान्य बाल लाभ से कम NOK 2,012 है: 9,322. NOK 600,000 और NOK 400,000 और मुलाक़ात वर्ग 2 की वार्षिक मूल आय के साथ, सरलीकृत एक-घर का अनुमान NOK 1,690 मुलाक़ात क्रेडिट और राउंडिंग के बाद प्रति माह लगभग NOK 3,900 है।","How the estimate works":"अनुमान कैसे काम करता है","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"उपकरण 2026 आयु-आधारित उपभोग राशि और आवास राशि जोड़ता है, आपके द्वारा दर्ज की गई योग्य शुद्ध चाइल्डकैअर लागत जोड़ता है, और सामान्य बाल लाभ घटाता है। एक प्राथमिक घर के लिए, यह दर्ज की गई दो वार्षिक आय का उपयोग करके इस लागत को आवंटित करता है, 5/6 लागत सीमा और 25% आय सीमा लागू करता है, 2026 मुलाक़ात क्रेडिट घटाता है और निकटतम NOK 10 पर राउंड करता है। साझा निवास के लिए यह 50% से ऊपर उच्च आय वाले माता-पिता की हिस्सेदारी का अनुमान लगाता है।","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"क्या यह कानूनी रूप से बाध्यकारी राशि निर्धारित करता है?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"नहीं। माता-पिता निजी तौर पर सहमत हो सकते हैं, और एनएवी अकेले ही सार्वजनिक निर्धारण करता है। यह एक सरलीकृत तुलना है, एनएवी निर्णय या इसका पूर्ण कैलकुलेटर नहीं।","Does page language change these rules?":"क्या पृष्ठ भाषा इन नियमों को बदलती है?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"नहीं। इंटरफ़ेस का अनुवाद किया गया है, लेकिन दिखाई गई दरें और सूत्र नॉर्वेजियन और दिनांकित 2026 हैं।","Why do the rates have a date?":"दरों पर तारीख क्यों होती है?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV और मंत्रालय वर्ष के दौरान संदर्भ राशियों को सामान्यतः 1 जुलाई से अद्यतन करते हैं। यह संस्करण प्रभावी दरों 1 जुलाई 2026 का उपयोग करता है; किसी परिणाम पर भरोसा करने से पहले लिंक की गई आधिकारिक तालिकाओं की जाँच करें।","Scope and limits":"दायरा और सीमाएँ","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"केवल नॉर्वे; 18 के तहत प्रति गणना एक बच्चा। यह सरलीकृत परिदृश्य एनएवी की पूर्ण आय परिभाषा, कर और भुगतान करने की क्षमता की गणना, चाइल्डकैअर सहायता/कर राहत, बाल आय, बहु-बाल आवंटन, असामान्य मुलाक़ात कार्यक्रम, अतिरिक्त सहायता या अंतरराष्ट्रीय मामलों को पुन: पेश नहीं करता है। उपयोगकर्ता द्वारा दर्ज की गई चाइल्डकैअर राशि किसी भी समर्थन या कटौती के बाद पात्र शुद्ध मासिक राशि होनी चाहिए जिसे उपयोगकर्ता जानता है। आय सरलीकृत वार्षिक सकल आय है, आधिकारिक एनएवी मूल्यांकन नहीं। इसे किसी पुरस्कार, कानूनी सलाह या माता-पिता में से किसी एक को भुगतान करने के वादे के रूप में उपयोग न करें।","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"एक निजी अनुबंध परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाएं","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"केवल नॉर्वेजियन नियम · 2026 संदर्भ तालिका प्रभावी 1 जुलाई · जाँच की गई 17 अक्टूबर 2026 · भाषा देश नहीं बदलती।","Child age group":"बाल आयु समूह","0–5 years":"0–5 वर्ष","6–10 years":"6–10 वर्ष","11–14 years":"11–14 वर्ष","15 years and older":"15 वर्ष और अधिक पुराना","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"माता-पिता भुगतान सहायता की वार्षिक सकल आय, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"दूसरे माता-पिता की वार्षिक सकल आय, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"बाल निवास व्यवस्था","One primary home":"एक प्राथमिक घर","Shared residence":"साझा निवास","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"प्रति माह योग्य शुद्ध चाइल्डकैअर लागत, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"वैकल्पिक। केवल वही मासिक राशि दर्ज करें जो आपके अनुसार किसी सहायता या कर राहत के बाद शामिल की जा सकती है; उपकरण पात्रता निर्धारित नहीं कर सकता.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"सामान्य बाल लाभ प्रति माह, नं","Visitation class used for the discount":"विज़िटेशन क्लास का उपयोग छूट के लिए किया जाता है","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"कोई छूट नहीं / प्रति माह 2 रातों से कम","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"कक्षा 1 · प्रति माह लगभग 2–3 रातें","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"कक्षा 2 · प्रति माह लगभग 4–8 रातें","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"कक्षा 3 · प्रति माह लगभग 9–13 रातें","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"कक्षा 4 · प्रति माह लगभग 14–15 रातें","Estimate monthly amount":"मासिक राशि का अनुमान लगाएं","Clear entries":"प्रविष्टियाँ साफ़ करें","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"माता-पिता दोनों की वार्षिक सकल आय और बच्चे का आयु समूह दर्ज करें।","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"इस डिवाइस पर परिदृश्य की गणना की गई। NAV आधिकारिक मामलों का निर्णय करता है।","Entries cleared.":"प्रविष्टियाँ साफ़ की गईं।","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"आय, आयु, मुलाक़ात वर्ग और मासिक लागत प्रविष्टियों की जाँच करें।","Simplified monthly scenario":"सरलीकृत मासिक परिदृश्य","Estimated monthly transfer":"अनुमानित मासिक स्थानांतरण","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 महीनों में अनुमानित राशि","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"मासिक रखरखाव-लागत आधार","Age-based consumption reference":"आयु-आधारित उपभोग संदर्भ","Standard housing reference":"मानक आवास संदर्भ","Childcare amount entered":"बाल देखभाल राशि दर्ज की गई","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"साधारण बाल लाभ घटाया गया","Income share before ceilings":"सीमा से पहले आय हिस्सेदारी","Estimate before visitation credit":"मुलाकात क्रेडिट से पहले अनुमान","Visitation credit":"विज़िट क्रेडिट","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 रखरखाव-लागत सीमा","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% वार्षिक-आय सीमा प्रति माह","Parent responsible in this scenario":"इस परिदृश्य में अभिभावक जिम्मेदार हैं","Parent entered as paying":"अभिभावक ने भुगतान के रूप में प्रवेश किया","Other parent":"अन्य अभिभावक","Higher-income parent":"उच्च आय वाले माता-पिता","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"साझा निवास के लिए, टूल उच्च आय वाले माता-पिता की आय हिस्सेदारी की तुलना 50% से करता है।","Assumptions used":"प्रयुक्त धारणाएँ","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"स्टेटिक नॉर्वेजियन 2026 संदर्भ दरें प्रभावी 1 जुलाई; कोई पृष्ठभूमि अद्यतन नहीं.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"राशि को निकटतम NOK 10 तक पूर्णांकित किया गया है। वार्षिक राशि पूर्ण मासिक अनुमान को 12 से गुणा करती है।","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"प्रति गणना एक बच्चा; भुगतान करने की क्षमता, अन्य बच्चे, पूर्ण कर, बाल आय और विशेष मामले मॉडल नहीं किए गए हैं।","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"सभी प्रविष्टियाँ और गणनाएँ इस ब्राउज़र टैब में रहती हैं। इस टूल द्वारा कुछ भी अपलोड या संग्रहीत नहीं किया जाता है।","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · बाल सहायता नियम और मार्गदर्शन","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 संदर्भ दरें और मुलाक़ात कटौती","Norwegian child support regulation":"नार्वेजियन बाल सहायता विनियमन","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"वर्तमान NAV मार्गदर्शन और आधिकारिक कैलकुलेटर की जाँच करें","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"id":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Penaksir Tunjangan Anak Norwegia","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Kalkulator Tunjangan Anak Norwegia 2026 — Perkiraan Perjanjian Pribadi","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Jelajahi skenario tunjangan anak bulanan yang disederhanakan berdasarkan tarif referensi 2026 Norwegia. Masukkan usia anak, pendapatan masing-masing orang tua, biaya penitipan anak, tempat tinggal dan kunjungan untuk melihat asumsi dan perkiraan jumlahnya.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Gunakan perkiraan perencanaan pribadi ini untuk mendiskusikan tunjangan bulanan satu anak. Angka referensi berdasarkan usia dan diskon kunjungan mengikuti tabel 2026 Norwegia; bahasa halaman ini tidak pernah mengubah negara atau aturan.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Berjalan di browser ini. Angka yang Anda masukkan tidak dikirim ke server atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","Example":"Contoh","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Untuk anak berusia 6–10, biaya referensi 2026 sebelum penitipan anak adalah NOK 7,523 dalam konsumsi ditambah NOK 3,811 untuk perumahan, dikurangi NOK 2,012 tunjangan anak biasa: NOK 9,322. Dengan pendapatan orang tua tahunan sebesar NOK 600,000 dan NOK 400,000 serta kelas kunjungan 2, perkiraan satu rumah yang disederhanakan adalah sekitar NOK 3,900 per bulan setelah kredit kunjungan dan pembulatan NOK 1,690.","How the estimate works":"Cara kerja perkiraan","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Alat ini menambahkan jumlah konsumsi 2026 berdasarkan usia dan jumlah tempat tinggal, menambahkan biaya penitipan anak bersih yang memenuhi syarat yang Anda masukkan, dan mengurangi tunjangan anak biasa. Untuk satu rumah utama, ia mengalokasikan biaya ini menggunakan dua pendapatan tahunan yang dimasukkan, menerapkan batas atas biaya 5/6 dan batas atas pendapatan 25%, mengurangi kredit kunjungan 2026 dan membulatkannya ke NOK terdekat 10. Untuk tempat tinggal bersama, diperkirakan bagian orang tua berpendapatan lebih tinggi di atas 50%.","Common questions":"Pertanyaan umum","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Apakah ini menetapkan jumlah yang mengikat secara hukum?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Tidak. Orang tua dapat menyetujuinya secara pribadi, dan NAV sendiri yang membuat keputusan publik. Ini adalah perbandingan yang disederhanakan, bukan keputusan NAV atau kalkulator lengkapnya.","Does page language change these rules?":"Apakah bahasa halaman mengubah aturan ini?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Tidak. Antarmukanya telah diterjemahkan, tetapi tarif dan formula yang ditampilkan adalah bahasa Norwegia dan bertanggal 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Mengapa tarif ada tanggalnya?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV dan Kementerian memperbarui jumlah referensi sepanjang tahun, biasanya dari 1 bulan Juli. Versi ini menggunakan tarif efektif 1 Juli 2026; periksa tabel resmi yang ditautkan sebelum mengandalkan hasilnya.","Scope and limits":"Cakupan dan batasan","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Khusus Norwegia; satu anak per perhitungan, di bawah 18. Skenario yang disederhanakan ini tidak mereproduksi definisi pendapatan NAV secara penuh, perhitungan pajak dan kapasitas untuk membayar, tunjangan penitipan anak/keringanan pajak, pendapatan anak, alokasi banyak anak, jadwal kunjungan yang tidak biasa, dukungan tambahan atau kasus-kasus internasional. Jumlah penitipan anak yang dimasukkan pengguna harus merupakan jumlah bersih bulanan yang memenuhi syarat setelah dukungan atau potongan apa pun yang diketahui pengguna berlaku. Pendapatan adalah pendapatan kotor tahunan yang disederhanakan, bukan penilaian NAV resmi. Jangan menggunakannya sebagai penghargaan, nasihat hukum, atau janji mengenai apa yang harus dibayar oleh salah satu orang tua.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Perkirakan skenario perjanjian pribadi","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Hanya aturan Norwegia · Tabel referensi 2026 efektif 1 Juli · dicentang 17 Oktober 2026 · bahasa tidak mengubah negara.","Child age group":"Kelompok usia anak","0–5 years":"0–5 tahun","6–10 years":"6–10 tahun","11–14 years":"11–14 tahun","15 years and older":"15 tahun ke atas","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Pendapatan kotor tahunan dari tunjangan pembayaran orang tua, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Pendapatan kotor tahunan induk lainnya, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Pengaturan tempat tinggal anak","One primary home":"Satu rumah utama","Shared residence":"Tempat tinggal bersama","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Biaya penitipan anak bersih yang memenuhi syarat per bulan, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opsional. Masukkan hanya jumlah bulanan yang Anda yakini dapat dimasukkan setelah dukungan atau keringanan pajak apa pun; alat tersebut tidak dapat menentukan kelayakan.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Tunjangan anak biasa per bulan, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Kelas kunjungan digunakan untuk diskon","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Tidak ada diskon / kurang dari 2 malam per bulan","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Kelas 1 · sekitar 2–3 malam per bulan","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Kelas 2 · sekitar 4–8 malam per bulan","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Kelas 3 · sekitar 9–13 malam per bulan","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Kelas 4 · sekitar 14–15 malam per bulan","Estimate monthly amount":"Perkirakan jumlah bulanan","Clear entries":"Hapus entri","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Masukkan pendapatan kotor tahunan kedua orang tua dan kelompok usia anak.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Skenario dihitung pada perangkat ini. NAV memutuskan kasus-kasus resmi.","Entries cleared.":"Entri dihapus.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Periksa entri pendapatan, usia, kelas kunjungan, dan biaya bulanan.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Skenario bulanan yang disederhanakan","Estimated monthly transfer":"Estimasi transfer bulanan","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Perkiraan jumlah selama 12 bulan","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Dasar biaya pemeliharaan bulanan","Age-based consumption reference":"Referensi konsumsi berdasarkan usia","Standard housing reference":"Referensi perumahan standar","Childcare amount entered":"Jumlah penitipan anak dimasukkan","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Manfaat anak biasa dikurangi","Income share before ceilings":"Bagi hasil sebelum plafon","Estimate before visitation credit":"Perkiraan sebelum kredit kunjungan","Visitation credit":"Kredit kunjungan","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 plafon biaya pemeliharaan","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% plafon pendapatan tahunan per bulan","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Orang tua bertanggung jawab dalam skenario ini","Parent entered as paying":"Orang tua masuk sebagai pembayar","Other parent":"Induk lainnya","Higher-income parent":"Orang tua berpenghasilan tinggi","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Untuk tempat tinggal bersama, alat ini membandingkan bagi hasil orang tua berpenghasilan tinggi dengan 50%.","Assumptions used":"Asumsi yang digunakan","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Tarif referensi 2026 Norwegia Statis efektif 1 Juli; tidak ada pembaruan latar belakang.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Jumlahnya dibulatkan ke NOK terdekat 10. Jumlah tahunan mengalikan perkiraan bulanan yang dibulatkan dengan 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Satu anak per perhitungan; kapasitas untuk membayar, anak-anak lain, pajak lengkap, pendapatan anak dan kasus-kasus khusus tidak dimodelkan.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Semua entri dan penghitungan tetap berada di tab browser ini. Tidak ada yang diunggah atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · aturan dan panduan tunjangan anak","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · Tarif referensi dan potongan kunjungan 2026","Norwegian child support regulation":"Peraturan tunjangan anak Norwegia","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Periksa panduan NAV saat ini dan kalkulator resmi","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"it":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Stima norvegese del mantenimento dei figli","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Calcolatore del mantenimento dei figli in Norvegia 2026 — Stima del contratto privato","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Esplora uno scenario semplificato per il mantenimento dei figli mensile in base alle tariffe di riferimento norvegesi 2026. Inserisci l'età del bambino, il reddito di ciascun genitore, i costi per l'assistenza all'infanzia, la residenza e le visite per visualizzare le ipotesi e l'importo stimato.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Utilizza questa stima di pianificazione privata per discutere del mantenimento mensile di un bambino. I dati di riferimento basati sull'età e gli sconti sulle visite seguono le tabelle norvegesi 2026 datate; la lingua di questa pagina non cambia mai il paese o le regole.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Viene eseguito in questo browser. Le cifre inserite non vengono inviate a un server o salvate da questo strumento.","Example":"Esempio","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Per un bambino di età compresa tra 6 e 10, il costo di riferimento 2026 prima dell'assistenza all'infanzia è NOK 7,523 in consumi più NOK 3,811 per l'alloggio, meno NOK 2,012 assegno familiare ordinario: NOK 9,322. Con redditi annuali dei genitori di NOK 600,000 e NOK 400,000 e classe di visita 2, la stima semplificata per una casa è di circa NOK 3,900 al mese dopo il credito di visita e l'arrotondamento di NOK 1,690.","How the estimate works":"Come funziona il preventivo","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Lo strumento aggiunge l'importo del consumo 2026 basato sull'età e l'importo dell'alloggio, aggiunge il costo netto ammissibile per l'assistenza all'infanzia inserito e sottrae gli assegni familiari ordinari. Per una casa principale, assegna questo costo utilizzando i due redditi annuali immessi, applica il tetto di costo 5/6 e il tetto di reddito 25%, sottrae il credito di visita 2026 e arrotonda al NOK 10 più vicino. Per la residenza condivisa si stima che la quota del genitore a reddito più elevato sia superiore allo 50%.","Common questions":"Domande comuni","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Imposta un importo legalmente vincolante?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"N. I genitori possono concordare privatamente e solo la NAV prende una decisione pubblica. Questo è un confronto semplificato, non una decisione sul NAV o il suo calcolatore completo.","Does page language change these rules?":"La lingua della pagina modifica queste regole?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"N. L'interfaccia è tradotta, ma le tariffe e la formula mostrate sono norvegesi e datate 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Perché le tariffe hanno una data?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV e il Ministero aggiornano gli importi di riferimento nel corso dell'anno, normalmente a partire da 1 luglio. Questa versione utilizza le tariffe in vigore da 1 luglio 2026; controlla le tabelle ufficiali collegate prima di fare affidamento su un risultato.","Scope and limits":"Ambito e limiti","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Solo Norvegia; un figlio per calcolo, sotto 18. Questo scenario semplificato non riproduce la definizione completa del reddito del NAV, il calcolo delle tasse e della capacità contributiva, il sostegno all’infanzia/sgravi fiscali, il reddito infantile, l’assegnazione di più figli, gli orari insoliti delle visite, il sostegno aggiuntivo o i casi internazionali. L'importo per l'assistenza all'infanzia inserito dall'utente deve corrispondere all'importo mensile netto idoneo dopo eventuali sostegni o detrazioni che l'utente sa che si applicano. Il reddito è un reddito lordo annuale semplificato e non una valutazione ufficiale del NAV. Non utilizzarlo come un premio, una consulenza legale o una promessa di ciò che uno dei genitori dovrà pagare.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Stima uno scenario di accordo privato","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Solo regole norvegesi · 2026 tabelle di riferimento in vigore 1 luglio · controllato 17 ottobre 2026 · la lingua non cambia il paese.","Child age group":"Fascia d'età del bambino","0–5 years":"0–5 anni","6–10 years":"6–10 anni","11–14 years":"11–14 anni","15 years and older":"15 anni e più","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Reddito lordo annuo del genitore che paga il mantenimento, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Reddito lordo annuo dell'altro genitore, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Disposizione residenza dei figli","One primary home":"Una casa principale","Shared residence":"Residenza condivisa","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Costo mensile netto ammissibile per l'assistenza all'infanzia, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opzionale. Inserisci solo l'importo mensile che ritieni possa essere incluso al netto di eventuali sostegni o sgravi fiscali; lo strumento non è in grado di determinare l'idoneità.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Assegno familiare ordinario al mese, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Classe di visita utilizzata per lo sconto","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Nessuno sconto/meno di 2 notti al mese","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Classe 1 · circa 2–3 notti al mese","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Classe 2 · circa 4–8 notti al mese","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Classe 3 · circa 9–13 notti al mese","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Classe 4 · circa 14–15 notti al mese","Estimate monthly amount":"Importo mensile stimato","Clear entries":"Cancella voci","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Inserisci il reddito annuo lordo di entrambi i genitori e la fascia d'età del figlio.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Scenario calcolato su questo dispositivo. Il NAV decide i casi ufficiali.","Entries cleared.":"Voci cancellate.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Controlla le voci relative a reddito, età, classe di visita e costo mensile.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Scenario mensile semplificato","Estimated monthly transfer":"Bonifico mensile stimato","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Importo stimato su 12 mesi","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Base mensile del costo di manutenzione","Age-based consumption reference":"Riferimento consumo basato sull'età","Standard housing reference":"Riferimento custodia standard","Childcare amount entered":"Importo per l'assistenza all'infanzia inserito","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Assegno familiare ordinario sottratto","Income share before ceilings":"Quota di reddito prima dei massimali","Estimate before visitation credit":"Stima prima del credito di visita","Visitation credit":"Credito di visita","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 massimale costi di manutenzione","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% tetto massimo di reddito annuo al mese","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Genitore responsabile in questo scenario","Parent entered as paying":"Genitore inserito come pagante","Other parent":"Altro genitore","Higher-income parent":"Genitore con reddito più elevato","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Per la residenza condivisa, lo strumento confronta la quota di reddito del genitore con reddito più elevato con 50%.","Assumptions used":"Presupposti utilizzati","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Tassi di riferimento statici norvegesi 2026 in vigore da 1 luglio; nessun aggiornamento in background.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"L'importo viene arrotondato al NOK 10 più vicino. L'importo annuale moltiplica la stima mensile arrotondata per 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Un figlio per calcolo; la capacità contributiva, gli altri figli, l'imposta completa, il reddito dei figli e i casi speciali non sono modellizzati.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Tutti gli inserimenti e i calcoli rimangono in questa scheda del browser. Niente viene caricato o archiviato da questo strumento.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · regole e indicazioni sul mantenimento dei figli","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 tariffe di riferimento e detrazioni di visita","Norwegian child support regulation":"Regolamento norvegese sul mantenimento dei figli","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Controlla la guida NAV attuale e il calcolatore ufficiale","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ja":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"ノルウェーの養育費見積もり業者","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"ノルウェーの養育費計算ツール 2026 — 私的合意見積り","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"ノルウェーの 2026 基準レートに基づいて、簡略化された毎月の養育費シナリオを検討します。子供の年齢、保護者それぞれの収入、保育料、住居、面会交流を入力すると、前提条件と概算額が表示されます。","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"このプライベートな計画の見積もりを使用して、1 人の子供の月々のサポートについて話し合ってください。年齢ベースの参照数字と訪問割引は、日付のノルウェーの 2026 表に従います。このページの言語によって国や規則が変更されることはありません。","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"このブラウザで実行されます。入力した数値はサーバーに送信されたり、このツールによって保存されたりすることはありません。","Example":"例","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"年老いた子供のために6–10、2026保育前の参考費用は NOK です7,523消費量プラス NOK3,811住宅用、NOK以下2,012普通児童手当: NOK9,322。親の年収がNOKの場合600,000そしてNOK400,000そして訪問授業2、一戸建ての簡易見積もりは約 NOK です3,900NOK後の月ごと1,690訪問クレジットと丸め。","How the estimate works":"見積もりの​​仕組み","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"このツールは、2026 年齢ベースの消費額と住宅額を加算し、入力した対象となる正味保育費用を加算し、通常の児童手当を差し引きます。 1 つの主な住宅については、入力された 2 つの年収を使用してこのコストを割り当て、5/6 コスト上限と 25% 収入上限を適用し、2026 訪問クレジットを差し引いて、最も近い NOK 10 に四捨五入します。共同住宅の場合、高所得の親のシェアが 50% を超えると推定されます。","Common questions":"よくある質問","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"これは法的拘束力のある金額を設定しますか?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"いいえ。親は個人的に同意することができ、NAV のみが公的決定を行います。これは単純化された比較であり、NAV の決定やその完全な計算ではありません。","Does page language change these rules?":"ページ言語によってこれらのルールは変わりますか?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"いいえ。インターフェイスは翻訳されていますが、表示されているレートと計算式はノルウェー語で、日付は 2026 です。","Why do the rates have a date?":"レートに日付があるのはなぜですか?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV と同省は、年間を通じて、通常 1 7 月から基準金額を更新します。このバージョンでは、7 月の 1 有効料金 2026 が使用されます。結果に頼る前に、リンクされている公式の表を確認してください。","Scope and limits":"範囲と制限","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"ノルウェーのみ; 18 の下で、計算ごとに 1 つの子。この簡略化されたシナリオは、NAV の完全な所得定義、税金と支払い能力の計算、育児支援/税軽減、子供の収入、複数の子供の割り当て、通常とは異なる面会スケジュール、追加の支援、または国際的な事例を再現していません。ユーザーが入力した保育料は、ユーザーが知っているサポートまたは控除が適用された後の対象となる正味月額である必要があります。収入は単純化された年間総収入であり、正式な基準価額評価ではありません。これを賞与、法的アドバイス、または親のどちらかが支払わなければならない金額の約束として使用しないでください。","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"私的合意シナリオの見積もり","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"ノルウェーのルールのみ · 2026 参照テーブルは有効 1 7 月 · チェック済み 17 10 月 2026 · 言語は国を変更しません。","Child age group":"子供の年齢層","0–5 years":"0–5 年","6–10 years":"6–10 年","11–14 years":"11–14 年","15 years and older":"15 歳以上","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"養育費を支払っている親の年間総収入、NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"もう一方の親の年間総収入、NOK","Child residence arrangement":"児童住居の取り決め","One primary home":"主要なホーム 1 つ","Shared residence":"共同住宅","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"月額の対象となる正味保育費、NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"オプション。サポートまたは減税後に含まれると思われる月額のみを入力してください。ツールは適格性を判断できません。","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"月額の普通児童手当、NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"割引に使用される訪問クラス","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"割引なし / 月あたりの宿泊数が 2 未満","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"クラス 1 · 月あたり約 2 ～ 3 泊","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"クラス 2 · 月あたり約 4 ～ 8 泊","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"クラス 3 · 月あたり約 9 ～ 13 泊","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"クラス 4 · 月あたり約 14 ～ 15 泊","Estimate monthly amount":"月額の見積もり","Clear entries":"エントリをクリア","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"両親の年間総収入と子供の年齢層を入力します。","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"シナリオはこのデバイスで計算されました。 NAV が正式な訴訟を決定します。","Entries cleared.":"エントリがクリアされました。","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"収入、年齢、訪問クラス、月額費用の入力を確認します。","Simplified monthly scenario":"簡略化された月次シナリオ","Estimated monthly transfer":"月ごとの推定送金額","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 か月にわたる推定金額","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"月次保守費用ベース","Age-based consumption reference":"年齢に基づく消費量の基準","Standard housing reference":"標準ハウジング参照","Childcare amount entered":"保育金額を入力しました","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"普通児童手当の差し引き","Income share before ceilings":"上限前の所得分配率","Estimate before visitation credit":"訪問クレジット前の見積り","Visitation credit":"訪問クレジット","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 保守コスト上限","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% 月あたりの年収上限","Parent responsible in this scenario":"このシナリオの責任者は親です","Parent entered as paying":"親が支払い者として入力されました","Other parent":"他の親","Higher-income parent":"高所得の親","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"共同住宅の場合、ツールは高所得の親の所得シェアを 50% と比較します。","Assumptions used":"使用される仮定","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"静的ノルウェー 2026 参照レートは 1 7 月に発効。バックグラウンド更新はありません。","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"金額は最も近い NOK 10 に四捨五入されます。年間金額は、四捨五入された月次見積もりに 12 を乗じたものになります。","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"計算ごとに 1 つの子。支払い能力、他の子供、完全な税金、子供の所得、および特別なケースはモデル化されていません。","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"すべてのエントリと計算はこのブラウザ タブに残ります。このツールでは何もアップロードまたは保存されません。","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · 養育費の規則とガイダンス","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 参照レートと訪問控除","Norwegian child support regulation":"ノルウェーの養育費規制","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"現在のNAVガイダンスと公式計算機を確認する","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ko":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"노르웨이 자녀 양육비 추정기","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"노르웨이 자녀 양육비 계산기 2026 — 개인 계약 견적","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"노르웨이 2026 기준율에 따라 단순화된 월간 자녀 양육비 시나리오를 살펴보세요. 자녀 연령, 부모 소득, 보육비, 거주지, 방문 횟수 등을 입력하면 가정 및 추정 금액을 확인할 수 있습니다.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"이 개인 계획 견적을 사용하여 한 자녀의 월간 지원에 대해 논의하십시오. 연령 기반 참조 수치와 방문 할인은 노르웨이 2026 표를 따릅니다. 이 페이지의 언어는 국가나 규칙을 변경하지 않습니다.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"이 브라우저에서 실행됩니다. 입력한 수치는 이 도구에 의해 서버로 전송되거나 저장되지 않습니다.","Example":"예","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"6–10 세 아동의 경우 보육 전 2026 기준 비용은 소비량 NOK 7,523 + 주택용 NOK 3,811, NOK 2,012 일반 아동 혜택: NOK 9,322입니다. 연간 부모 소득이 NOK 600,000 및 NOK 400,000이고 방문 등급이 2인 경우 단순화된 1가구 추정치는 NOK 1,690 방문 크레딧 및 반올림 후 월 약 NOK 3,900입니다.","How the estimate works":"추정 작동 방식","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"이 도구는 2026 연령 기준 소비 금액과 주택 금액을 더하고, 입력한 적격 순 보육 비용을 더하고, 일반 자녀 수당을 뺍니다. 하나의 기본 주택에 대해 입력된 두 연간 소득을 사용하여 이 비용을 할당하고 5/6 비용 한도 및 25% 소득 한도를 적용하고 2026 방문 크레딧을 빼고 가장 가까운 NOK 10로 반올림합니다. 공유 거주지의 경우 고소득 부모의 지분이 50% 이상인 것으로 추정됩니다.","Common questions":"일반적인 질문","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"이것은 법적 구속력이 있는 금액을 설정합니까?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"아니요. 부모는 개인적으로 동의할 수 있으며 NAV만이 공개 결정을 내립니다. 이는 NAV 결정이나 전체 계산기가 아닌 단순화된 비교입니다.","Does page language change these rules?":"페이지 언어가 이 규칙을 변경합니까?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"아니요. 인터페이스는 번역되었지만 표시된 요율과 공식은 노르웨이어이며 날짜는 2026입니다.","Why do the rates have a date?":"요율에 날짜가 있는 이유는 무엇입니까?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV와 교육부는 일반적으로 7월 1부터 연중 참조 금액을 업데이트합니다. 이 버전은 7월 2026 1 유효 요율을 사용합니다. 결과에 의존하기 전에 연결된 공식 테이블을 확인하세요.","Scope and limits":"범위 및 제한","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"노르웨이에만 해당; 18 아래에 계산당 하나의 하위 항목이 있습니다. 이 단순화된 시나리오는 NAV의 전체 소득 정의, 세금 및 지불 능력 계산, 보육 지원/세금 경감, 자녀 소득, 다자녀 할당, 비정상적인 방문 일정, 추가 지원 또는 국제 사례를 재현하지 않습니다. 사용자가 입력한 보육 금액은 사용자가 알고 있는 지원금이나 공제액이 적용되는 후 적격 순 월별 금액이어야 합니다. 소득은 공식 NAV 평가가 아닌 단순화된 연간 총소득입니다. 이를 보상, 법적 조언 또는 부모 중 한 사람이 지불해야 하는 금액에 대한 약속으로 사용하지 마십시오.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"개인 계약 시나리오 추정","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"노르웨이어 규칙만 · 2026 참조 테이블 유효 1 7월 · 확인됨 17 10월 2026 · 언어는 국가를 변경하지 않습니다.","Child age group":"어린이 연령층","0–5 years":"0–5년","6–10 years":"6–10년","11–14 years":"11–14년","15 years and older":"15세 이상","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"부양비를 지불하는 부모의 연간 총수입, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"다른 상위 NOK의 연간 총 소득","Child residence arrangement":"자녀 거주 배치","One primary home":"기본 주택 1개","Shared residence":"공유 레지던스","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"월별 적격 순 보육 비용, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"선택사항. 지원이나 세금 감면 후에 포함될 수 있다고 생각되는 월별 금액만 입력하십시오. 도구는 적격성을 결정할 수 없습니다.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"월별 일반 아동 수당, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"할인에 사용된 방문 클래스","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"할인 없음 / 월 2박 미만","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"클래스 1 · 월별 약 2–3박","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"클래스 2 · 월별 약 4–8박","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"클래스 3 · 월별 약 9–13박","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"클래스 4 · 월별 약 14–15박","Estimate monthly amount":"예상 월별 금액","Clear entries":"항목 지우기","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"부모의 연간 총소득과 자녀의 연령 그룹을 모두 입력하세요.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"이 장치에서 계산된 시나리오입니다. NAV는 공식적인 사건을 결정합니다.","Entries cleared.":"항목이 삭제되었습니다.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"소득, 연령, 방문등급, 월 비용 항목을 확인하세요.","Simplified monthly scenario":"간소화된 월별 시나리오","Estimated monthly transfer":"예상 월별 이체","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12개월 동안 예상 금액","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"월 유지보수 비용 기준","Age-based consumption reference":"연령별 소비 참조","Standard housing reference":"표준 하우징 참조","Childcare amount entered":"보육 금액 입력됨","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"보통 아동 수당 차감","Income share before ceilings":"상한선 전 소득 공유","Estimate before visitation credit":"방문 크레딧 전 추정","Visitation credit":"방문 크레딧","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 유지 관리 비용 한도","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% 월 소득 한도","Parent responsible in this scenario":"이 시나리오의 책임은 부모에게 있습니다.","Parent entered as paying":"부모가 지불자로 입력됨","Other parent":"다른 상위","Higher-income parent":"고소득 부모","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"공유 거주의 경우 도구는 고소득 부모의 소득 지분을 50%와 비교합니다.","Assumptions used":"사용된 가정","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"정적 노르웨이어 2026 참조율은 1 7월부터 적용됩니다. 배경 업데이트가 없습니다.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"금액은 가장 가까운 NOK 10로 반올림됩니다. 연간 금액은 반올림된 월별 추정치에 12를 곱합니다.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"계산당 하나의 하위 항목; 지불 능력, 기타 자녀, 전체 세금, 자녀 소득 및 특수 사례는 모델링되지 않습니다.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"모든 항목과 계산은 이 브라우저 탭에 유지됩니다. 이 도구는 아무것도 업로드하거나 저장하지 않습니다.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · 자녀 양육비 규칙 및 지침","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 참조율 및 방문 공제","Norwegian child support regulation":"노르웨이 아동 양육비 규정","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"현재 NAV 안내 및 공식 계산기 확인","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"mr":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"नॉर्वेजियन चाइल्ड सपोर्ट एस्टिमेटर","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"नॉर्वे चाइल्ड सपोर्ट कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 — खाजगी करार अंदाज","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"नॉर्वेजियन 2026 संदर्भ दरांतर्गत एक सरलीकृत मासिक बाल-समर्थन परिस्थिती एक्सप्लोर करा. गृहीतके आणि अंदाजे रक्कम पाहण्यासाठी मुलाचे वय, प्रत्येक पालकाचे उत्पन्न, बाल संगोपन खर्च, निवासस्थान आणि भेटी प्रविष्ट करा.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"एका मुलाच्या मासिक समर्थनावर चर्चा करण्यासाठी या खाजगी नियोजन अंदाजाचा वापर करा. वय-आधारित संदर्भ आकडे आणि भेट सवलत दिनांकित नॉर्वेजियन 2026 सारण्यांचे अनुसरण करतात; या पृष्ठाची भाषा कधीही देश किंवा नियम बदलत नाही.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते. तुम्ही एंटर केलेले आकडे सर्व्हरला पाठवले जात नाहीत किंवा या टूलद्वारे सेव्ह केले जात नाहीत.","Example":"उदाहरण","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"वयाच्या मुलासाठी6-10, द2026बालसंगोपन करण्यापूर्वी संदर्भ खर्च NOK आहे7,523उपभोग अधिक NOK मध्ये3,811घरांसाठी, कमी NOK2,012सामान्य बालक लाभ: NOK9,322. NOK च्या वार्षिक पालक उत्पन्नासह600,000आणि NOK400,000आणि भेट वर्ग2, सरलीकृत एक-घर अंदाज NOK बद्दल आहे3,900NOK नंतर दरमहा1,690भेट क्रेडिट आणि राउंडिंग.","How the estimate works":"अंदाज कसे कार्य करते","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"साधन जोडते2026वय-आधारित उपभोग रक्कम आणि घरांची रक्कम, तुम्ही एंटर केलेला पात्र निव्वळ चाइल्डकेअर खर्च जोडतो आणि सामान्य बाल लाभ वजा करतो. एका प्राथमिक घरासाठी, दोन प्रविष्ट केलेल्या वार्षिक उत्पन्नांचा वापर करून ही किंमत वाटप करते, लागू होते5/6खर्च कमाल मर्यादा आणि25% उत्पन्न कमाल मर्यादा, वजा करते2026भेट क्रेडिट आणि जवळच्या NOK ला फेऱ्या10. सामायिक निवासासाठी ते वरील उच्च-उत्पन्न पालकांच्या वाट्याचा अंदाज लावते50%","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"हे कायदेशीर बंधनकारक रक्कम सेट करते का?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"नाही. पालक खाजगीरित्या सहमत होऊ शकतात आणि केवळ NAV सार्वजनिक निर्धार करते. ही एक सरलीकृत तुलना आहे, NAV निर्णय किंवा त्याचे संपूर्ण कॅल्क्युलेटर नाही.","Does page language change these rules?":"पानाची भाषा हे नियम बदलते का?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"नाही. इंटरफेस अनुवादित आहे, परंतु दर्शविलेले दर आणि सूत्र नॉर्वेजियन आणि दिनांक 2026 आहेत.","Why do the rates have a date?":"दरांची तारीख का असते?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV आणि मंत्रालयाने वर्षभरातील संदर्भ रक्कम अपडेट केली, साधारणपणे 1 जुलैपासून. ही आवृत्ती 1 जुलै 2026 प्रभावी दर वापरते; निकालावर अवलंबून राहण्यापूर्वी लिंक केलेले अधिकृत तक्ते तपासा.","Scope and limits":"व्याप्ति आणि मर्यादा","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"फक्त नॉर्वे; 18 अंतर्गत, प्रति गणना एक मूल. ही सरलीकृत परिस्थिती NAV ची संपूर्ण उत्पन्न व्याख्या, कर आणि क्षमता-ते-पे मोजणी, चाइल्डकेअर समर्थन/कर सवलत, मुलांचे उत्पन्न, बहु-मुलांचे वाटप, असामान्य भेटीचे वेळापत्रक, अतिरिक्त समर्थन किंवा आंतरराष्ट्रीय प्रकरणे पुनरुत्पादित करत नाही. वापरकर्त्याने एंटर केलेली चाइल्डकेअर रक्कम ही वापरकर्त्याला माहीत असलेल्या कोणत्याही समर्थन किंवा कपातीनंतर पात्र निव्वळ मासिक रक्कम असावी. उत्पन्न हे वार्षिक एकूण उत्पन्न सरलीकृत आहे, अधिकृत NAV मूल्यांकन नाही. त्याचा पुरस्कार, कायदेशीर सल्ला किंवा पालकांनी काय भरावे लागेल याचे वचन म्हणून वापरू नका.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"खाजगी कराराच्या परिस्थितीचा अंदाज लावा","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"केवळ नॉर्वेजियन नियम · 2026 संदर्भ सारणी प्रभावी 1 जुलै · 17 ऑक्टोबर 2026 तपासले · भाषा देश बदलत नाही.","Child age group":"बाल वयोगट","0–5 years":"0–5 वर्षे","6–10 years":"6–10 वर्षे","11–14 years":"11–14 वर्षे","15 years and older":"15 वर्षे आणि जुने","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"सपोर्ट देणाऱ्या पालकांचे वार्षिक सकल उत्पन्न, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"इतर पालकाचे वार्षिक सकल उत्पन्न, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"बाल निवास व्यवस्था","One primary home":"एक प्राथमिक घर","Shared residence":"सामायिक निवासस्थान","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"पात्र निव्वळ चाइल्डकेअर दरमहा खर्च, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"पर्यायी. कोणत्याही समर्थन किंवा कर सवलतीनंतर समाविष्ट केले जाऊ शकते असे तुम्हाला वाटते फक्त मासिक रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा; साधन पात्रता निश्चित करू शकत नाही.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"सामान्य बालक लाभ दरमहा, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"सवलतीसाठी वापरलेला भेट वर्ग","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"सवलत नाही / दर महिन्याला 2 रात्रीपेक्षा कमी","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"क्लास 1 · सुमारे 2–3 रात्री प्रति महिना","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"क्लास 2 · सुमारे 4–8 रात्री प्रति महिना","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"क्लास 3 · सुमारे 9–13 रात्री प्रति महिना","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"क्लास 4 · सुमारे 14–15 रात्री प्रति महिना","Estimate monthly amount":"मासिक रकमेचा अंदाज लावा","Clear entries":"प्रविष्टी साफ करा","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"पालकांचे वार्षिक सकल उत्पन्न आणि मुलाचे वयोगट दोन्ही प्रविष्ट करा.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"या डिव्हाइसवर गणना केलेली परिस्थिती. NAV अधिकृत प्रकरणांचा निर्णय घेते.","Entries cleared.":"प्रविष्टी साफ केल्या.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"उत्पन्न, वय, भेट वर्ग आणि मासिक खर्च नोंदी तपासा.","Simplified monthly scenario":"सरलीकृत मासिक परिस्थिती","Estimated monthly transfer":"अंदाजित मासिक हस्तांतरण","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 महिन्यांपेक्षा जास्त अंदाजे रक्कम","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"मासिक देखभाल-खर्चाचा आधार","Age-based consumption reference":"वय-आधारित उपभोग संदर्भ","Standard housing reference":"मानक गृहनिर्माण संदर्भ","Childcare amount entered":"बाल संगोपन रक्कम प्रविष्ट केली","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"सामान्य बालक लाभ वजा","Income share before ceilings":"मर्यादेपूर्वी उत्पन्नाचा वाटा","Estimate before visitation credit":"व्हिजिटेशन क्रेडिटपूर्वी अंदाज","Visitation credit":"व्हिजिटेशन क्रेडिट","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 देखभाल-खर्च कमाल मर्यादा","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% वार्षिक-उत्पन्न कमाल मर्यादा दरमहा","Parent responsible in this scenario":"या परिस्थितीत पालक जबाबदार","Parent entered as paying":"पालक पेमेंट म्हणून प्रविष्ट झाले","Other parent":"इतर पालक","Higher-income parent":"उच्च-उत्पन्न पालक","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"सामायिक निवासासाठी, हे साधन उच्च उत्पन्न असलेल्या पालकांच्या उत्पन्नाच्या वाटा 50% शी तुलना करते.","Assumptions used":"गृहीतके वापरली","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"स्टॅटिक नॉर्वेजियन 2026 संदर्भ दर प्रभावी 1 जुलै; कोणतीही पार्श्वभूमी अद्यतने नाहीत.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"रक्कम जवळच्या NOK 10 पर्यंत पूर्ण केली जाते. वार्षिक रक्कम गोलाकार मासिक अंदाजाला 12 ने गुणाकार करते.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"गणनेसाठी एक मूल; क्षमता-ते-पे, इतर मुले, संपूर्ण कर, मुलांचे उत्पन्न आणि विशेष प्रकरणे मॉडेल केलेली नाहीत.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"सर्व नोंदी आणि गणना या ब्राउझर टॅबमध्ये राहतील. या साधनाद्वारे काहीही अपलोड किंवा संग्रहित केले जात नाही.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · बाल समर्थन नियम आणि मार्गदर्शन","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 संदर्भ दर आणि भेटी वजावट","Norwegian child support regulation":"नॉर्वेजियन चाइल्ड सपोर्ट रेग्युलेशन","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"वर्तमान NAV मार्गदर्शन आणि अधिकृत कॅल्क्युलेटर तपासा","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ms":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Penganggar Sokongan Kanak-Kanak Norway","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Kalkulator Sokongan Kanak-kanak Norway 2026 — Anggaran Perjanjian Persendirian","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Terokai senario sokongan anak bulanan yang dipermudahkan di bawah kadar rujukan 2026 Norway. Masukkan umur anak, pendapatan setiap ibu bapa, kos penjagaan anak, tempat tinggal dan lawatan untuk melihat andaian dan anggaran amaun.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Gunakan anggaran perancangan peribadi ini untuk membincangkan sokongan bulanan seorang kanak-kanak. Angka rujukan berdasarkan umur dan diskaun lawatan mengikut jadual bertarikh Norway 2026; bahasa halaman ini tidak pernah mengubah negara atau peraturan.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Berjalan dalam penyemak imbas ini. Angka yang anda masukkan tidak dihantar ke pelayan atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","Example":"Contoh","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Untuk kanak-kanak berumur6–10, yang2026kos rujukan sebelum penjagaan anak adalah NOK7,523dalam penggunaan ditambah NOK3,811untuk perumahan, kurangkan NOK2,012faedah kanak-kanak biasa: NOK9,322. Dengan pendapatan ibu bapa tahunan NOK600,000dan NOK400,000dan kelas lawatan2, anggaran satu rumah yang dipermudahkan ialah kira-kira NOK3,900sebulan selepas NOK1,690kredit lawatan dan pembundaran.","How the estimate works":"Bagaimana anggaran berfungsi","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Alat ini menambah jumlah penggunaan berasaskan umur 2026 dan amaun perumahan, menambah kos penjagaan anak bersih yang layak yang anda masukkan dan menolak faedah kanak-kanak biasa. Untuk satu rumah utama, ia memperuntukkan kos ini menggunakan dua pendapatan tahunan yang dimasukkan, menggunakan siling kos 5/6 dan siling pendapatan 25%, menolak kredit lawatan 2026 dan membulatkan ke NOK 10 yang terdekat. Untuk kediaman kongsi ia menganggarkan bahagian ibu bapa berpendapatan lebih tinggi melebihi 50%.","Common questions":"Soalan biasa","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Adakah ini menetapkan jumlah yang mengikat secara sah?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"No. Ibu bapa boleh bersetuju secara peribadi, dan NAB sahaja membuat penentuan umum. Ini adalah perbandingan yang dipermudahkan, bukan keputusan NAV atau kalkulator penuhnya.","Does page language change these rules?":"Adakah bahasa halaman mengubah peraturan ini?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"No. Antara muka diterjemahkan, tetapi kadar dan formula yang ditunjukkan adalah bahasa Norway dan bertarikh 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Mengapa kadar mempunyai tarikh?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV dan jumlah rujukan kemas kini Kementerian sepanjang tahun, biasanya dari 1 Julai. Versi ini menggunakan kadar yang berkesan 1 Julai 2026; semak jadual rasmi yang dipautkan sebelum bergantung pada keputusan.","Scope and limits":"Skop dan had","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Norway sahaja; satu anak setiap pengiraan, di bawah 18. Senario yang dipermudahkan ini tidak menghasilkan semula definisi pendapatan penuh NAV, pengiraan cukai dan kapasiti untuk membayar, bantuan penjagaan anak/pelepasan cukai, pendapatan kanak-kanak, peruntukan berbilang anak, jadual lawatan luar biasa, sokongan tambahan atau kes antarabangsa. Amaun penjagaan kanak-kanak yang dimasukkan pengguna hendaklah amaun bersih bulanan yang layak selepas sebarang sokongan atau potongan yang pengguna tahu dikenakan. Pendapatan adalah pendapatan kasar tahunan yang dipermudahkan, bukan penilaian NAB rasmi. Jangan gunakannya sebagai anugerah, nasihat undang-undang atau janji tentang perkara yang mesti dibayar oleh ibu bapa.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Anggarkan senario perjanjian persendirian","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Peraturan Norway sahaja · Jadual rujukan 2026 berkuat kuasa 1 Julai · disemak 17 Oktober 2026 · bahasa tidak mengubah negara.","Child age group":"Kumpulan umur kanak-kanak","0–5 years":"0–5 tahun","6–10 years":"6–10 tahun","11–14 years":"11–14 tahun","15 years and older":"15 tahun dan lebih tua","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Pendapatan kasar tahunan ibu bapa yang membayar sokongan, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Pendapatan kasar tahunan induk yang lain, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Susunan kediaman kanak-kanak","One primary home":"Satu rumah utama","Shared residence":"Kediaman bersama","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Kos penjagaan anak bersih yang layak sebulan, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Pilihan. Masukkan hanya amaun bulanan yang anda percaya mungkin disertakan selepas sebarang sokongan atau pelepasan cukai; alat itu tidak dapat menentukan kelayakan.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Manfaat kanak-kanak biasa sebulan, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Kelas lawatan digunakan untuk diskaun","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Tiada diskaun / kurang daripada 2 malam setiap bulan","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Kelas 1 · kira-kira 2–3 malam sebulan","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Kelas 2 · kira-kira 4–8 malam sebulan","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Kelas 3 · kira-kira 9–13 malam sebulan","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Kelas 4 · kira-kira 14–15 malam sebulan","Estimate monthly amount":"Anggaran amaun bulanan","Clear entries":"Kosongkan entri","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Masukkan pendapatan kasar tahunan kedua ibu bapa dan kumpulan umur anak.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Senario dikira pada peranti ini. NAB memutuskan kes rasmi.","Entries cleared.":"Entri dikosongkan.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Semak pendapatan, umur, kelas lawatan dan penyertaan kos bulanan.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Senario bulanan yang dipermudahkan","Estimated monthly transfer":"Anggaran pemindahan bulanan","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Anggaran jumlah melebihi 12 bulan","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Asas kos penyelenggaraan bulanan","Age-based consumption reference":"Rujukan penggunaan berasaskan umur","Standard housing reference":"Rujukan perumahan standard","Childcare amount entered":"Jumlah penjagaan kanak-kanak dimasukkan","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Faedah kanak-kanak biasa ditolak","Income share before ceilings":"Bahagian pendapatan sebelum siling","Estimate before visitation credit":"Anggaran sebelum kredit lawatan","Visitation credit":"Kredit lawatan","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 siling kos penyelenggaraan","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% siling pendapatan tahunan sebulan","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Ibu bapa yang bertanggungjawab dalam senario ini","Parent entered as paying":"Ibu bapa masuk sebagai membayar","Other parent":"Ibu bapa lain","Higher-income parent":"Ibu bapa berpendapatan tinggi","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Untuk kediaman berkongsi, alat ini membandingkan bahagian pendapatan ibu bapa berpendapatan tinggi dengan 50%.","Assumptions used":"Andaian yang digunakan","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Kadar rujukan 2026 Norway statik berkuat kuasa 1 Julai; tiada kemas kini latar belakang.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Jumlah dibundarkan kepada NOK 10 terdekat. Amaun tahunan mendarabkan anggaran bulanan bulat dengan 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Satu anak setiap pengiraan; kapasiti untuk membayar, kanak-kanak lain, cukai lengkap, pendapatan kanak-kanak dan kes khas tidak dimodelkan.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Semua entri dan pengiraan kekal dalam tab penyemak imbas ini. Tiada apa-apa yang dimuat naik atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · peraturan dan bimbingan sokongan kanak-kanak","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 kadar rujukan dan potongan lawatan","Norwegian child support regulation":"Peraturan sokongan kanak-kanak Norway","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Semak panduan NAV semasa dan kalkulator rasmi","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"nb":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Norsk barnebidragsvurdering","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Privat avtaleanslag","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Utforsk et forenklet månedlig barnebidragsscenario under norske 2026 referansesatser. Skriv inn barnets alder, hver forelders inntekt, barnepasskostnader, bosted og besøk for å se forutsetningene og estimert beløp.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Bruk dette private planleggingsestimatet for å diskutere ett barns månedlige støtte. De aldersbaserte referansetallene og besøksrabattene følger daterte norske 2026-tabeller; språket på denne siden endrer aldri landet eller reglene.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Kjører i denne nettleseren. Tallene du legger inn sendes ikke til en server eller lagres av dette verktøyet.","Example":"Eksempel","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"For et barn i alderen6–10, den2026referansekostnad før barnepass er kr7,523i forbruk pluss kr3,811til bolig, fratrukket kr2,012ordinær barnetrygd: kr9,322. Med årlige foreldreinntekter på kr600,000og kr400,000og besøksklasse2, er det forenklede enboliganslaget ca kr3,900per måned etter kr1,690besøkskreditt og avrunding.","How the estimate works":"Hvordan anslaget fungerer","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Verktøyet legger til 2026 aldersbasert forbruksbeløp og boligbeløp, legger til den kvalifiserte netto barnepasskostnaden du legger inn, og trekker fra ordinær barnetrygd. For én primærbolig allokerer den denne kostnaden ved å bruke de to oppførte årlige inntektene, bruker kostnadstaket 5/6 og 25 % inntektstak, trekker fra 2026 besøkskreditt og avrunder til nærmeste NOK 10. For delt bolig estimerer den høyinntektsforelderens andel over 50 %.","Common questions":"Vanlige spørsmål","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Gir dette et juridisk bindende beløp?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Nr. Foreldre kan avtale privat, og NAV alene tar en offentlig avgjørelse. Dette er en forenklet sammenligning, ikke et NAV-vedtak eller dens komplette kalkulator.","Does page language change these rules?":"Endrer sidespråk disse reglene?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Nr. Grensesnittet er oversatt, men prisene og formelen som vises er norske og datert 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Hvorfor har prisene en dato?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV og departementet oppdaterer referansebeløp i løpet av året, normalt fra 1 juli. Denne versjonen bruker satser effektive 1 juli 2026; sjekk de koblede offisielle tabellene før du stoler på et resultat.","Scope and limits":"Omfang og begrensninger","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"kun Norge; ett barn per beregning, under 18. Dette forenklede scenariet gjengir ikke NAVs fulle inntektsdefinisjon, skatte- og betalingsevneberegning, barnepass/skattelettelser, barneinntekt, flerbarnstildeling, uvanlige samværsplaner, ekstra støtte eller internasjonale saker. Det brukeroppførte barnepassbeløpet skal være det kvalifiserte netto månedlige beløpet etter støtte eller fradrag brukeren vet gjelder. Inntekt er forenklet årlig bruttoinntekt, ikke en offisiell NAV-vurdering. Ikke bruk det som en pris, juridisk rådgivning eller et løfte om hva en av foreldrene må betale.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Beregn et scenario med privat avtale","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"kun norske regler · 2026 referansetabeller gjeldende 1 juli · sjekket 17 oktober 2026 · språk endrer ikke landet.","Child age group":"Aldersgruppe for barn","0–5 years":"0–5 år","6–10 years":"6–10 år","11–14 years":"11–14 år","15 years and older":"15 år og eldre","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Årlig bruttoinntekt for foreldre som betaler støtte, kr","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Årlig bruttoinntekt til den andre forelderen, kr","Child residence arrangement":"Barneboligordning","One primary home":"Ett primærhjem","Shared residence":"Delt bolig","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Kvalifisert netto barnepasskostnad per måned, kr","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Valgfritt. Angi bare det månedlige beløpet du tror kan være inkludert etter støtte eller skattelettelser; verktøyet kan ikke fastslå kvalifisering.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Alminnelig barnetrygd per måned, kr","Visitation class used for the discount":"Besøksklasse brukt for rabatten","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Ingen rabatt / færre enn 2 netter per måned","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Klasse 1 · omtrent 2–3 netter per måned","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Klasse 2 · omtrent 4–8 netter per måned","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Klasse 3 · omtrent 9–13 netter per måned","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Klasse 4 · omtrent 14–15 netter per måned","Estimate monthly amount":"Estimer månedlig beløp","Clear entries":"Slett oppføringer","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Skriv inn begge foreldrenes årlige bruttoinntekt og barnets aldersgruppe.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Scenario beregnet på denne enheten. NAV avgjør tjenestemannssaker.","Entries cleared.":"Oppføringer slettet.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Sjekk inntekt, alder, besøksklasse og månedlige kostnadsoppføringer.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Forenklet månedlig scenario","Estimated monthly transfer":"Estimert månedlig overføring","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Estimert beløp over 12 måneder","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Månedlig vedlikeholdskostnad","Age-based consumption reference":"Aldersbasert forbruksreferanse","Standard housing reference":"Standardhusreferanse","Childcare amount entered":"Barneomsorgsbeløp angitt","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Vanlig barnetrygd trukket fra","Income share before ceilings":"Inntektsandel før tak","Estimate before visitation credit":"Estimat før besøkskreditt","Visitation credit":"Besøkskreditt","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 tak for vedlikeholdskostnader","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25 % årlig inntektstak per måned","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Foreldreansvarlig i dette scenariet","Parent entered as paying":"Forelder angitt som betalende","Other parent":"Annen forelder","Higher-income parent":"Forelder med høyere inntekt","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"For delt bolig sammenligner verktøyet forelderens inntektsandel med høyere inntekt med 50 %.","Assumptions used":"Forutsetninger brukt","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Statisk norsk 2026 referanserenter effektive 1 juli; ingen bakgrunnsoppdateringer.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Beløpet er avrundet til nærmeste NOK 10. Det årlige beløpet multipliserer det avrundede månedlige anslaget med 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Ett barn per beregning; betalingsevne, andre barn, fullstendig skatt, barneinntekt og spesielle tilfeller er ikke modellert.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Alle oppføringer og beregninger forblir i denne nettleserfanen. Ingenting lastes opp eller lagres av dette verktøyet.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · barnebidragsregler og veiledning","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 referansesatser og besøksfradrag","Norwegian child support regulation":"Norsk barnebidragsforskrift","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Sjekk gjeldende NAV-veiledning og offisiell kalkulator","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"nl":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Noorse schatter van kinderbijslag","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Noorwegen kinderalimentatiecalculator 2026 — Schatting onderhandse overeenkomst","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Ontdek een vereenvoudigd maandelijks kinderalimentatiescenario volgens de Noorse 2026-referentietarieven. Voer de leeftijd van het kind in, het inkomen van elke ouder, de kosten voor kinderopvang, de woonplaats en het bezoekadres om de aannames en het geschatte bedrag te bekijken.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Gebruik deze privéplanning om de maandelijkse ondersteuning van één kind te bespreken. De op leeftijd gebaseerde referentiecijfers en bezoekkortingen volgen gedateerde Noorse 2026-tabellen; de taal van deze pagina verandert nooit het land of de regels.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Wordt uitgevoerd in deze browser. De cijfers die u invoert, worden niet naar een server verzonden of door deze tool opgeslagen.","Example":"Voorbeeld","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Voor een kind in de leeftijd van 6–10 bedragen de referentiekosten 2026 vóór kinderopvang NOK 7,523 voor consumptie plus NOK 3,811 voor huisvesting, minus NOK 2,012 gewone kinderbijslag: NOK 9,322. Met een jaarlijks ouderinkomen van NOK 600,000 en NOK 400,000 en bezoekklasse 2 bedraagt ​​de vereenvoudigde schatting voor één woning ongeveer NOK 3,900 per maand na het NOK 1,690 bezoekkrediet en afronding.","How the estimate works":"Hoe de schatting werkt","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"De tool telt het 2026 op leeftijd gebaseerde consumptiebedrag en het huisvestingsbedrag bij elkaar op, telt de in aanmerking komende netto kosten voor kinderopvang op die u invoert en trekt daar de gewone kinderbijslag van af. Voor één hoofdwoning verdeelt zij deze kosten op basis van de twee ingevoerde jaarinkomens, past het kostenplafond 5/6 en het inkomensplafond 25% toe, trekt het bezoektegoed 2026 af en rondt af op de dichtstbijzijnde NOK 10. Voor gedeelde woningen wordt het aandeel van de ouders met een hoger inkomen geschat op meer dan 50%.","Common questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Is dit een juridisch bindend bedrag?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Nr. Ouders kunnen daar privé mee instemmen, en alleen NAV neemt een publieke beslissing. Dit is een vereenvoudigde vergelijking, geen NAV-beslissing of de volledige rekenmachine.","Does page language change these rules?":"Verandert de paginataal deze regels?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Nr. De interface is vertaald, maar de getoonde tarieven en formule zijn Noors en gedateerd 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Waarom hebben de tarieven een datum?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV en het ministerie werken de referentiebedragen in de loop van het jaar bij, normaliter vanaf 1 juli. Deze versie gebruikt tarieven van 1 juli 2026; controleer de gekoppelde officiële tabellen voordat u op een resultaat vertrouwt.","Scope and limits":"Reikwijdte en limieten","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Alleen Noorwegen; één kind per berekening, onder 18. Dit vereenvoudigde scenario reproduceert niet de volledige inkomensdefinitie van de NAV, de berekening van belastingen en draagkracht, kinderopvangtoeslag/belastingvermindering, kinderinkomen, toewijzing van meerdere kinderen, ongebruikelijke bezoekschema's, extra ondersteuning of internationale gevallen. Het door de gebruiker ingevoerde bedrag voor kinderopvang moet het in aanmerking komende netto maandbedrag zijn, na eventuele ondersteuning of inhoudingen waarvan de gebruiker weet dat deze van toepassing zijn. Het inkomen is een vereenvoudigd jaarlijks bruto-inkomen, geen officiële NAV-beoordeling. Gebruik het niet als beloning, juridisch advies of belofte van wat beide ouders moeten betalen.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Schat een scenario voor een onderhandse overeenkomst","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Alleen Noorse regels · 2026 referentietabellen van kracht 1 juli · gecontroleerd 17 oktober 2026 · taal verandert het land niet.","Child age group":"Leeftijdsgroep van kinderen","0–5 years":"0–5 jaar","6–10 years":"6–10 jaar","11–14 years":"11–14 jaar","15 years and older":"15 jaar en ouder","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Jaarlijks bruto-inkomen van ouder die alimentatie betaalt, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Jaarlijks bruto-inkomen van de andere ouder, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Kinderresidentieregeling","One primary home":"Eén hoofdwoning","Shared residence":"Gedeelde woning","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"In aanmerking komende nettokosten voor kinderopvang per maand, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Optioneel. Vul alleen het maandbedrag in waarvan u denkt dat het in aanmerking komt na eventuele ondersteuning of belastingvermindering; de tool kan niet bepalen of u in aanmerking komt.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Gewone kinderbijslag per maand, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Bezoekingsklasse gebruikt voor de korting","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Geen korting / minder dan 2 nachten per maand","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Klasse 1 · ongeveer 2–3 nachten per maand","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Klasse 2 · ongeveer 4–8 nachten per maand","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Klasse 3 · ongeveer 9–13 nachten per maand","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Klasse 4 · ongeveer 14–15 nachten per maand","Estimate monthly amount":"Schatting van het maandbedrag","Clear entries":"Invoer wissen","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Voer het bruto jaarinkomen van beide ouders in en de leeftijdsgroep van het kind.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Scenario berekend op dit apparaat. NAV beslist over officiële zaken.","Entries cleared.":"Invoer gewist.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Controleer de invoer van inkomen, leeftijd, bezoekklasse en maandlasten.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Vereenvoudigd maandscenario","Estimated monthly transfer":"Geschatte maandelijkse overboeking","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Geschat bedrag over 12 maanden","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Maandelijkse onderhoudskosten","Age-based consumption reference":"Op leeftijd gebaseerde verbruiksreferentie","Standard housing reference":"Standaard behuizingreferentie","Childcare amount entered":"Bedrag kinderopvang ingevoerd","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Gewone kinderbijslag afgetrokken","Income share before ceilings":"Inkomensaandeel vóór plafonds","Estimate before visitation credit":"Schatting vóór bezoektegoed","Visitation credit":"Bezoekstegoed","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 onderhoudskosten plafond","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% jaarlijks inkomensplafond per maand","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Ouderverantwoordelijk in dit scenario","Parent entered as paying":"Ouder ingevoerd als betalend","Other parent":"Andere ouder","Higher-income parent":"Ouder met een hoger inkomen","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Voor gedeelde woningen vergelijkt de tool het inkomensaandeel van de ouders met een hoger inkomen met 50%.","Assumptions used":"Gebruikte aannames","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Statische Noorse 2026 referentiekoersen effectief 1 juli; geen achtergrondupdates.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Het bedrag wordt afgerond op de dichtstbijzijnde NOK 10. Het jaarlijkse bedrag vermenigvuldigt de afgeronde maandelijkse schatting met 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Eén kind per berekening; draagkracht, overige kinderen, volledige belasting, kinderinkomen en bijzondere gevallen worden niet gemodelleerd.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Alle invoer en berekeningen blijven op dit browsertabblad staan. Er wordt niets geüpload of opgeslagen door deze tool.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · Regels en richtlijnen voor kinderbijslag","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 referentietarieven en bezoekaftrek","Norwegian child support regulation":"Noorse kinderbijslagregeling","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Bekijk de huidige NAV-richtlijnen en de officiële rekenmachine","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"pl":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Norweski kalkulator alimentów","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norweski kalkulator alimentów 2026 — wycena umowy prywatnej","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Poznaj uproszczony scenariusz miesięcznych alimentów na podstawie norweskich stawek referencyjnych 2026. Wpisz wiek dziecka, dochody każdego z rodziców, koszty opieki nad dzieckiem, miejsce zamieszkania i wizyty, aby zobaczyć założenia i szacunkową kwotę.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Wykorzystaj ten kosztorys dotyczący prywatnego planowania, aby omówić miesięczne alimenty na jedno dziecko. Dane referencyjne oparte na wieku i zniżki na wizyty są zgodne z przestarzałymi norweskimi tabelami 2026; język tej strony nigdy nie zmienia kraju ani zasad.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Działa w tej przeglądarce. Wprowadzone liczby nie są wysyłane na serwer ani zapisywane przez to narzędzie.","Example":"Przykład","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"W przypadku dziecka w wieku 6–10 koszt referencyjny 2026 przed opieką nad dzieckiem wynosi NOK 7,523 na cele konsumpcyjne plus NOK 3,811 na mieszkanie, minus NOK 2,012 zwykły zasiłek na dziecko: NOK 9,322. Przy rocznych dochodach rodziców wynoszących NOK 600,000 i NOK 400,000 oraz klasie wizyt 2, uproszczone szacunki dotyczące jednego domu wynoszą około NOK 3,900 miesięcznie po zaliczeniu wizyt 1,690 NOK i zaokrągleniu.","How the estimate works":"Jak działa oszacowanie","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Narzędzie dodaje kwotę zużycia 2026 na podstawie wieku i kwotę mieszkania, dodaje wprowadzony przez Ciebie kwalifikujący się koszt opieki nad dzieckiem netto i odejmuje zwykły zasiłek na dziecko. W przypadku jednego domu głównego przydziela ten koszt przy użyciu dwóch wprowadzonych rocznych dochodów, stosuje pułap kosztów 5/6 i pułap dochodu 25%, odejmuje 2026 kredyt na wizyty i zaokrągla do najbliższej NOK 10. W przypadku wspólnego miejsca zamieszkania szacuje się, że udział rodziców o wyższych dochodach przekracza 50%.","Common questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Czy stanowi to prawnie wiążącą kwotę?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Nie. Rodzice mogą wyrazić zgodę prywatnie, a NAV samodzielnie podejmuje decyzję publicznie. Jest to uproszczone porównanie, a nie decyzja NAV lub jej pełny kalkulator.","Does page language change these rules?":"Czy język strony zmienia te zasady?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Nie. Interfejs jest przetłumaczony, ale wyświetlane stawki i formuła są norweskie i datowane na 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Dlaczego stawki mają datę?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV i Ministerstwo aktualizują kwoty referencyjne w ciągu roku, zwykle począwszy od 1 w lipcu. Ta wersja wykorzystuje stawki obowiązujące 1 Lipiec 2026; sprawdź połączone oficjalne tabele, zanim zaczniesz polegać na wynikach.","Scope and limits":"Zakres i ograniczenia","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Tylko Norwegia; jedno dziecko na obliczenie, poniżej 18. Ten uproszczony scenariusz nie uwzględnia pełnej definicji dochodu NAV, obliczenia podatku i zdolności do płacenia, zasiłku/ulgi podatkowej na opiekę nad dzieckiem, dochodu na dziecko, przydziału wielu dzieci, nietypowych harmonogramów wizyt, dodatkowego wsparcia ani spraw międzynarodowych. Kwota na opiekę nad dzieckiem wprowadzona przez użytkownika powinna być kwalifikującą się miesięczną kwotą netto po uwzględnieniu wszelkich wsparcia i odliczeń, o których użytkownik wie, że mają zastosowanie. Dochód to uproszczony roczny dochód brutto, a nie oficjalna ocena NAV. Nie traktuj tego jako nagrody, porady prawnej ani obietnicy zapłaty któregokolwiek z rodziców.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Oszacuj scenariusz umowy prywatnej","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Tylko reguły norweskie · 2026 tabele referencyjne obowiązują 1 lipiec · sprawdzone 17 październik 2026 · język nie zmienia kraju.","Child age group":"Grupa wiekowa dziecka","0–5 years":"0–5 lat","6–10 years":"6–10 lat","11–14 years":"11–14 lat","15 years and older":"15 lat i starszych","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Roczny dochód brutto rodziców płacących alimenty, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Roczny dochód brutto drugiego rodzica, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Aranżacja miejsca zamieszkania dziecka","One primary home":"Jeden główny dom","Shared residence":"Wspólne mieszkanie","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Kwalifikowalny miesięczny koszt opieki nad dzieckiem netto, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opcjonalne. Wprowadź tylko miesięczną kwotę, którą Twoim zdaniem można uwzględnić po uwzględnieniu wsparcia lub ulgi podatkowej; narzędzie nie może określić kwalifikowalności.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Zwykły miesięczny zasiłek na dziecko, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Klasa odwiedzin używana do zniżki","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Brak zniżki / mniej niż 2 nocy miesięcznie","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Klasa 1 · około 2–3 nocy w miesiącu","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Klasa 2 · około 4–8 nocy w miesiącu","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Klasa 3 · około 9–13 nocy w miesiącu","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Klasa 4 · około 14–15 nocy w miesiącu","Estimate monthly amount":"Oszacuj miesięczną kwotę","Clear entries":"Wyczyść wpisy","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Wprowadź roczny dochód brutto obojga rodziców i grupę wiekową dziecka.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Scenariusz obliczony na tym urządzeniu. NAV rozstrzyga oficjalne sprawy.","Entries cleared.":"Wpisy zostały usunięte.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Sprawdź dochód, wiek, klasę odwiedzin i wpisy dotyczące miesięcznych kosztów.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Uproszczony scenariusz miesięczny","Estimated monthly transfer":"Szacowany transfer miesięczny","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Szacowana kwota na przestrzeni 12 miesięcy","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Podstawa miesięcznych kosztów konserwacji","Age-based consumption reference":"Odniesienie do zużycia na podstawie wieku","Standard housing reference":"Odniesienie do standardowej obudowy","Childcare amount entered":"Wprowadzono kwotę opieki nad dzieckiem","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Odjęto zwykły zasiłek na dziecko","Income share before ceilings":"Udział w dochodach przed pułapami","Estimate before visitation credit":"Oszacowanie przed zaliczeniem wizyty","Visitation credit":"Zaliczenie wizyty","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 pułap kosztów konserwacji","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% pułap rocznego dochodu na miesiąc","Parent responsible in this scenario":"W tym scenariuszu odpowiedzialny jest rodzic","Parent entered as paying":"Rodzit nadrzędny wpisany jako płacący","Other parent":"Inny element nadrzędny","Higher-income parent":"Rodzic o wyższych dochodach","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"W przypadku wspólnego miejsca zamieszkania narzędzie porównuje udział w dochodach rodzica o wyższych dochodach z 50%.","Assumptions used":"Zastosowano założenia","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Statyczne norweskie stawki referencyjne 2026 obowiązujące 1 lipiec; brak aktualizacji w tle.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Kwota jest zaokrąglana do najbliższej NOK 10. Kwota roczna jest mnożona zaokrągloną miesięczną wartością szacunkową przez 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Jedno dziecko na obliczenie; zdolność do płacenia, inne dzieci, całkowity podatek, dochód dziecka i szczególne przypadki nie są modelowane.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Wszystkie wpisy i obliczenia pozostają w tej zakładce przeglądarki. To narzędzie nie przesyła ani nie przechowuje żadnych treści.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · zasady i wytyczne dotyczące alimentów na dzieci","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 stawki referencyjne i odliczenia za wizyty","Norwegian child support regulation":"Norweskie przepisy dotyczące alimentów","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Sprawdź aktualne wytyczne NAV i oficjalny kalkulator","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"pt":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Estimador Norueguês de Apoio à Criança","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Calculadora de pensão alimentícia da Noruega 2026 - Estimativa de contrato privado","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Explore um cenário simplificado de pensão alimentícia mensal sob as taxas de referência norueguesas 2026. Insira a idade da criança, a renda de cada pai, custos de creche, residência e visitação para ver as premissas e o valor estimado.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Use esta estimativa de planejamento privado para discutir o apoio mensal de uma criança. Os números de referência baseados na idade e os descontos para visitas seguem tabelas norueguesas datadas 2026; o idioma desta página nunca altera o país ou as regras.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Executa neste navegador. Os valores inseridos não são enviados para um servidor nem salvos por esta ferramenta.","Example":"Exemplo","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Para uma criança com idade entre 6 – 10, o custo de referência 2026 antes do cuidado infantil é NOK 7,523 em consumo mais NOK 3,811 para moradia, menos NOK 2,012 benefício infantil comum: NOK 9,322. Com renda anual dos pais de NOK 600,000 e NOK 400,000 e classe de visitação 2, a estimativa simplificada de uma casa é de cerca de NOK 3,900 por mês após o crédito de visitação e arredondamento de NOK 1,690.","How the estimate works":"Como funciona a estimativa","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"A ferramenta adiciona o valor de consumo com base na idade 2026 e o valor da moradia, adiciona o custo líquido elegível de cuidado infantil inserido e subtrai o benefício infantil comum. Para uma residência principal, ele aloca esse custo usando as duas receitas anuais inseridas, aplica o teto de custo 5/6 e o teto de renda 25%, subtrai o crédito de visitação 2026 e arredonda para o NOK 10 mais próximo. Para a residência partilhada estima-se que a percentagem dos pais com rendimentos mais elevados seja superior a 50%.","Common questions":"Perguntas comuns","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Isso define um valor juridicamente vinculativo?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Não. Os pais podem concordar em particular, e somente o NAV faz uma determinação pública. Esta é uma comparação simplificada, não uma decisão NAV ou sua calculadora completa.","Does page language change these rules?":"O idioma da página altera essas regras?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Não. A interface está traduzida, mas as taxas e a fórmula mostradas são norueguesas e datadas de 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Por que as tarifas têm data?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV e o Ministério atualizam os valores de referência durante o ano, normalmente a partir de 1 julho. Esta versão utiliza taxas efetivas 1 julho 2026; verifique as tabelas oficiais vinculadas antes de confiar em um resultado.","Scope and limits":"Escopo e limites","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Somente Noruega; um filho por cálculo, sob 18. Este cenário simplificado não reproduz a definição completa de rendimento do NAV, cálculo de impostos e capacidade de pagamento, apoio/redução fiscal de cuidados infantis, rendimento infantil, atribuição de múltiplos filhos, horários de visitação incomuns, apoio extra ou casos internacionais. O valor de assistência infantil inserido pelo usuário deve ser o valor mensal líquido elegível após qualquer suporte ou deduções que o usuário sabe que se aplicam. A renda é a renda bruta anual simplificada, não uma avaliação oficial do NAV. Não use isso como um prêmio, aconselhamento jurídico ou uma promessa de quanto qualquer um dos pais deve pagar.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Estimar um cenário de contrato privado","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Somente regras norueguesas · Tabelas de referência 2026 em vigor 1 Julho · verificado 17 Outubro 2026 · idioma não altera o país.","Child age group":"Faixa etária infantil","0–5 years":"0–5 anos","6–10 years":"6–10 anos","11–14 years":"11–14 anos","15 years and older":"15 anos ou mais","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Rendimento bruto anual do apoio aos pais, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Rendimento bruto anual do outro progenitor, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Arranjo de residência infantil","One primary home":"Uma casa principal","Shared residence":"Residência compartilhada","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Custo líquido elegível de cuidados infantis por mês, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opcional. Insira apenas o valor mensal que acredita poder ser incluído após qualquer apoio ou redução fiscal; a ferramenta não pode determinar a elegibilidade.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Benefício infantil normal por mês, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Classe de visitação utilizada para o desconto","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Sem desconto/menos de 2 noites por mês","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Classe 1 · cerca de 2–3 noites por mês","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Classe 2 · cerca de 4–8 noites por mês","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Classe 3 · cerca de 9–13 noites por mês","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Classe 4 · cerca de 14–15 noites por mês","Estimate monthly amount":"Estimar valor mensal","Clear entries":"Limpar entradas","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Insira a renda bruta anual de ambos os pais e a faixa etária da criança.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Cenário calculado neste dispositivo. NAV decide casos oficiais.","Entries cleared.":"Inscrições apagadas.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Consulte renda, idade, classe de visitação e lançamentos de custos mensais.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Cenário mensal simplificado","Estimated monthly transfer":"Transferência mensal estimada","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Valor estimado em 12 meses","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Base mensal de custo de manutenção","Age-based consumption reference":"Referência de consumo com base na idade","Standard housing reference":"Referência de alojamento padrão","Childcare amount entered":"Valor de assistência infantil inserido","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Benefício infantil normal subtraído","Income share before ceilings":"Compartilhamento de renda antes dos tetos","Estimate before visitation credit":"Estimativa antes do crédito de visitação","Visitation credit":"Crédito de visita","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 teto de custo de manutenção","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% teto de renda anual por mês","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Progenitor responsável neste cenário","Parent entered as paying":"Progenitor inserido como pagador","Other parent":"Outro pai","Higher-income parent":"Pais de renda mais alta","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Para residência compartilhada, a ferramenta compara a participação na renda do pai de renda mais alta com 50%.","Assumptions used":"Suposições usadas","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Taxas de referência norueguesas estáticas 2026 em vigor 1 julho; sem atualizações em segundo plano.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"O valor é arredondado para o NOK 10 mais próximo. O valor anual multiplica a estimativa mensal arredondada por 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Um filho por cálculo; capacidade de pagamento, outros filhos, impostos completos, rendimento infantil e casos especiais não são modelados.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Todas as entradas e cálculos permanecem nesta aba do navegador. Nada é carregado ou armazenado por esta ferramenta.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · regras e orientações sobre pensão alimentícia","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 taxas de referência e deduções de visitação","Norwegian child support regulation":"Regulamento norueguês de pensão alimentícia","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Verifique a orientação NAV atual e a calculadora oficial","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ru":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Норвежский оценщик алиментов","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Калькулятор алиментов на ребенка в Норвегии 2026 — оценка по частному соглашению","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Изучите упрощенный сценарий ежемесячного выплаты алиментов по норвежским базовым ставкам 2026. Введите возраст ребенка, доход каждого родителя, расходы на уход за детьми, место проживания и посещения, чтобы увидеть предположения и ориентировочную сумму.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Используйте эту частную оценку планирования, чтобы обсудить ежемесячные выплаты на одного ребенка. Справочные данные по возрасту и скидки на посещение соответствуют датированным норвежским таблицам 2026; язык этой страницы никогда не меняет страну или правила.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Запускается в этом браузере. Введенные вами цифры не отправляются на сервер и не сохраняются этим инструментом.","Example":"Пример","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Для ребенка в возрасте 6–10 базовая стоимость 2026 до ухода за ребенком составляет NOK 7,523 потребления плюс NOK 3,811 на жилье, за вычетом обычного детского пособия 2,012 NOK: NOK 9,322. При годовом доходе родителей в размере NOK 600,000 и NOK 400,000 и классе посещения 2 упрощенная оценка одного дома составляет около NOK 3,900 в месяц после учета посещения NOK 1,690 и округления.","How the estimate works":"Как работает оценка","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Инструмент суммирует сумму потребления 2026 с учетом возраста и стоимость жилья, добавляет введенные вами приемлемые чистые расходы на уход за детьми и вычитает обычное пособие на ребенка. Для одного основного дома эта стоимость распределяется с использованием двух введенных годовых доходов, применяется потолок затрат 5/6 и потолок дохода 25%, вычитается кредит за посещение 2026 и округляется до ближайшей норвежской кроны 10. Для совместного проживания доля родителей с более высоким доходом оценивается выше 50%.","Common questions":"Общие вопросы","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Означает ли это юридически обязательную сумму?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Нет. Родители могут договориться в частном порядке, и только NAV вынесет публичное решение. Это упрощенное сравнение, а не решение NAV или его полный калькулятор.","Does page language change these rules?":"Изменяет ли язык страницы эти правила?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Нет. Интерфейс переведен, но цены и формулы показаны на норвежском языке и датированы 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Почему в тарифах указана дата?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV и Министерство обновляют справочные суммы в течение года, обычно с 1 июля. В этой версии используются тарифы, действующие 1 за июль 2026; проверьте связанные официальные таблицы, прежде чем полагаться на результат.","Scope and limits":"Объем и ограничения","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Только для Норвегии; один дочерний элемент на расчет под номером 18. Этот упрощенный сценарий не воспроизводит полное определение дохода NAV, расчет налога и платежеспособности, поддержку по уходу за ребенком/налоговые льготы, доход ребенка, распределение нескольких детей, необычные графики посещений, дополнительную поддержку или международные дела. Введенная пользователем сумма по уходу за ребенком должна представлять собой соответствующую чистую ежемесячную сумму после применения любых алиментов или вычетов, о которых известно пользователю. Доход представляет собой упрощенный годовой валовой доход, а не официальную оценку чистой стоимости активов. Не используйте его как награду, юридическую консультацию или обещание суммы, которую должен заплатить любой из родителей.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Оценить сценарий частного соглашения","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Только норвежские правила · 2026 справочные таблицы действуют 1 июль · проверено 17 октябрь 2026 · язык не меняет страну.","Child age group":"Детская возрастная группа","0–5 years":"0–5 лет","6–10 years":"6–10 лет","11–14 years":"11–14 лет","15 years and older":"15 лет и старше","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Годовой валовой доход родителя, выплачивающего алименты, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Годовой валовой доход другого родителя, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Обустройство детского дома","One primary home":"Один основной дом","Shared residence":"Совместное проживание","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Приемлемая чистая стоимость ухода за ребенком в месяц, норвежские кроны","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Необязательно. Введите только ту ежемесячную сумму, которая, по вашему мнению, может быть включена после какой-либо поддержки или налоговых льгот; инструмент не может определить право на участие.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Обычное пособие на ребенка в месяц, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Класс посещения, используемый для скидки","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Без скидки / менее 2 ночей в месяц","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Класс 1 · около 2–3 ночей в месяц","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Класс 2 · около 4–8 ночей в месяц","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Класс 3 · около 9–13 ночей в месяц","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Класс 4 · около 14–15 ночей в месяц","Estimate monthly amount":"Оценочная ежемесячная сумма","Clear entries":"Очистить записи","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Введите годовой валовой доход обоих родителей и возрастную группу ребенка.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Сценарий рассчитан на этом устройстве. НАВ решает официальные дела.","Entries cleared.":"Записи удалены.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Проверьте доход, возраст, класс посещения и записи ежемесячных затрат.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Упрощенный ежемесячный сценарий","Estimated monthly transfer":"Ориентировочный ежемесячный перевод","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Оценочная сумма за 12 месяцев","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Ежемесячная стоимость обслуживания","Age-based consumption reference":"Справочник по потреблению в зависимости от возраста","Standard housing reference":"Номер стандартного корпуса","Childcare amount entered":"Введена сумма по уходу за ребенком","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Обычное пособие на ребенка вычтено","Income share before ceilings":"Доля дохода до потолков","Estimate before visitation credit":"Оцените кредит до посещения","Visitation credit":"Бонус за посещение","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 потолок затрат на техническое обслуживание","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% максимального годового дохода в месяц","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Родитель несет ответственность в этом сценарии","Parent entered as paying":"Родитель указан как платящий","Other parent":"Другой родительский элемент","Higher-income parent":"Родитель с более высоким доходом","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Для совместного проживания инструмент сравнивает долю дохода родителя с более высоким доходом с 50%.","Assumptions used":"Использованные предположения","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Статические норвежские справочные ставки 2026, действующие в июле 1; никаких фоновых обновлений.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Сумма округляется до ближайшего NOK 10. Годовая сумма умножается на округленную месячную оценку на 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Один дочерний элемент на расчет; платежеспособность, другие дети, полный налог, детский доход и особые случаи не моделируются.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Все записи и расчеты остаются на этой вкладке браузера. Этот инструмент ничего не загружает и не сохраняет.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · правила и рекомендации по выплате алиментов","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 справочные ставки и вычеты за посещение","Norwegian child support regulation":"Норвежские правила об алиментах","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Проверьте текущее руководство по навигации и официальный калькулятор","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"sv":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Norsk barnbidragsberäkning","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norge Child Support Calculator 2026 — Privat avtalsuppskattning","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Utforska ett förenklat månatligt barnbidragsscenario under norska 2026 referenspriser. Ange barnets ålder, varje förälders inkomst, barnomsorgskostnader, boende och umgänge för att se antaganden och uppskattat belopp.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Använd denna privata planeringsuppskattning för att diskutera ett barns månatliga stöd. De åldersbaserade referenssiffrorna och besöksrabatterna följer daterade norska 2026-tabeller; språket på denna sida ändrar aldrig landet eller reglerna.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Körs i denna webbläsare. Siffrorna du anger skickas inte till en server eller sparas av detta verktyg.","Example":"Exempel","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"För ett barn i åldern6–10, den2026referenskostnad före barnomsorg är NOK7,523i förbrukning plus kr3,811för bostad, minus kr2,012ordinarie barnbidrag: kr9,322. Med årliga förälderinkomster på NOK600,000och NOK400,000och besöksklass2, den förenklade enbostadsuppskattningen är ca NOK3,900per månad efter NOK1,690besökskredit och avrundning.","How the estimate works":"Hur uppskattningen fungerar","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Verktyget lägger till det åldersbaserade konsumtionsbeloppet och bostadsbeloppet 2026, lägger till den berättigade nettokostnaden för barnomsorg du anger och drar av vanlig barnbidrag. För en primär bostad allokerar den denna kostnad med hjälp av de två angivna årliga inkomsterna, tillämpar kostnadstaket 5/6 och inkomsttaket 25 %, subtraherar 2026 besökskrediten och avrundar till närmaste NOK 10. För delad bostad uppskattar den förälderns andel med högre inkomster över 50 %.","Common questions":"Vanliga frågor","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Ställer detta in ett juridiskt bindande belopp?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Nr. Föräldrar kan komma överens privat, och NAV ensam fattar ett offentligt beslut. Detta är en förenklad jämförelse, inte ett NAV-beslut eller dess fullständiga kalkylator.","Does page language change these rules?":"Ändrar sidspråk dessa regler?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Nr. Gränssnittet är översatt, men priserna och formeln som visas är norska och daterade 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Varför har priserna ett datum?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV och ministeriet uppdaterar referensbeloppen under året, normalt från 1 juli. Den här versionen använder kurser som gäller 1 juli 2026; kontrollera de länkade officiella tabellerna innan du förlitar dig på ett resultat.","Scope and limits":"Omfattning och begränsningar","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Endast Norge; ett barn per beräkning, under 18. Detta förenklade scenario återger inte NAV:s fullständiga inkomstdefinition, beräkning av skatt och betalningsförmåga, barnomsorgsstöd/skattelättnader, barninkomst, flerbarnstilldelning, ovanliga besöksscheman, extra stöd eller internationella fall. Det av användaren angivna barnomsorgsbeloppet bör vara det berättigade nettobeloppet per månad efter eventuellt stöd eller avdrag som användaren vet gäller. Inkomst är en förenklad årlig bruttoinkomst, inte en officiell NAV-bedömning. Använd det inte som en utmärkelse, juridisk rådgivning eller ett löfte om vad någon av föräldrarna måste betala.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Uppskatta ett privat avtalsscenario","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Endast norska regler · 2026 referenstabeller gäller 1 juli · markerad 17 oktober 2026 · språket ändrar inte landet.","Child age group":"Barns åldersgrupp","0–5 years":"0–5 år","6–10 years":"6–10 år","11–14 years":"11–14 år","15 years and older":"15 år och äldre","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Årlig bruttoinkomst för förälder som betalar stöd, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Årlig bruttoinkomst för den andra föräldern, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Barnboende","One primary home":"Ett primärt hem","Shared residence":"Delad bostad","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Berättigande nettokostnad för barnomsorg per månad, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Tillval. Ange endast det månatliga belopp som du tror kan inkluderas efter eventuellt stöd eller skattelättnader; verktyget kan inte avgöra behörighet.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Vanlig barnbidrag per månad, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Besöksklass som används för rabatten","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Ingen rabatt / färre än 2 nätter per månad","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Klass 1 · ungefär 2–3 nätter per månad","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Klass 2 · ungefär 4–8 nätter per månad","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Klass 3 · ungefär 9–13 nätter per månad","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Klass 4 · ungefär 14–15 nätter per månad","Estimate monthly amount":"Uppskatta månadsbelopp","Clear entries":"Rensa poster","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Ange båda föräldrarnas årliga bruttoinkomst och barnets åldersgrupp.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Scenario beräknat på denna enhet. NAV avgör tjänsteärenden.","Entries cleared.":"Inmatningar raderade.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Kontrollera inkomst, ålder, besöksklass och månadskostnadsposter.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Förenklat månadsscenario","Estimated monthly transfer":"Uppskattad månadsöverföring","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Uppskattat belopp över 12 månader","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Månatlig underhållskostnad","Age-based consumption reference":"Åldersbaserad förbrukningsreferens","Standard housing reference":"Referens för standardhus","Childcare amount entered":"Barnomsorgsbelopp angett","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Vanlig barnbidrag dras av","Income share before ceilings":"Inkomstandel före tak","Estimate before visitation credit":"Uppskattning före besökskredit","Visitation credit":"Besökskredit","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 tak för underhållskostnad","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25 % årsinkomsttak per månad","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Ansvarig förälder i detta scenario","Parent entered as paying":"Förälder angavs som betalande","Other parent":"Annan förälder","Higher-income parent":"Höginkomsttagare","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"För delad bostad jämför verktyget den högre inkomstförälderns inkomstandel med 50 %.","Assumptions used":"Antagna antaganden","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Statiska norska 2026 referenskurser gällande 1 juli; inga bakgrundsuppdateringar.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Beloppet avrundas till närmaste NOK 10. Det årliga beloppet multiplicerar den avrundade månatliga uppskattningen med 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Ett barn per beräkning; betalningsförmåga, andra barn, fullständig skatt, barninkomst och särskilda fall modelleras inte.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Alla poster och beräkningar stannar på den här webbläsarfliken. Ingenting laddas upp eller lagras av detta verktyg.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · barnbidragsregler och vägledning","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 referensräntor och besöksavdrag","Norwegian child support regulation":"Norsk barnbidragsförordning","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Kontrollera aktuell NAV-vägledning och officiell kalkylator","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"sw":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Mkadiriaji wa Msaada wa Mtoto wa Norway","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Kikokotoo cha Kusaidia Mtoto cha Norwe 2026 — Makadirio ya Makubaliano ya Kibinafsi","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Gundua hali iliyorahisishwa ya kila mwezi ya usaidizi wa mtoto chini ya viwango vya marejeleo vya 2026 ya Norwe. Weka umri wa mtoto, mapato ya kila mzazi, gharama za malezi ya mtoto, makazi na matembezi ili kuona mawazo na kiasi kinachokadiriwa.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Tumia kadirio hili la kupanga la faragha kujadili usaidizi wa kila mwezi wa mtoto mmoja. Takwimu za marejeleo za umri na punguzo la kutembelewa hufuata majedwali ya tarehe 2026 ya Kinorwe; lugha ya ukurasa huu kamwe haibadilishi nchi au sheria.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Hufanya kazi katika kivinjari hiki. Takwimu unazoingiza hazitumwi kwa seva au kuhifadhiwa na zana hii.","Example":"Mfano","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Kwa mtoto mwenye umri wa miaka6-10,,2026gharama ya kumbukumbu kabla ya malezi ya watoto ni NOK7,523katika matumizi pamoja na NOK3,811kwa makazi, chini ya NOK2,012faida ya mtoto wa kawaida: NOK9,322. Na mapato ya kila mwaka ya mzazi ya NOK600,000na NOK400,000na darasa la kutembelea2, makadirio yaliyorahisishwa ya nyumba moja ni kuhusu NOK3,900kwa mwezi baada ya NOK1,690mkopo wa kutembelea na kuzungusha.","How the estimate works":"Jinsi makadirio yanavyofanya kazi","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Chombo kinaongeza2026kiasi cha matumizi kulingana na umri na kiasi cha nyumba, huongeza gharama inayostahiki ya malezi ya mtoto unayoweka, na kupunguza manufaa ya kawaida ya mtoto. Kwa nyumba moja ya msingi, inatenga gharama hii kwa kutumia mapato mawili ya mwaka yaliyoingizwa, inatumika5/6dari ya gharama na25% kiwango cha mapato, hupunguza2026mkopo wa kutembelea na mzunguko kwa NOK iliyo karibu zaidi10. Kwa makazi ya pamoja inakadiria sehemu ya mzazi wa kipato cha juu hapo juu50%.","Common questions":"Maswali ya kawaida","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Je, hii inaweka kiasi cha kisheria?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Hapana. Wazazi wanaweza kukubaliana kwa faragha, na NAV pekee hufanya uamuzi wa umma. Huu ni ulinganisho uliorahisishwa, si uamuzi wa NAV au kikokotoo chake kamili.","Does page language change these rules?":"Je, lugha ya ukurasa inabadilisha sheria hizi?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Hapana. Kiolesura kimetafsiriwa, lakini viwango na fomula iliyoonyeshwa ni ya Kinorwe na ya tarehe 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Kwa nini viwango vina tarehe?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV na Wizara husasisha viwango vya marejeleo katika mwaka, kwa kawaida kuanzia 1 Julai. Toleo hili linatumia viwango vinavyotumika 1 Julai 2026; angalia jedwali rasmi zilizounganishwa kabla ya kutegemea matokeo.","Scope and limits":"Upeo na mipaka","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Norway pekee; mtoto mmoja kwa kila hesabu, chini ya 18. Hali hii iliyorahisishwa haitoi tena ufafanuzi kamili wa mapato ya NAV, hesabu ya kodi na uwezo wa kulipa, usaidizi wa malezi ya watoto/unafuu wa kodi, mapato ya mtoto, mgao wa watoto wengi, ratiba za kutembelea zisizo za kawaida, usaidizi wa ziada au kesi za kimataifa. Kiasi cha matunzo ya mtoto kilichowekwa na mtumiaji kinapaswa kuwa kiasi kinachostahiki cha kila mwezi baada ya usaidizi au makato yoyote ambayo mtumiaji anajua yatatumika. Mapato hurahisisha mapato ya jumla ya mwaka, si tathmini rasmi ya NAV. Usiitumie kama tuzo, ushauri wa kisheria au ahadi ya kile ambacho mzazi yeyote lazima alipe.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Kadiria hali ya makubaliano ya kibinafsi","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Sheria za Norway pekee · Majedwali rejea ya 2026 yanaanza kutumika 1 Julai · imeangaliwa 17 Oktoba 2026 · lugha haibadilishi nchi.","Child age group":"Kikundi cha umri wa watoto","0–5 years":"0–5 miaka","6–10 years":"6–10 miaka","11–14 years":"11–14 miaka","15 years and older":"15 miaka na zaidi","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Mapato ya jumla ya kila mwaka ya usaidizi wa kulipa wa mzazi, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Mapato ya kila mwaka ya mzazi mwingine, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Mpangilio wa makazi ya watoto","One primary home":"Nyumba moja ya msingi","Shared residence":"Makazi ya pamoja","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Gharama inayostahiki ya malezi ya watoto kwa mwezi, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Si lazima. Weka tu kiasi cha kila mwezi unachoamini kinaweza kujumuishwa baada ya usaidizi wowote au msamaha wa kodi; chombo hakiwezi kuamua kustahiki.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Manufaa ya kawaida ya mtoto kwa mwezi, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Darasa la kutembelea limetumika kwa punguzo","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Hakuna punguzo / usiku chini ya 2 kwa mwezi","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Darasa 1 · takriban usiku 2–3 kwa mwezi","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Darasa 2 · takriban usiku 4–8 kwa mwezi","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Darasa 3 · takriban usiku wa 9–13 kwa mwezi","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Darasa 4 · takriban usiku 14–15 kwa mwezi","Estimate monthly amount":"Kadiria kiasi cha kila mwezi","Clear entries":"Futa maingizo","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Weka pato la jumla la kila mwaka la wazazi wote wawili na kikundi cha umri wa mtoto.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Mchoro uliokokotolewa kwenye kifaa hiki. NAV huamua kesi rasmi.","Entries cleared.":"Maingizo yamefutwa.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Angalia mapato, umri, darasa la kutembelewa na maingizo ya gharama ya kila mwezi.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Matukio ya kila mwezi yaliyorahisishwa","Estimated monthly transfer":"Kadirio la uhamisho wa kila mwezi","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Kadirio la kiasi katika miezi 12","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Gharama ya matengenezo ya kila mwezi","Age-based consumption reference":"Rejeleo la matumizi kulingana na umri","Standard housing reference":"Marejeleo ya kawaida ya makazi","Childcare amount entered":"Kiasi cha huduma ya watoto kimeingizwa","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Manufaa ya kawaida ya mtoto yametolewa","Income share before ceilings":"Mgao wa mapato kabla ya dari","Estimate before visitation credit":"Kadiria kabla ya salio la kutembelewa","Visitation credit":"Mkopo wa kutembelea","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 dari ya gharama ya matengenezo","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% dari ya mapato ya kila mwaka kwa mwezi","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Mzazi anayehusika katika hali hii","Parent entered as paying":"Mzazi aliingia kama anayelipa","Other parent":"Mzazi mwingine","Higher-income parent":"Mzazi mwenye kipato cha juu","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Kwa makazi ya pamoja, zana hii inalinganisha sehemu ya mapato ya mzazi mwenye kipato cha juu na 50%.","Assumptions used":"Mawazo yaliyotumika","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Kinorwe tuli2026viwango vya marejeleo vinavyofaa1Julai; hakuna masasisho ya usuli.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Kiasi hicho kimezungushwa hadi NOK 10 iliyo karibu zaidi. Kiasi cha kila mwaka huzidisha makadirio ya kila mwezi yaliyotolewa kwa 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Mtoto mmoja kwa hesabu; uwezo wa kulipa, watoto wengine, kodi kamili, mapato ya mtoto na kesi maalum hazijaigwa.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Maingizo na hesabu zote hukaa kwenye kichupo hiki cha kivinjari. Hakuna kinachopakiwa au kuhifadhiwa na zana hii.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · sheria na mwongozo wa usaidizi wa watoto","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 viwango vya marejeleo na makato ya kutembelea","Norwegian child support regulation":"Udhibiti wa msaada wa watoto wa Norway","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Angalia mwongozo wa sasa wa NAV na kikokotoo rasmi","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ta":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"நோர்வே குழந்தை ஆதரவு மதிப்பீட்டாளர்","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"நார்வே குழந்தை ஆதரவு கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — தனியார் ஒப்பந்த மதிப்பீடு","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"நார்வேஜியன் 2026 குறிப்பு விகிதங்களின் கீழ் எளிமைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர குழந்தை ஆதரவு சூழ்நிலையை ஆராயுங்கள். குழந்தையின் வயது, ஒவ்வொரு பெற்றோரின் வருமானம், குழந்தை பராமரிப்பு செலவுகள், குடியிருப்பு மற்றும் வருகை ஆகியவற்றை அனுமானங்கள் மற்றும் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட தொகையை உள்ளிடவும்.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"ஒரு குழந்தையின் மாதாந்திர ஆதரவைப் பற்றி விவாதிக்க இந்த தனிப்பட்ட திட்டமிடல் மதிப்பீட்டைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். வயது அடிப்படையிலான குறிப்பு புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் மற்றும் வருகைத் தள்ளுபடிகள் தேதியிட்ட நார்வேஜியன் 2026 அட்டவணைகளைப் பின்பற்றுகின்றன; இந்தப் பக்கத்தின் மொழி ஒருபோதும் நாட்டையோ விதிகளையோ மாற்றாது.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"இந்த உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது. நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் புள்ளிவிவரங்கள் சேவையகத்திற்கு அனுப்பப்படவில்லை அல்லது இந்தக் கருவியால் சேமிக்கப்படவில்லை.","Example":"உதாரணம்","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"ஒரு வயது குழந்தைக்கு6–10, தி2026குழந்தை பராமரிப்புக்கு முன் குறிப்பு செலவு NOK7,523நுகர்வு மற்றும் NOK இல்3,811வீட்டுவசதிக்கு, குறைவான NOK2,012சாதாரண குழந்தை நன்மை: NOK9,322. NOK இன் ஆண்டு பெற்றோர் வருமானத்துடன்600,000மற்றும் NOK400,000மற்றும் வருகை வகுப்பு2, எளிமைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட ஒரு வீட்டு மதிப்பீடு NOK பற்றியது3,900NOKக்குப் பிறகு மாதத்திற்கு1,690வருகை வரவு மற்றும் ரவுண்டிங்.","How the estimate works":"மதிப்பீடு எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"கருவி சேர்க்கிறது2026வயது அடிப்படையிலான நுகர்வுத் தொகை மற்றும் வீட்டுத் தொகை, நீங்கள் உள்ளிடும் தகுதியான நிகர குழந்தைப் பராமரிப்புச் செலவைச் சேர்த்து, சாதாரண குழந்தைப் பலன்களைக் கழிக்கிறது. ஒரு முதன்மை இல்லத்திற்கு, இரண்டு ஆண்டு வருமானத்தைப் பயன்படுத்தி இந்த செலவை ஒதுக்குகிறது, இது பொருந்தும்5/6செலவு உச்சவரம்பு மற்றும்25% வருமான உச்சவரம்பு, கழிக்கிறது2026வருகைக் கடன் மற்றும் அருகிலுள்ள NOKக்கு சுற்றுகள்10. பகிரப்பட்ட வசிப்பிடத்திற்கு இது மேலே உள்ள அதிக வருமானம் பெற்ற பெற்றோரின் பங்கை மதிப்பிடுகிறது50%","Common questions":"பொதுவான கேள்விகள்","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"இது சட்டப்பூர்வமாக பிணைக்கப்பட்ட தொகையை அமைக்குமா?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"இல்லை. பெற்றோர்கள் தனிப்பட்ட முறையில் ஒப்புக்கொள்ளலாம், மேலும் NAV மட்டுமே பொதுத் தீர்மானத்தை எடுக்கிறது. இது ஒரு எளிமையான ஒப்பீடு, NAV முடிவு அல்லது அதன் முழு கால்குலேட்டர் அல்ல.","Does page language change these rules?":"பக்க மொழி இந்த விதிகளை மாற்றுமா?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"எண். இடைமுகம் மொழிபெயர்க்கப்பட்டுள்ளது, ஆனால் காட்டப்படும் விகிதங்கள் மற்றும் சூத்திரம் நார்வேஜியன் மற்றும் தேதியிட்ட 2026 ஆகும்.","Why do the rates have a date?":"விகிதங்களுக்கு ஏன் தேதி உள்ளது?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"பொதுவாக 1 ஜூலை முதல் வருடத்தில் NAV மற்றும் அமைச்சகத்தின் குறிப்புத் தொகைகள் புதுப்பிக்கப்படும். இந்தப் பதிப்பு 1 ஜூலை 2026 விகிதங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது; முடிவை நம்புவதற்கு முன் இணைக்கப்பட்ட அதிகாரப்பூர்வ அட்டவணைகளை சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Scope and limits":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"நோர்வே மட்டும்; ஒரு கணக்கிற்கு ஒரு குழந்தை, 18 இன் கீழ். இந்த எளிமைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட காட்சியானது NAV இன் முழு வருமான வரையறை, வரி மற்றும் செலுத்தும் திறன் கணக்கீடு, குழந்தை பராமரிப்பு ஆதரவு/வரி நிவாரணம், குழந்தை வருமானம், பல குழந்தை ஒதுக்கீடு, அசாதாரண வருகை அட்டவணைகள், கூடுதல் ஆதரவு அல்லது சர்வதேச வழக்குகள் ஆகியவற்றை மீண்டும் உருவாக்காது. பயனரால் உள்ளிடப்பட்ட குழந்தைப் பராமரிப்புத் தொகையானது, பயனருக்குத் தெரிந்த ஏதேனும் ஆதரவு அல்லது விலக்குகளுக்குப் பிறகு தகுதியான நிகர மாதாந்திரத் தொகையாக இருக்க வேண்டும். வருமானம் என்பது எளிமைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட ஆண்டு மொத்த வருமானம், அதிகாரப்பூர்வ NAV மதிப்பீடு அல்ல. விருதாகவோ, சட்ட ஆலோசனையாகவோ அல்லது பெற்றோர் செலுத்த வேண்டிய தொகைக்கான வாக்குறுதியாகவோ இதைப் பயன்படுத்த வேண்டாம்.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"தனிப்பட்ட ஒப்பந்த சூழ்நிலையை மதிப்பிடவும்","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"நார்வேஜியன் விதிகள் மட்டும் · 2026 குறிப்பு அட்டவணைகள் நடைமுறைக்கு வரும் 1 ஜூலை · சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது 17 அக்டோபர் 2026 · மொழி நாட்டை மாற்றாது.","Child age group":"குழந்தை வயது பிரிவு","0–5 years":"0–5 ஆண்டுகள்","6–10 years":"6–10 ஆண்டுகள்","11–14 years":"11–14 ஆண்டுகள்","15 years and older":"15 ஆண்டுகள் மற்றும் அதற்கு மேற்பட்டவை","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"பெற்றோர் செலுத்தும் ஆதரவின் ஆண்டு மொத்த வருமானம், NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"மற்ற பெற்றோரின் ஆண்டு மொத்த வருமானம், NOK","Child residence arrangement":"குழந்தை குடியிருப்பு ஏற்பாடு","One primary home":"ஒரு முதன்மை வீடு","Shared residence":"பகிரப்பட்ட குடியிருப்பு","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"ஒரு மாதத்திற்கு தகுதியான நிகர குழந்தை பராமரிப்பு செலவு, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"விரும்பினால். ஏதேனும் ஆதரவு அல்லது வரிச் சலுகைக்குப் பிறகு சேர்க்கப்படலாம் என நீங்கள் நம்பும் மாதாந்திரத் தொகையை மட்டும் உள்ளிடவும்; கருவி தகுதியை தீர்மானிக்க முடியாது.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"மாதத்திற்கு சாதாரண குழந்தை நலன், NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"விசிட்டிங் கிளாஸ் தள்ளுபடிக்கு பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டது","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"தள்ளுபடி இல்லை / மாதத்திற்கு 2 இரவுகளுக்கு குறைவாக","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"வகுப்பு 1 · மாதத்திற்கு சுமார் 2–3 இரவுகள்","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"வகுப்பு 2 · மாதத்திற்கு சுமார் 4–8 இரவுகள்","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"வகுப்பு 3 · மாதத்திற்கு சுமார் 9–13 இரவுகள்","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"வகுப்பு 4 · மாதத்திற்கு சுமார் 14–15 இரவுகள்","Estimate monthly amount":"மாதாந்திரத் தொகையை மதிப்பிடவும்","Clear entries":"உள்ளீடுகளை அழிக்கவும்","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"பெற்றோரின் ஆண்டு மொத்த வருமானம் மற்றும் குழந்தையின் வயதுக் குழுவை உள்ளிடவும்.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது. NAV அதிகாரப்பூர்வ வழக்குகளை முடிவு செய்கிறது.","Entries cleared.":"பதிவுகள் அழிக்கப்பட்டன.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"வருமானம், வயது, வருகை வகுப்பு மற்றும் மாதாந்திர செலவு உள்ளீடுகளைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Simplified monthly scenario":"எளிமைப்படுத்தப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர காட்சி","Estimated monthly transfer":"மதிப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர பரிமாற்றம்","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 மாதங்களில் மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட தொகை","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"மாதாந்திர பராமரிப்பு-செலவு அடிப்படை","Age-based consumption reference":"வயது அடிப்படையிலான நுகர்வு குறிப்பு","Standard housing reference":"தரமான வீட்டுக் குறிப்பு","Childcare amount entered":"குழந்தை பராமரிப்பு தொகை உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"சாதாரண குழந்தை பலன் கழிக்கப்பட்டது","Income share before ceilings":"உச்சவரம்புக்கு முன் வருமானப் பங்கு","Estimate before visitation credit":"வருகை வரவுக்கு முன் மதிப்பிடவும்","Visitation credit":"விசிட்டிங் கிரெடிட்","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 பராமரிப்பு-செலவு உச்சவரம்பு","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% ஆண்டு வருமான உச்சவரம்பு மாதத்திற்கு","Parent responsible in this scenario":"இந்தச் சூழ்நிலையில் பெற்றோர் பொறுப்பு","Parent entered as paying":"பணம் செலுத்தியதாக பெற்றோர் உள்ளிட்டுள்ளனர்","Other parent":"பிற பெற்றோர்","Higher-income parent":"அதிக வருமானம் பெற்றோர்","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"பகிரப்பட்ட வசிப்பிடத்திற்காக, கருவியானது அதிக வருமானம் பெறும் பெற்றோரின் வருமானப் பங்கை 50% உடன் ஒப்பிடுகிறது.","Assumptions used":"அனுமானங்கள் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டன","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"நிலையான நார்வேஜியன் 2026 குறிப்பு விகிதங்கள் 1 ஜூலையில் நடைமுறைக்கு வரும்; பின்னணி புதுப்பிப்புகள் இல்லை.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"அருகில் உள்ள NOK 10 க்கு தொகை வட்டமிடப்பட்டது. வருடாந்திரத் தொகையானது வட்டமான மாதாந்திர மதிப்பீட்டை 12 ஆல் பெருக்கும்.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"ஒரு கணக்கீட்டிற்கு ஒரு குழந்தை; செலுத்தும் திறன், பிற குழந்தைகள், முழுமையான வரி, குழந்தை வருமானம் மற்றும் சிறப்பு வழக்குகள் மாதிரியாக இல்லை.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"அனைத்து உள்ளீடுகளும் கணக்கீடுகளும் இந்த உலாவி தாவலில் இருக்கும். இந்தக் கருவியால் எதுவும் பதிவேற்றம் செய்யப்படவில்லை அல்லது சேமிக்கப்படவில்லை.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · குழந்தை ஆதரவு விதிகள் மற்றும் வழிகாட்டுதல்","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 குறிப்பு விகிதங்கள் மற்றும் வருகை விலக்குகள்","Norwegian child support regulation":"நோர்வே குழந்தை ஆதரவு கட்டுப்பாடு","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"தற்போதைய NAV வழிகாட்டுதல் மற்றும் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கால்குலேட்டரைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"te":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"నార్వేజియన్ చైల్డ్ సపోర్ట్ ఎస్టిమేటర్","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"నార్వే చైల్డ్ సపోర్ట్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — ప్రైవేట్ ఒప్పంద అంచనా","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"నార్వేజియన్ 2026 సూచన రేట్ల క్రింద సరళీకృత నెలవారీ పిల్లల-మద్దతు దృష్టాంతాన్ని అన్వేషించండి. అంచనాలు మరియు అంచనా మొత్తాన్ని చూడటానికి పిల్లల వయస్సు, ప్రతి తల్లిదండ్రుల ఆదాయం, పిల్లల సంరక్షణ ఖర్చులు, నివాసం మరియు సందర్శనను నమోదు చేయండి.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"ఒక పిల్లల నెలవారీ మద్దతు గురించి చర్చించడానికి ఈ ప్రైవేట్ ప్లానింగ్ అంచనాను ఉపయోగించండి. వయస్సు-ఆధారిత సూచన గణాంకాలు మరియు సందర్శన తగ్గింపులు నాటి నార్వేజియన్ 2026 పట్టికలను అనుసరిస్తాయి; ఈ పేజీ యొక్క భాష దేశాన్ని లేదా నియమాలను ఎప్పటికీ మార్చదు.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది. మీరు నమోదు చేసిన బొమ్మలు సర్వర్‌కి పంపబడవు లేదా ఈ సాధనం ద్వారా సేవ్ చేయబడవు.","Example":"ఉదాహరణ","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"వయస్సు పిల్లల కోసం6–10, ది2026పిల్లల సంరక్షణకు ముందు సూచన ధర NOK7,523వినియోగంతో పాటు NOKలో3,811హౌసింగ్ కోసం, తక్కువ NOK2,012సాధారణ పిల్లల ప్రయోజనం: NOK9,322. NOK యొక్క వార్షిక తల్లిదండ్రుల ఆదాయాలతో600,000మరియు NOK400,000మరియు సందర్శన తరగతి2, సరళీకృత వన్-హోమ్ అంచనా NOK గురించి3,900NOK తర్వాత నెలకు1,690సందర్శన క్రెడిట్ మరియు చుట్టుముట్టడం.","How the estimate works":"అంచనా ఎలా పనిచేస్తుంది","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"సాధనం జతచేస్తుంది2026వయస్సు-ఆధారిత వినియోగం మొత్తం మరియు గృహ మొత్తం, మీరు నమోదు చేసే అర్హత గల నికర పిల్లల సంరక్షణ ఖర్చును జోడిస్తుంది మరియు సాధారణ పిల్లల ప్రయోజనాన్ని తీసివేస్తుంది. ఒక ప్రాథమిక ఇంటి కోసం, ఇది రెండు నమోదు చేసిన వార్షిక ఆదాయాలను ఉపయోగించి ఈ ఖర్చును కేటాయిస్తుంది, వర్తిస్తుంది5/6ఖర్చు సీలింగ్ మరియు25% ఆదాయ సీలింగ్, తీసివేస్తుంది2026సందర్శన క్రెడిట్ మరియు సమీప NOKకి రౌండ్లు10. భాగస్వామ్య నివాసం కోసం ఇది ఎగువన ఉన్న అధిక-ఆదాయ తల్లిదండ్రుల వాటాను అంచనా వేస్తుంది50%.","Common questions":"సాధారణ ప్రశ్నలు","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"ఇది చట్టబద్ధంగా కట్టుబడి ఉండే మొత్తాన్ని సెట్ చేస్తుందా?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"లేదు. తల్లిదండ్రులు ప్రైవేట్‌గా అంగీకరించవచ్చు మరియు NAV మాత్రమే పబ్లిక్ నిర్ణయాన్ని తీసుకుంటుంది. ఇది సరళీకృత పోలిక, NAV నిర్ణయం లేదా దాని పూర్తి కాలిక్యులేటర్ కాదు.","Does page language change these rules?":"పేజీ భాష ఈ నియమాలను మారుస్తుందా?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"లేదు. ఇంటర్‌ఫేస్ అనువదించబడింది, కానీ చూపిన ధరలు మరియు సూత్రం నార్వేజియన్ మరియు 2026 తేదీ.","Why do the rates have a date?":"రేట్లు ఎందుకు తేదీని కలిగి ఉన్నాయి?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"సాధారణంగా 1 జూలై నుండి సంవత్సరంలో NAV మరియు మినిస్ట్రీ రిఫరెన్స్ మొత్తాలను నవీకరించండి. ఈ సంస్కరణ రేట్లు ప్రభావవంతమైన 1 జూలై 2026ని ఉపయోగిస్తుంది; ఫలితంపై ఆధారపడే ముందు లింక్ చేయబడిన అధికారిక పట్టికలను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Scope and limits":"స్కోప్ మరియు పరిమితులు","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"నార్వే మాత్రమే; 18 కింద ఒక్కో గణనకు ఒక బిడ్డ. ఈ సరళీకృత దృష్టాంతం NAV యొక్క పూర్తి ఆదాయ నిర్వచనం, పన్ను మరియు చెల్లింపు సామర్థ్యం-చెల్లింపు గణన, పిల్లల సంరక్షణ మద్దతు/పన్ను ఉపశమనం, పిల్లల ఆదాయం, బహుళ-పిల్లల కేటాయింపు, అసాధారణ సందర్శన షెడ్యూల్‌లు, అదనపు మద్దతు లేదా అంతర్జాతీయ కేసులను పునరుత్పత్తి చేయదు. వినియోగదారు నమోదు చేసిన చైల్డ్‌కేర్ అమౌంట్ అనేది యూజర్‌కు తెలిసిన ఏదైనా సపోర్ట్ లేదా డిడక్షన్‌లు వర్తింపజేసిన తర్వాత అర్హత కలిగిన నికర నెలవారీ మొత్తం అయి ఉండాలి. ఆదాయం అనేది సరళీకృత వార్షిక స్థూల ఆదాయం, అధికారిక NAV అంచనా కాదు. దీనిని అవార్డుగా, న్యాయ సలహాగా లేదా తల్లిదండ్రులు చెల్లించాల్సిన దాని గురించి వాగ్దానంగా ఉపయోగించవద్దు.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"ప్రైవేట్ ఒప్పంద దృశ్యాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలు మాత్రమే · 2026 సూచన పట్టికలు 1 జూలై నుండి ప్రభావవంతంగా ఉంటాయి · తనిఖీ చేయబడిన 17 అక్టోబర్ 2026 · భాష దేశాన్ని మార్చదు.","Child age group":"పిల్లల వయస్సు సమూహం","0–5 years":"0–5 సంవత్సరాలు","6–10 years":"6–10 సంవత్సరాలు","11–14 years":"11–14 సంవత్సరాలు","15 years and older":"15 సంవత్సరాలు మరియు పాతవి","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"చెల్లించే తల్లిదండ్రుల వార్షిక స్థూల ఆదాయం, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"ఇతర తల్లిదండ్రుల వార్షిక స్థూల ఆదాయం, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"పిల్లల నివాసం ఏర్పాటు","One primary home":"ఒక ప్రాథమిక ఇల్లు","Shared residence":"భాగస్వామ్య నివాసం","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"నెలకు అర్హత కలిగిన నికర పిల్లల సంరక్షణ ఖర్చు, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"ఐచ్ఛికం. ఏదైనా మద్దతు లేదా పన్ను మినహాయింపు తర్వాత చేర్చబడవచ్చని మీరు విశ్వసిస్తున్న నెలవారీ మొత్తాన్ని మాత్రమే నమోదు చేయండి; సాధనం అర్హతను నిర్ణయించలేదు.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"నెలకు సాధారణ పిల్లల ప్రయోజనం, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"డిస్కౌంట్ కోసం ఉపయోగించబడిన సందర్శన తరగతి","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"తగ్గింపు లేదు / నెలకు 2 రాత్రులు కంటే తక్కువ","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"తరగతి 1 · దాదాపు 2–3 రాత్రులు నెలకు","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"తరగతి 2 · దాదాపు 4–8 రాత్రులు నెలకు","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"తరగతి 3 · దాదాపు 9–13 రాత్రులు నెలకు","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"తరగతి 4 · దాదాపు 14–15 రాత్రులు నెలకు","Estimate monthly amount":"నెలవారీ మొత్తాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి","Clear entries":"ఎంట్రీలను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"తల్లిదండ్రుల వార్షిక స్థూల ఆదాయాన్ని మరియు పిల్లల వయస్సును నమోదు చేయండి.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"ఈ పరికరంలో దృశ్యం లెక్కించబడింది. NAV అధికారిక కేసులను నిర్ణయిస్తుంది.","Entries cleared.":"ఎంట్రీలు క్లియర్ చేయబడ్డాయి.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"ఆదాయం, వయస్సు, సందర్శన తరగతి మరియు నెలవారీ ఖర్చు నమోదులను తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Simplified monthly scenario":"సరళీకృత నెలవారీ దృశ్యం","Estimated monthly transfer":"అంచనా వేయబడిన నెలవారీ బదిలీ","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 నెలల్లో అంచనా వేసిన మొత్తం","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"నెలవారీ నిర్వహణ-ఖర్చు ఆధారంగా","Age-based consumption reference":"వయస్సు-ఆధారిత వినియోగ సూచన","Standard housing reference":"ప్రామాణిక గృహ సూచన","Childcare amount entered":"పిల్లల సంరక్షణ మొత్తం నమోదు చేయబడింది","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"సాధారణ పిల్లల ప్రయోజనం తీసివేయబడింది","Income share before ceilings":"సీలింగ్‌కు ముందు ఆదాయ వాటా","Estimate before visitation credit":"సందర్శన క్రెడిట్‌కు ముందు అంచనా వేయండి","Visitation credit":"సందర్శన క్రెడిట్","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 నిర్వహణ-ఖర్చు సీలింగ్","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% వార్షిక-ఆదాయ పరిమితి నెలకు","Parent responsible in this scenario":"ఈ దృష్టాంతంలో తల్లిదండ్రులు బాధ్యత వహిస్తారు","Parent entered as paying":"తల్లిదండ్రులు చెల్లిస్తున్నట్లు నమోదు చేసారు","Other parent":"ఇతర తల్లిదండ్రులు","Higher-income parent":"అధిక-ఆదాయ తల్లిదండ్రులు","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"భాగస్వామ్య నివాసం కోసం, సాధనం అధిక-ఆదాయ తల్లిదండ్రుల ఆదాయ వాటాను 50%తో పోలుస్తుంది.","Assumptions used":"ఉపయోగించబడిన ఊహలు","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"స్టాటిక్ నార్వేజియన్ 2026 రిఫరెన్స్ రేట్లు 1 జూలై నుండి అమలులోకి వస్తాయి; నేపథ్య నవీకరణలు లేవు.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"మొత్తం సమీప NOK 10కి రౌండ్ చేయబడింది. వార్షిక మొత్తం వృత్తాకార నెలవారీ అంచనాను 12తో గుణిస్తుంది.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"ఒక గణనకు ఒక బిడ్డ; సామర్థ్యం-చెల్లింపు, ఇతర పిల్లలు, పూర్తి పన్ను, పిల్లల ఆదాయం మరియు ప్రత్యేక కేసులు మోడల్ చేయబడవు.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"అన్ని ఎంట్రీలు మరియు లెక్కలు ఈ బ్రౌజర్ ట్యాబ్‌లో ఉంటాయి. ఈ సాధనం ద్వారా ఏదీ అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడదు లేదా నిల్వ చేయబడదు.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · పిల్లల మద్దతు నియమాలు మరియు మార్గదర్శకత్వం","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 సూచన రేట్లు మరియు సందర్శన తగ్గింపులు","Norwegian child support regulation":"నార్వేజియన్ చైల్డ్ సపోర్ట్ రెగ్యులేషన్","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"ప్రస్తుత NAV మార్గదర్శకత్వం మరియు అధికారిక కాలిక్యులేటర్‌ను తనిఖీ చేయండి","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"th":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"เครื่องมือประมาณการค่าเลี้ยงดูบุตรของนอร์เวย์","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"เครื่องคำนวณค่าเลี้ยงดูบุตรของนอร์เวย์ 2026 — ข้อตกลงส่วนตัวโดยประมาณ","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"สำรวจสถานการณ์การช่วยเหลือเด็กรายเดือนแบบง่ายภายใต้อัตราอ้างอิง 2026 ของนอร์เวย์ ป้อนอายุของเด็ก รายได้ของผู้ปกครองแต่ละคน ค่าดูแลเด็ก ที่อยู่อาศัยและการเยี่ยมเยียน เพื่อดูสมมติฐานและจำนวนเงินโดยประมาณ","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"ใช้ประมาณการการวางแผนส่วนตัวนี้เพื่อหารือเกี่ยวกับการสนับสนุนรายเดือนของเด็กหนึ่งคน ตัวเลขอ้างอิงตามอายุและส่วนลดการเยี่ยมชมเป็นไปตามตาราง 2026 ของนอร์เวย์ที่ลงวันที่ ภาษาของหน้านี้ไม่เคยเปลี่ยนประเทศหรือกฎเกณฑ์","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"ทำงานในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ตัวเลขที่คุณป้อนจะไม่ถูกส่งไปยังเซิร์ฟเวอร์หรือบันทึกโดยเครื่องมือนี้","Example":"ตัวอย่าง","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"สำหรับเด็กอายุ 6–10 ค่าใช้จ่ายอ้างอิง 2026 ก่อนการดูแลเด็กคือ NOK 7,523 ในการบริโภค บวก NOK 3,811 สำหรับที่อยู่อาศัย หักด้วย NOK 2,012 ผลประโยชน์เด็กทั่วไป: NOK 9,322 ด้วยรายได้ผู้ปกครองต่อปีของ NOK 600,000 และ NOK 400,000 และคลาสการเยี่ยม 2 การประมาณการบ้านเดี่ยวแบบง่ายคือประมาณ NOK 3,900 ต่อเดือน หลังจากเครดิตการเยี่ยมเยียน NOK 1,690 และการปัดเศษ","How the estimate works":"วิธีการทำงานของการประมาณการ","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"เครื่องมือจะเพิ่มปริมาณการบริโภคตามอายุและจำนวนที่อยู่อาศัยของ 2026 เพิ่มค่าดูแลเด็กสุทธิที่มีสิทธิ์ที่คุณป้อน และลบผลประโยชน์เด็กทั่วไป สำหรับบ้านหลังหนึ่ง จะจัดสรรต้นทุนนี้โดยใช้รายได้ต่อปีที่ป้อนทั้งสองรายการ ใช้เพดานค่าใช้จ่าย 5/6 และเพดานรายได้ 25% ลบเครดิตการเยี่ยมเยียน 2026 แล้วปัดเศษเป็น NOK 10 ที่ใกล้ที่สุด สำหรับที่พักอาศัยรวม จะประมาณส่วนแบ่งของผู้ปกครองที่มีรายได้สูงกว่ามากกว่า 50%","Common questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"สิ่งนี้กำหนดจำนวนเงินที่มีผลผูกพันทางกฎหมายหรือไม่","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"No. ผู้ปกครองสามารถตกลงเป็นการส่วนตัวได้ และ NAV เพียงอย่างเดียวจะเป็นผู้กำหนดต่อสาธารณะ นี่เป็นการเปรียบเทียบแบบง่าย ไม่ใช่การตัดสินใจ NAV หรือเครื่องคำนวณทั้งหมด","Does page language change these rules?":"ภาษาของหน้าเปลี่ยนกฎเหล่านี้หรือไม่","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"No. อินเทอร์เฟซได้รับการแปลแล้ว แต่อัตราและสูตรที่แสดงเป็นภาษานอร์เวย์และลงวันที่ 2026","Why do the rates have a date?":"ทำไมเรทจึงมีวันที่?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV และกระทรวงอัปเดตจำนวนอ้างอิงในระหว่างปี โดยปกติตั้งแต่ 1 กรกฎาคม เวอร์ชันนี้ใช้อัตราที่มีผล 1 กรกฎาคม 2026; ตรวจสอบตารางอย่างเป็นทางการที่เชื่อมโยงก่อนที่จะเชื่อถือผลลัพธ์","Scope and limits":"ขอบเขตและขีดจำกัด","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"นอร์เวย์เท่านั้น; เด็กหนึ่งคนต่อการคำนวณ ภายใต้ 18 สถานการณ์จำลองที่เรียบง่ายนี้ไม่ได้จำลองคำจำกัดความรายได้แบบเต็มของ NAV การคำนวณภาษีและความสามารถในการจ่าย การสนับสนุนการดูแลเด็ก/การลดหย่อนภาษี รายได้ของเด็ก การจัดสรรบุตรหลายคน ตารางการเยี่ยมที่ผิดปกติ การสนับสนุนพิเศษ หรือกรณีระหว่างประเทศ จำนวนเงินค่าดูแลเด็กที่ผู้ใช้ป้อนควรเป็นจำนวนเงินสุทธิต่อเดือนที่มีสิทธิ์ หลังจากการสนับสนุนหรือการหักเงินใดๆ ที่ผู้ใช้ทราบ รายได้คือรายได้รวมต่อปีแบบง่าย ไม่ใช่การประเมิน NAV อย่างเป็นทางการ อย่าใช้เป็นรางวัล คำแนะนำทางกฎหมาย หรือสัญญาว่าผู้ปกครองฝ่ายใดฝ่ายหนึ่งต้องจ่าย","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"ประมาณการสถานการณ์จำลองข้อตกลงส่วนตัว","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"กฎของนอร์เวย์เท่านั้น · ตารางอ้างอิง 2026 มีผลบังคับใช้ 1 กรกฎาคม · ตรวจสอบแล้ว 17 ตุลาคม 2026 · ภาษาไม่เปลี่ยนประเทศ","Child age group":"กลุ่มอายุเด็ก","0–5 years":"0–5 ปี","6–10 years":"6–10 ปี","11–14 years":"11–14 ปี","15 years and older":"15 ปีขึ้นไป","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"รายได้รวมต่อปีของผู้ปกครองที่จ่ายเงินเลี้ยงดู NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"รายได้รวมต่อปีของบริษัทแม่อีกแห่งหนึ่ง NOK","Child residence arrangement":"การจัดที่อยู่อาศัยสำหรับเด็ก","One primary home":"บ้านเดี่ยวหลังเดียว","Shared residence":"บ้านพักรวม","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"ค่าดูแลเด็กสุทธิที่มีสิทธิ์ต่อเดือน NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"ไม่บังคับ ป้อนเฉพาะจำนวนเงินต่อเดือนที่คุณเชื่อว่าอาจรวมอยู่หลังการสนับสนุนหรือการลดหย่อนภาษีใดๆ เครื่องมือไม่สามารถระบุคุณสมบัติได้","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"ผลประโยชน์บุตรสามัญต่อเดือน NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"ชั้นเยี่ยมชมที่ใช้เป็นส่วนลด","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"ไม่มีส่วนลด / น้อยกว่า 2 คืนต่อเดือน","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"คลาส 1 · ประมาณ 2–3 คืนต่อเดือน","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"คลาส 2 · ประมาณ 4–8 คืนต่อเดือน","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"คลาส 3 · ประมาณ 9–13 คืนต่อเดือน","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"คลาส 4 · ประมาณ 14–15 คืนต่อเดือน","Estimate monthly amount":"ประมาณการจำนวนเงินต่อเดือน","Clear entries":"ล้างรายการ","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"ป้อนรายได้รวมต่อปีของผู้ปกครองและกลุ่มอายุของเด็ก","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"สถานการณ์จำลองที่คำนวณบนอุปกรณ์นี้ NAV ตัดสินคดีอย่างเป็นทางการ","Entries cleared.":"รายการถูกล้างแล้ว","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"ตรวจสอบรายได้ อายุ ระดับการเข้าชม และรายการค่าใช้จ่ายรายเดือน","Simplified monthly scenario":"สถานการณ์จำลองรายเดือนแบบง่าย","Estimated monthly transfer":"ยอดโอนต่อเดือนโดยประมาณ","Estimated amount over 12 months":"จำนวนโดยประมาณในช่วงเดือน 12","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"ค่าบำรุงรักษารายเดือน","Age-based consumption reference":"ข้อมูลอ้างอิงการบริโภคตามอายุ","Standard housing reference":"การอ้างอิงตัวเรือนมาตรฐาน","Childcare amount entered":"ป้อนจำนวนเงินค่าดูแลเด็กแล้ว","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"หักเงินสงเคราะห์บุตรสามัญแล้ว","Income share before ceilings":"ส่วนแบ่งรายได้ก่อนเพดาน","Estimate before visitation credit":"ประมาณการก่อนเครดิตการเข้าชม","Visitation credit":"เครดิตการเข้าชม","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 เพดานค่าบำรุงรักษา","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% เพดานรายได้ต่อปีต่อเดือน","Parent responsible in this scenario":"ผู้ปกครองที่รับผิดชอบในสถานการณ์นี้","Parent entered as paying":"ผู้ปกครองเข้าสู่ระบบเพื่อชำระเงิน","Other parent":"พาเรนต์อื่นๆ","Higher-income parent":"แม่ที่มีรายได้สูงกว่า","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"สำหรับการอยู่ร่วมกัน เครื่องมือจะเปรียบเทียบส่วนแบ่งรายได้ของผู้ปกครองที่มีรายได้สูงกว่ากับ 50%","Assumptions used":"สมมติฐานที่ใช้","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. จำนวนเงินรายปีจะคูณการประมาณการรายเดือนแบบปัดเศษด้วย 12","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"หนึ่งลูกต่อการคำนวณ ความสามารถในการจ่าย เด็กคนอื่นๆ ภาษีทั้งหมด รายได้เด็ก และกรณีพิเศษไม่ได้เป็นแบบจำลอง","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"รายการและการคำนวณทั้งหมดจะยังคงอยู่ในแท็บเบราว์เซอร์นี้ ไม่มีการอัปโหลดหรือจัดเก็บโดยเครื่องมือนี้","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · กฎและคำแนะนำในการเลี้ยงดูบุตร","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · อัตราอ้างอิง 2026 และการหักค่าเข้าชม","Norwegian child support regulation":"กฎระเบียบเรื่องการเลี้ยงดูบุตรของนอร์เวย์","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"ตรวจสอบคำแนะนำ NAV ปัจจุบันและเครื่องคำนวณอย่างเป็นทางการ","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"tl":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Norwegian Child Support Estimator","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Pribadong Pagtantya ng Kasunduan","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Galugarin ang isang pinasimple na buwanang senaryo ng suporta sa bata sa ilalim ng mga reference rate ng Norwegian na 2026. Ilagay ang edad ng bata, kita ng bawat magulang, gastos sa pangangalaga ng bata, paninirahan at pagbisita upang makita ang mga pagpapalagay at tinantyang halaga.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Gamitin ang pagtatantya ng pribadong pagpaplano na ito upang talakayin ang buwanang suporta ng isang bata. Ang mga numero ng sangguniang batay sa edad at mga diskwento sa pagbisita ay sumusunod sa mga napetsahan na Norwegian na 2026 na mga talahanayan; hindi kailanman binabago ng wika ng page na ito ang bansa o mga panuntunan.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Gumagana sa browser na ito. Ang mga numero na iyong ipinasok ay hindi ipinadala sa isang server o nai-save ng tool na ito.","Example":"Halimbawa","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Para sa isang batang may edad na6–10, ang2026reference cost bago ang childcare ay NOK7,523sa pagkonsumo plus NOK3,811para sa housing, less NOK2,012benepisyo ng ordinaryong bata: NOK9,322. Sa taunang kita ng magulang ng NOK600,000at NOK400,000at klase ng pagbisita2, ang pinasimpleng pagtatantya ng isang bahay ay tungkol sa NOK3,900bawat buwan pagkatapos ng NOK1,690credit sa pagbisita at rounding.","How the estimate works":"Paano gumagana ang pagtatantya","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Idinaragdag ng tool ang 2026 na halaga ng pagkonsumo batay sa edad at halaga ng pabahay, idinaragdag ang karapat-dapat na netong gastos sa pangangalaga sa bata na iyong ipinasok, at ibinabawas ang ordinaryong benepisyo ng bata. Para sa isang pangunahing tahanan, inilalaan nito ang gastos na ito gamit ang dalawang ipinasok na taunang kita, inilalapat ang 5/6 cost ceiling at 25% income ceiling, ibinabawas ang 2026 visitation credit at iikot sa pinakamalapit na NOK 10. Para sa shared residence, tinatantya nito ang mas mataas na kita na bahagi ng magulang sa itaas ng 50%.","Common questions":"Mga karaniwang tanong","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Nagtatakda ba ito ng legal na umiiral na halaga?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Hindi. Ang mga magulang ay maaaring sumang-ayon nang pribado, at ang NAV lamang ang gumagawa ng pampublikong pagpapasiya. Ito ay isang pinasimpleng paghahambing, hindi isang desisyon ng NAV o ang buong calculator nito.","Does page language change these rules?":"Binabago ba ng wika ng page ang mga panuntunang ito?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Hindi. Ang interface ay isinalin, ngunit ang mga rate at formula na ipinapakita ay Norwegian at may petsang 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Bakit may petsa ang mga rate?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV at ang mga halaga ng sanggunian sa pag-update ng Ministry sa buong taon, karaniwang mula sa 1 Hulyo. Gumagamit ang bersyon na ito ng mga rate na epektibong 1 Hulyo 2026; suriin ang mga naka-link na opisyal na talahanayan bago umasa sa isang resulta.","Scope and limits":"Saklaw at limitasyon","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Norway lang; isang bata bawat kalkulasyon, sa ilalim ng 18. Ang pinasimpleng sitwasyong ito ay hindi nagre-reproduce ng buong kahulugan ng kita ng NAV, pagkalkula ng buwis at kapasidad na magbayad, suporta sa pangangalaga sa bata/kaluwagan sa buwis, kita ng bata, paglalaan ng maramihang-anak, hindi pangkaraniwang mga iskedyul ng pagbisita, karagdagang suporta o mga internasyonal na kaso. Ang halaga ng pangangalaga sa bata na inilagay ng user ay dapat ang karapat-dapat na netong buwanang halaga pagkatapos ng anumang suporta o pagbabawas na alam ng user na nalalapat. Ang kita ay pinasimple taunang kabuuang kita, hindi isang opisyal na pagtatasa ng NAV. Huwag itong gamitin bilang award, legal na payo o pangako kung ano ang dapat bayaran ng alinman sa magulang.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Tantyahin ang isang pribadong senaryo ng kasunduan","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Norwegian rules lang · 2026 reference table epektibo 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · hindi binabago ng wika ang bansa.","Child age group":"Pangkat ng edad ng bata","0–5 years":"0–5 taon","6–10 years":"6–10 taon","11–14 years":"11–14 taon","15 years and older":"15 taon at mas matanda","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Taunang kabuuang kita ng magulang na nagbabayad ng suporta, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Taunang kabuuang kita ng ibang magulang, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Kasunduan sa paninirahan ng bata","One primary home":"Isang pangunahing tahanan","Shared residence":"Nakabahaging tirahan","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Kwalipikadong netong gastos sa pangangalaga sa bata bawat buwan, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Opsyonal. Ilagay lamang ang buwanang halaga na pinaniniwalaan mong maaaring isama pagkatapos ng anumang suporta o kaluwagan sa buwis; hindi matukoy ng tool ang pagiging karapat-dapat.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Ordinaryong benepisyo ng bata bawat buwan, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Ginamit ang klase ng pagbisita para sa diskwento","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Walang diskwento / mas kaunti sa 2 gabi bawat buwan","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Klase 1 · humigit-kumulang 2–3 gabi bawat buwan","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Klase 2 · humigit-kumulang 4–8 gabi bawat buwan","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Klase 3 · humigit-kumulang 9–13 gabi bawat buwan","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Klase 4 · humigit-kumulang 14–15 gabi bawat buwan","Estimate monthly amount":"Tantyahin ang buwanang halaga","Clear entries":"I-clear ang mga entry","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Ilagay ang taunang kabuuang kita ng mga magulang at ang pangkat ng edad ng bata.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Kinakalkula ang senaryo sa device na ito. Ang NAV ang nagpapasya sa mga opisyal na kaso.","Entries cleared.":"Na-clear ang mga entry.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Tingnan ang kita, edad, klase ng pagbisita at mga entry sa buwanang gastos.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Pinasimpleng buwanang senaryo","Estimated monthly transfer":"Tinantyang buwanang paglilipat","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Tinantyang halaga na mahigit 12 na buwan","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Buwanang batayan sa gastos sa pagpapanatili","Age-based consumption reference":"Sanggunian sa pagkonsumo batay sa edad","Standard housing reference":"Karaniwang sanggunian sa pabahay","Childcare amount entered":"Inilagay ang halaga ng pangangalaga sa bata","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Ibinawas ang ordinaryong benepisyo ng bata","Income share before ceilings":"Bahagi sa kita bago ang mga kisame","Estimate before visitation credit":"Tantyahin bago ang credit ng pagbisita","Visitation credit":"Kredito sa pagbisita","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% taunang kita na kisame bawat buwan","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Magulang na responsable sa sitwasyong ito","Parent entered as paying":"Pumasok ang magulang bilang nagbabayad","Other parent":"Ibang magulang","Higher-income parent":"Magulang na mas mataas ang kita","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Para sa shared residence, inihahambing ng tool ang bahagi ng kita ng magulang na may mas mataas na kita sa 50%.","Assumptions used":"Mga ginamit na pagpapalagay","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Static Norwegian 2026 reference rate epektibo 1 Hulyo; walang mga update sa background.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Ang halaga ay bilugan sa pinakamalapit na NOK 10. Ang taunang halaga ay nagpaparami sa bilugan na buwanang pagtatantya sa 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Isang bata bawat kalkulasyon; capacity-to-pay, ibang mga bata, kumpletong buwis, kita ng bata at mga espesyal na kaso ay hindi modelo.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Lahat ng entry at kalkulasyon ay mananatili sa tab ng browser na ito. Walang na-upload o iniimbak ng tool na ito.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · mga panuntunan at gabay sa suporta sa bata","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rate at mga pagbabawas sa pagbisita","Norwegian child support regulation":"Regulasyon sa suporta sa bata ng Norway","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Suriin ang kasalukuyang gabay sa NAV at opisyal na calculator","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"tr":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Norveç Nafakası Tahmin Aracı","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Norveç Nafaka Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Özel Sözleşme Tahmini","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Norveç 2026 referans oranları kapsamında basitleştirilmiş aylık nafaka senaryosunu keşfedin. Varsayımları ve tahmini tutarı görmek için çocuğun yaşını, her bir ebeveynin gelirini, çocuk bakımı masraflarını, ikametgahını ve ziyaretini girin.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Bir çocuğun aylık nafakasını görüşmek için bu özel planlama tahminini kullanın. Yaşa dayalı referans rakamları ve ziyaret indirimleri tarihli Norveç 2026 tablolarını takip etmektedir; Bu sayfanın dili hiçbir zaman ülkeyi veya kuralları değiştirmez.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Bu tarayıcıda çalışır. Girdiğiniz rakamlar bu araç tarafından bir sunucuya gönderilmez veya kaydedilmez.","Example":"Örnek","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"6–10 yaşındaki bir çocuk için, çocuk bakımından önceki 2026 referans maliyeti, tüketimde NOK 7,523 artı barınma için NOK 3,811'tir, 2,012 NOK'u çıkarıldığında normal çocuk yardımı: 9,322 NOK'tur. Yıllık ebeveyn gelirleri NOK 600,000 ve NOK 400,000 ve ziyaret sınıfı 2 ile, basitleştirilmiş tek ev tahmini, NOK 1,690 ziyaret kredisi ve yuvarlamadan sonra ayda yaklaşık NOK 3,900'tir.","How the estimate works":"Tahmin nasıl işliyor?","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Araç, 2026 yaşa dayalı tüketim tutarını ve barınma tutarını toplar, girdiğiniz uygun net çocuk bakımı maliyetini ekler ve normal çocuk yardımını çıkarır. Bir birincil ev için bu maliyeti, girilen iki yıllık geliri kullanarak tahsis eder, 5/6 maliyet tavanını ve %25 gelir tavanını uygular, 2026 ziyaret kredisini çıkarır ve en yakın NOK 10'e yuvarlar. Ortak konut için yüksek gelirli ebeveynin payının %50'in üzerinde olduğu tahmin ediliyor.","Common questions":"Genel sorular","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Bu, yasal olarak bağlayıcı bir miktar belirliyor mu?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Hayır. Ebeveynler özel olarak anlaşabilir ve NAV tek başına kamuya açık bir karar verir. Bu basitleştirilmiş bir karşılaştırmadır, bir NAV kararı veya tam hesaplayıcısı değildir.","Does page language change these rules?":"Sayfa dili bu kuralları değiştirir mi?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Hayır. Arayüz çevrilmiştir ancak gösterilen oranlar ve formül Norveççedir ve 2026 tarihlidir.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Oranların neden bir tarihi var?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV ve Bakanlık, yıl içinde, normalde 1 Temmuz ayından itibaren referans tutarlarını günceller. Bu sürüm, 1 Temmuz 2026 geçerli oranlarını kullanır; Bir sonuca güvenmeden önce bağlantılı resmi tabloları kontrol edin.","Scope and limits":"Kapsam ve sınırlar","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Yalnızca Norveç; 18'in altında, hesaplama başına bir çocuk. Bu basitleştirilmiş senaryo, NAV'ın tam gelir tanımını, vergi ve ödeme kapasitesi hesaplamasını, çocuk bakımı desteği/vergi indirimini, çocuk gelirini, çoklu çocuk tahsisini, olağandışı ziyaret programlarını, ekstra desteği veya uluslararası davaları yeniden oluşturmamaktadır. Kullanıcı tarafından girilen çocuk bakımı tutarı, kullanıcının geçerli olduğunu bildiği tüm destek veya kesintiler sonrasında uygun net aylık tutar olmalıdır. Gelir, resmi bir NAV değerlendirmesi değil, basitleştirilmiş yıllık brüt gelirdir. Bunu bir ödül, hukuki tavsiye veya ebeveynlerden birinin ödemesi gereken tutara dair bir söz olarak kullanmayın.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Özel bir anlaşma senaryosunu tahmin edin","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Yalnızca Norveç kuralları · 2026 referans tabloları geçerli 1 Temmuz · kontrol edildi 17 Ekim 2026 · dil ülkeyi değiştirmez.","Child age group":"Çocuk yaş grubu","0–5 years":"0–5 yıl","6–10 years":"6–10 yıl","11–14 years":"11–14 yıl","15 years and older":"15 yaş ve üzeri","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Ebeveyn desteği ödeyenlerin yıllık brüt geliri, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Diğer ana şirketin yıllık brüt geliri, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Çocuk yurdu düzenlemesi","One primary home":"Bir ana ev","Shared residence":"Ortak konut","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Aylık uygun net çocuk bakımı maliyeti, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"İsteğe bağlı. Yalnızca herhangi bir destek veya vergi indiriminden sonra dahil edilebileceğini düşündüğünüz aylık tutarı girin; araç uygunluğu belirleyemez.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Aylık olağan çocuk parası, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"İndirim için kullanılan ziyaret sınıfı","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"İndirim yok / ayda 2 geceden az","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Sınıf 1 · ayda yaklaşık 2–3 gece","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Sınıf 2 · ayda yaklaşık 4–8 gece","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Sınıf 3 · ayda yaklaşık 9–13 gece","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Sınıf 4 · ayda yaklaşık 14–15 gece","Estimate monthly amount":"Tahmini aylık tutar","Clear entries":"Girişleri temizle","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Her iki ebeveynin de yıllık brüt gelirini ve çocuğun yaş grubunu girin.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Bu cihazda hesaplanan senaryo. NAV resmi davalara karar verir.","Entries cleared.":"Girişler temizlendi.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Gelir, yaş, ziyaret sınıfı ve aylık maliyet girişlerini kontrol edin.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Basitleştirilmiş aylık senaryo","Estimated monthly transfer":"Tahmini aylık transfer","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 ay boyunca tahmini tutar","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Aylık bakım maliyeti esası","Age-based consumption reference":"Yaşa dayalı tüketim referansı","Standard housing reference":"Standart muhafaza referansı","Childcare amount entered":"Çocuk bakımı tutarı girildi","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Normal çocuk parası düşüldü","Income share before ceilings":"Tavanlardan önce gelir paylaşımı","Estimate before visitation credit":"Ziyaret kredisinden önceki tahmin","Visitation credit":"Ziyaret kredisi","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 bakım maliyeti tavanı","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% yıllık aylık gelir tavanı","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Bu senaryoda sorumlu ebeveyn","Parent entered as paying":"Ebeveyn ödeme yapıyor olarak girildi","Other parent":"Diğer üst öğe","Higher-income parent":"Yüksek gelirli ebeveyn","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Ortak ikamet için araç, yüksek gelirli ebeveynin gelir payını %50 ile karşılaştırır.","Assumptions used":"Kullanılan varsayımlar","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Statik Norveç 2026 referans oranları geçerli 1 Temmuz; arka plan güncellemesi yok.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Tutar en yakın NOK 10 değerine yuvarlanır. Yıllık tutar, yuvarlanmış aylık tahmini 12 ile çarpar.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Hesaplama başına bir alt öğe; ödeme gücü, diğer çocuklar, tam vergi, çocuk geliri ve özel durumlar modellenmemiştir.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Tüm girişler ve hesaplamalar bu tarayıcı sekmesinde kalır. Bu araç tarafından hiçbir şey yüklenmez veya saklanmaz.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · nafaka kuralları ve rehberliği","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 referans oranları ve ziyaret kesintileri","Norwegian child support regulation":"Norveç nafakası düzenlemesi","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Mevcut NAV kılavuzunu ve resmi hesap makinesini kontrol edin","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"uk":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Норвезька оцінка аліментів","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Норвезький калькулятор аліментів 2026 — Розрахунок приватної угоди","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Ознайомтеся зі спрощеним сценарієм щомісячних аліментів за норвезькими базовими ставками 2026. Введіть вік дитини, дохід кожного з батьків, витрати на догляд за дітьми, місце проживання та відвідування, щоб побачити припущення та приблизну суму.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Використовуйте цю приватну планову оцінку, щоб обговорити щомісячну підтримку однієї дитини. Довідкові цифри на основі віку та знижки на відвідування відповідають датованим норвезьким таблицям 2026; мова цієї сторінки ніколи не змінює країни чи правил.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Запускається в цьому браузері. Цифри, які ви вводите, не надсилаються на сервер і не зберігаються цим інструментом.","Example":"Приклад","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Для дитини віком 6–10 базова вартість 2026 до догляду за дитиною становить 7,523 норвезьких крон у споживанні плюс 3,811 норвезьких крон на житло, мінус NOK 2,012 звичайної допомоги на дітей: NOK 9,322. З річним доходом батьків NOK 600,000 і NOK 400,000 і класом відвідування 2, спрощена оцінка для одного будинку становить близько 3,900 NOK на місяць після кредиту на відвідування NOK 1,690 і округлення.","How the estimate works":"Як працює кошторис","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Інструмент додає суму споживання на основі віку 2026 і суму житла, додає прийнятну чисту вартість догляду за дитиною, яку ви вводите, і віднімає звичайну допомогу на дитину. Для одного основного будинку він розподіляє ці витрати з використанням двох введених річних доходів, застосовує верхню межу витрат 5/6 і межу доходу 25%, віднімає кредит на відвідування 2026 і округляє до найближчого NOK 10. Для спільного проживання він оцінює частку батьків з вищим доходом вище 50%.","Common questions":"Поширені запитання","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Чи встановлюється юридично обов’язкова сума?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"№ Батьки можуть домовитися приватно, і NAV самостійно приймає публічне рішення. Це спрощене порівняння, а не рішення NAV або його повний калькулятор.","Does page language change these rules?":"Чи змінює мова сторінки ці правила?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"№ Інтерфейс перекладено, але показані тарифи та формула є норвезькими і мають дату 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Чому тарифи мають дату?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV і Міністерство оновлюють довідкові суми протягом року, зазвичай з 1 липня. У цій версії використовуються тарифи 1 липня 2026; перевірте пов’язані офіційні таблиці, перш ніж покладатися на результат.","Scope and limits":"Сфера застосування та обмеження","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Лише Норвегія; одна дитина на розрахунок, під 18. У цьому спрощеному сценарії не відтворюється повне визначення доходу NAV, розрахунок податку та платоспроможності, допомога по догляду за дитиною/податкові пільги, дохід від дітей, розподіл дітей, незвичайні графіки відвідувань, додаткова підтримка або міжнародні справи. Введена користувачем сума догляду за дитиною має відповідати прийнятній чистій місячній сумі після будь-якої допомоги чи відрахувань, які користувач знає. Дохід – це спрощений річний валовий дохід, а не офіційна оцінка ВЧА. Не використовуйте це як винагороду, юридичну пораду чи обіцянку того, що хтось із батьків повинен заплатити.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Оцініть сценарій приватної угоди","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Лише правила Норвегії · 2026 довідкові таблиці діють 1 Липень · перевірено 17 Жовтень 2026 · мова не змінює країну.","Child age group":"Дитяча вікова група","0–5 years":"0–5 років","6–10 years":"6–10 років","11–14 years":"11–14 років","15 years and older":"15 років і старше","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Річний валовий дохід батька, який сплачує допомогу, норвезькі крон","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Річний валовий дохід другого з батьків, норвезькі крон","Child residence arrangement":"Оформлення місця проживання дитини","One primary home":"Один первинний будинок","Shared residence":"Спільне проживання","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Прийнятні чисті витрати на догляд за дитиною на місяць, норвезькі крон","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Необов'язковий. Введіть лише місячну суму, яка, на вашу думку, може бути включена після будь-якої підтримки чи податкових пільг; інструмент не може визначити придатність.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Звичайна допомога на дитину на місяць, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Клас відвідування, який використовується для знижки","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Без знижки / менше ніж 2 ночей на місяць","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Клас 1 · приблизно 2–3 ночей на місяць","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Клас 2 · приблизно 4–8 ночей на місяць","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Клас 3 · приблизно 9–13 ночей на місяць","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Клас 4 · приблизно 14–15 ночей на місяць","Estimate monthly amount":"Орієнтовна місячна сума","Clear entries":"Очистити записи","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Введіть річний валовий дохід обох батьків і вікову групу дитини.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Сценарій, розрахований на цьому пристрої. НАВ вирішує службові справи.","Entries cleared.":"Записи видалено.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Перевірте записи про дохід, вік, клас відвідування та щомісячні витрати.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Спрощений місячний сценарій","Estimated monthly transfer":"Орієнтовний місячний переказ","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Очікувана сума за 12 місяців","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Щомісячна вартість технічного обслуговування","Age-based consumption reference":"Посилання на споживання на основі віку","Standard housing reference":"Довідник стандартного корпусу","Childcare amount entered":"Введено суму допомоги по догляду за дитиною","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Звичайна дитяча допомога вирахована","Income share before ceilings":"Частка доходу до граничних розмірів","Estimate before visitation credit":"Оцінка до кредиту відвідування","Visitation credit":"Кредит на відвідування","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 максимальна вартість обслуговування","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% максимального річного доходу на місяць","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Батьки, відповідальні за цей сценарій","Parent entered as paying":"Батько введено як платника","Other parent":"Інший батько","Higher-income parent":"Мати з високим доходом","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Для спільного проживання інструмент порівнює частку доходу батьків з вищим доходом із 50%.","Assumptions used":"Використані припущення","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Статичні норвезькі довідкові ставки 2026 чинні 1 липень; немає фонових оновлень.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Суму округлено до найближчого NOK 10. Річна сума множить округлену місячну оцінку на 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Одна дитина на розрахунок; платоспроможність, інші діти, повний податок, дохід дітей та особливі випадки не моделюються.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Усі записи та розрахунки залишаються на цій вкладці браузера. Цей інструмент нічого не завантажує та не зберігає.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · правила та вказівки щодо аліментів","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 базові ставки та відрахування за відвідування","Norwegian child support regulation":"Норвезьке регулювання аліментів","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Перевірте поточні вказівки NAV та офіційний калькулятор","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"ur":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"نارویجن چائلڈ سپورٹ کا تخمینہ لگانے والا","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"ناروے چائلڈ سپورٹ کیلکولیٹر 2026 - نجی معاہدے کا تخمینہ","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"نارویجین 2026 حوالہ جاتی شرحوں کے تحت ماہانہ بچوں کی مدد کا ایک آسان منظرنامہ دریافت کریں۔ مفروضوں اور تخمینہ شدہ رقم کو دیکھنے کے لیے بچوں کی عمر، ہر والدین کی آمدنی، بچوں کی دیکھ بھال کے اخراجات، رہائش اور دورہ درج کریں۔","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"ایک بچے کی ماہانہ مدد کے بارے میں بات کرنے کے لیے اس نجی منصوبہ بندی کا تخمینہ استعمال کریں۔ عمر کی بنیاد پر حوالہ جات کے اعداد و شمار اور وزٹ ڈسکاؤنٹ تاریخ کے نارویجین 2026 جدولوں کی پیروی کرتے ہیں۔ اس صفحہ کی زبان کبھی بھی ملک یا قواعد کو تبدیل نہیں کرتی ہے۔","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"اس براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔ آپ جو اعداد و شمار داخل کرتے ہیں وہ سرور کو نہیں بھیجے جاتے یا اس ٹول کے ذریعے محفوظ نہیں کیے جاتے۔","Example":"مثال","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"عمر رسیدہ بچے کے لیے6-10, the2026بچے کی دیکھ بھال سے پہلے حوالہ لاگت NOK ہے۔7,523کھپت کے علاوہ NOK میں3,811رہائش کے لیے، کم NOK2,012عام بچے کا فائدہ: NOK9,322. NOK کی سالانہ والدین کی آمدنی کے ساتھ600,000اور NOK400,000اور وزٹ کلاس2، ایک گھر کا آسان تخمینہ NOK کے بارے میں ہے۔3,900NOK کے بعد فی مہینہ1,690وزٹیشن کریڈٹ اور راؤنڈنگ۔","How the estimate works":"تخمینہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"ٹول شامل کرتا ہے۔2026عمر کی بنیاد پر کھپت کی رقم اور رہائش کی رقم، آپ کے داخل کردہ اہل چائلڈ کیئر لاگت کو شامل کرتی ہے، اور بچوں کے عام فائدے کو گھٹا دیتی ہے۔ ایک بنیادی گھر کے لیے، یہ لاگت دو درج شدہ سالانہ آمدنیوں کا استعمال کرتے ہوئے مختص کرتا ہے۔5/6لاگت کی حد اور25% آمدنی کی حد، منہا کرتی ہے۔2026وزٹیشن کریڈٹ اور قریبی NOK کے چکر10. مشترکہ رہائش کے لیے یہ اوپر زیادہ آمدنی والے والدین کے حصہ کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔50%","Common questions":"عام سوالات","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"کیا یہ قانونی طور پر پابند رقم مقرر کرتا ہے؟","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"نہیں، والدین نجی طور پر راضی ہو سکتے ہیں، اور NAV ہی عوامی فیصلہ کرتا ہے۔ یہ ایک آسان موازنہ ہے، NAV فیصلہ یا اس کا مکمل کیلکولیٹر نہیں۔","Does page language change these rules?":"کیا صفحہ کی زبان ان اصولوں کو تبدیل کرتی ہے؟","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"نہیں۔2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"نرخوں کی تاریخ کیوں ہوتی ہے؟","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV اور وزارت سال کے دوران حوالہ کی رقم کو اپ ڈیٹ کرتی ہے، عام طور پر 1 جولائی سے۔ یہ ورژن 1 جولائی 2026 کی قیمتوں کا استعمال کرتا ہے۔ کسی نتیجے پر بھروسہ کرنے سے پہلے منسلک سرکاری میزیں چیک کریں۔","Scope and limits":"دائرہ کار اور حدود","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"صرف ناروے؛ ایک بچہ فی حساب، 18 کے تحت۔ یہ آسان منظرنامہ NAV کی مکمل آمدنی کی تعریف، ٹیکس اور ادائیگی کی صلاحیت کے حساب سے، بچوں کی دیکھ بھال میں مدد/ٹیکس میں ریلیف، بچوں کی آمدنی، ایک سے زیادہ بچوں کی مختص، غیر معمولی ملاقات کے شیڈول، اضافی مدد یا بین الاقوامی معاملات کو دوبارہ پیش نہیں کرتا ہے۔ صارف کے ذریعے داخل کی گئی چائلڈ کیئر رقم کسی بھی معاونت یا کٹوتیوں کے بعد جو صارف کے علم میں ہے لاگو ہونے کے بعد اہل خالص ماہانہ رقم ہونی چاہیے۔ آمدنی آسان سالانہ مجموعی آمدنی ہے، سرکاری NAV تشخیص نہیں۔ اسے بطور ایوارڈ، قانونی مشورے یا اس وعدے کے طور پر استعمال نہ کریں جو والدین میں سے کسی ایک کو ادا کرنا ہوگا۔","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"ایک نجی معاہدے کے منظر نامے کا اندازہ لگائیں۔","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"صرف ناروے کے قواعد · 2026 حوالہ جدول مؤثر 1 جولائی · چیک کیا گیا 17 اکتوبر 2026 · زبان ملک کو تبدیل نہیں کرتی ہے۔","Child age group":"بچوں کی عمر کا گروپ","0–5 years":"0–5 سال","6–10 years":"6–10 سال","11–14 years":"11–14 سال","15 years and older":"15 سال اور اس سے زیادہ پرانا","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"والدین کی ادائیگی سپورٹ کی سالانہ مجموعی آمدنی، NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"دوسرے والدین کی سالانہ مجموعی آمدنی، NOK","Child residence arrangement":"بچوں کی رہائش کا انتظام","One primary home":"ایک بنیادی گھر","Shared residence":"مشترکہ رہائش گاہ","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"ہر ماہ بچوں کی نگہداشت کی اہل خالص لاگت، NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"اختیاری۔ صرف وہ ماہانہ رقم درج کریں جو آپ کے خیال میں کسی بھی معاونت یا ٹیکس میں ریلیف کے بعد شامل ہو سکتی ہے۔ ٹول اہلیت کا تعین نہیں کر سکتا۔","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"عام بچے کو ماہانہ فائدہ، NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"رعایت کے لیے وزٹیشن کلاس استعمال کی جاتی ہے۔","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"کوئی رعایت نہیں / ہر ماہ 2 راتوں سے کم","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"کلاس 1 · تقریبا 2–3 راتیں ہر ماہ","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"کلاس 2 · تقریبا 4–8 راتیں ہر ماہ","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"کلاس 3 · تقریبا 9–13 راتیں ہر ماہ","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"کلاس 4 · تقریبا 14–15 راتیں ہر ماہ","Estimate monthly amount":"ماہانہ رقم کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Clear entries":"اندراجات صاف کریں۔","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"والدین کی سالانہ مجموعی آمدنی اور بچے کی عمر کا گروپ دونوں درج کریں۔","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"اس ڈیوائس پر منظر نامے کا حساب لگایا گیا ہے۔ NAV سرکاری مقدمات کا فیصلہ کرتا ہے۔","Entries cleared.":"اندراجات صاف ہو گئے۔","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"آمدنی، عمر، وزٹ کلاس اور ماہانہ لاگت کے اندراجات کو چیک کریں۔","Simplified monthly scenario":"آسان ماہانہ منظرنامہ","Estimated monthly transfer":"تخمینہ شدہ ماہانہ منتقلی۔","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 مہینوں میں تخمینی رقم","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"ماہانہ دیکھ بھال کی لاگت کی بنیاد","Age-based consumption reference":"عمر کی بنیاد پر کھپت کا حوالہ","Standard housing reference":"معیاری رہائش کا حوالہ","Childcare amount entered":"بچوں کی دیکھ بھال کی رقم درج کی گئی۔","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"عام بچے کا فائدہ گھٹا دیا گیا۔","Income share before ceilings":"چھتوں سے پہلے آمدنی کا حصہ","Estimate before visitation credit":"وزٹیشن کریڈٹ سے پہلے تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Visitation credit":"ویزیٹیشن کریڈٹ","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 دیکھ بھال کی لاگت کی حد","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% سالانہ آمدنی کی حد فی ماہ","Parent responsible in this scenario":"اس منظر نامے میں والدین ذمہ دار ہیں۔","Parent entered as paying":"والدین ادائیگی کے طور پر داخل ہوئے۔","Other parent":"دیگر والدین","Higher-income parent":"زیادہ آمدنی والے والدین","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"مشترکہ رہائش کے لیے، ٹول زیادہ آمدنی والے والدین کی آمدنی کے حصہ کا 50% سے موازنہ کرتا ہے۔","Assumptions used":"استعمال شدہ مفروضے۔","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"جامد نارویجن 2026 حوالہ جات مؤثر 1 جولائی؛ کوئی پس منظر کی تازہ کاری نہیں ہے۔","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"رقم کو قریب ترین NOK 10 تک گول کر دیا گیا ہے۔ سالانہ رقم گول ماہانہ تخمینہ کو 12 سے ضرب دیتی ہے۔","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"ہر حساب سے ایک بچہ؛ ادائیگی کی صلاحیت، دوسرے بچے، مکمل ٹیکس، بچوں کی آمدنی اور خصوصی معاملات کو ماڈل نہیں کیا گیا ہے۔","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"تمام اندراجات اور حساب کتاب اس براؤزر ٹیب میں رہتے ہیں۔ اس ٹول کے ذریعے کچھ بھی اپ لوڈ یا اسٹور نہیں کیا جاتا ہے۔","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · بچوں کی مدد کے اصول اور رہنمائی","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 حوالہ جات اور وزٹیشن کٹوتیاں","Norwegian child support regulation":"نارویجین چائلڈ سپورٹ ریگولیشن","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"موجودہ NAV رہنمائی اور آفیشل کیلکولیٹر چیک کریں۔","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"vi":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"Công cụ ước tính hỗ trợ trẻ em của Na Uy","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"Máy tính cấp dưỡng con cái của Na Uy 2026 — Ước tính thỏa thuận tư nhân","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"Khám phá kịch bản cấp dưỡng con cái hàng tháng được đơn giản hóa theo tỷ giá tham chiếu 2026 của Na Uy. Nhập tuổi của trẻ, thu nhập của mỗi phụ huynh, chi phí chăm sóc trẻ em, nơi cư trú và thăm viếng để xem các giả định và số tiền ước tính.","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"Sử dụng ước tính lập kế hoạch riêng này để thảo luận về khoản hỗ trợ hàng tháng cho một đứa trẻ. Các số liệu tham khảo theo độ tuổi và mức giảm giá thăm quan tuân theo các bảng 2026 của Na Uy; ngôn ngữ của trang này không bao giờ thay đổi quốc gia hoặc quy định.","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Chạy trong trình duyệt này. Các số liệu bạn nhập không được gửi đến máy chủ hoặc được công cụ này lưu lại.","Example":"Ví dụ","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"Đối với trẻ em ở độ tuổi 6–10, chi phí tham chiếu 2026 trước khi chăm sóc trẻ là NOK 7,523 chi tiêu cộng với NOK 3,811 cho nhà ở, trừ đi NOK 2,012 phúc lợi trẻ em thông thường: NOK 9,322. Với thu nhập hàng năm của cha mẹ là NOK 600,000 và NOK 400,000 và loại thăm viếng 2, ước tính đơn giản hóa cho một ngôi nhà là khoảng NOK 3,900 mỗi tháng sau khi làm tròn và tín dụng thăm viếng NOK 1,690.","How the estimate works":"Cách hoạt động của ước tính","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"Công cụ này thêm số tiền tiêu dùng và số tiền nhà ở theo độ tuổi 2026, thêm chi phí chăm sóc trẻ em ròng đủ điều kiện mà bạn nhập và trừ đi trợ cấp trẻ em thông thường. Đối với một ngôi nhà chính, nó phân bổ chi phí này bằng cách sử dụng hai thu nhập hàng năm đã nhập, áp dụng trần chi phí 5/6 và trần thu nhập 25%, trừ đi khoản tín dụng thăm viếng 2026 và làm tròn đến NOK 10 gần nhất. Đối với nơi ở chung, nó ước tính tỷ lệ của cha mẹ có thu nhập cao hơn 50%.","Common questions":"Các câu hỏi thường gặp","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"Điều này có đặt ra số tiền ràng buộc về mặt pháp lý không?","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"Không. Phụ huynh có thể đồng ý một cách riêng tư và chỉ NAV mới đưa ra quyết định công khai. Đây là một so sánh đơn giản, không phải là quyết định NAV hay công cụ tính toán đầy đủ của nó.","Does page language change these rules?":"Ngôn ngữ trang có thay đổi các quy tắc này không?","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"Không. Giao diện được dịch, nhưng tỷ lệ và công thức hiển thị là tiếng Na Uy và ghi ngày 2026.","Why do the rates have a date?":"Tại sao giá lại có ngày?","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV và Bộ cập nhật số tiền tham chiếu trong năm, thông thường từ 1 tháng 7. Phiên bản này sử dụng tỷ giá 1 tháng 7 2026 có hiệu lực; kiểm tra các bảng chính thức được liên kết trước khi dựa vào kết quả.","Scope and limits":"Phạm vi và giới hạn","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"Chỉ ở Na Uy; một trẻ cho mỗi phép tính, dưới 18. Kịch bản đơn giản hóa này không tái tạo định nghĩa thu nhập đầy đủ của NAV, cách tính thuế và khả năng chi trả, hỗ trợ chăm sóc trẻ/giảm thuế, thu nhập của trẻ em, phân bổ nhiều con, lịch thăm viếng bất thường, hỗ trợ thêm hoặc các trường hợp quốc tế. Số tiền gửi trẻ do người dùng nhập phải là số tiền ròng hàng tháng đủ điều kiện sau khi áp dụng bất kỳ khoản hỗ trợ hoặc khấu trừ nào mà người dùng biết. Thu nhập được đơn giản hóa tổng thu nhập hàng năm, không phải là đánh giá NAV chính thức. Không sử dụng nó như một phần thưởng, lời khuyên pháp lý hoặc lời hứa về số tiền mà cha/mẹ phải trả.","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"Ước tính kịch bản thỏa thuận riêng","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"Chỉ quy tắc của Na Uy · Bảng tham chiếu 2026 có hiệu lực 1 Tháng 7 · đã kiểm tra 17 Tháng 10 2026 · ngôn ngữ không thay đổi quốc gia.","Child age group":"Nhóm tuổi trẻ em","0–5 years":"0–5 năm","6–10 years":"6–10 năm","11–14 years":"11–14 năm","15 years and older":"15 tuổi trở lên","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"Tổng thu nhập hàng năm từ khoản hỗ trợ chi trả của phụ huynh, NOK","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"Tổng thu nhập hàng năm của bên cha mẹ kia, NOK","Child residence arrangement":"Sắp xếp nơi ở cho trẻ em","One primary home":"Một ngôi nhà chính","Shared residence":"Nơi ở chung","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"Chi phí chăm sóc trẻ ròng đủ điều kiện mỗi tháng, NOK","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"Tùy chọn. Chỉ nhập số tiền hàng tháng mà bạn tin rằng có thể được bao gồm sau bất kỳ khoản hỗ trợ hoặc giảm thuế nào; công cụ này không thể xác định tính đủ điều kiện.","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"Trợ cấp trẻ em thông thường mỗi tháng, NOK","Visitation class used for the discount":"Lớp thăm quan được sử dụng để được giảm giá","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"Không giảm giá / ít hơn 2 đêm mỗi tháng","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"Lớp 1 · khoảng 2–3 đêm mỗi tháng","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"Lớp 2 · khoảng 4–8 đêm mỗi tháng","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"Lớp 3 · khoảng 9–13 đêm mỗi tháng","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"Lớp 4 · khoảng 14–15 đêm mỗi tháng","Estimate monthly amount":"Số tiền ước tính hàng tháng","Clear entries":"Xóa mục nhập","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"Nhập tổng thu nhập hàng năm của cả cha và mẹ và nhóm tuổi của trẻ.","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"Kịch bản được tính toán trên thiết bị này. NAV quyết định các trường hợp chính thức.","Entries cleared.":"Đã xóa mục nhập.","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"Kiểm tra thu nhập, độ tuổi, hạng thăm khám và các mục nhập chi phí hàng tháng.","Simplified monthly scenario":"Kịch bản hàng tháng được đơn giản hóa","Estimated monthly transfer":"Số chuyển khoản ước tính hàng tháng","Estimated amount over 12 months":"Số tiền ước tính trong 12 tháng","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"Cơ sở chi phí bảo trì hàng tháng","Age-based consumption reference":"Tham khảo mức tiêu thụ theo độ tuổi","Standard housing reference":"Tham khảo nhà ở tiêu chuẩn","Childcare amount entered":"Số tiền giữ trẻ đã được nhập","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"Trừ trợ cấp trẻ em thông thường","Income share before ceilings":"Tỷ trọng thu nhập trước trần","Estimate before visitation credit":"Ước tính tín dụng trước chuyến thăm","Visitation credit":"Tín dụng thăm quan","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6 trần chi phí bảo trì","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% trần thu nhập hàng năm mỗi tháng","Parent responsible in this scenario":"Phụ huynh chịu trách nhiệm trong tình huống này","Parent entered as paying":"Phụ huynh đã nhập là thanh toán","Other parent":"Phụ huynh khác","Higher-income parent":"Phụ huynh có thu nhập cao hơn","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"Đối với nơi ở chung, công cụ này so sánh phần thu nhập của cha mẹ có thu nhập cao hơn với 50%.","Assumptions used":"Các giả định được sử dụng","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"Tỷ lệ tham chiếu 2026 tĩnh của Na Uy 1 có hiệu lực vào tháng 7; không có cập nhật nền.","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"Số tiền được làm tròn đến NOK 10 gần nhất. Số tiền hàng năm nhân với ước tính hàng tháng được làm tròn với 12.","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"Một con cho mỗi phép tính; khả năng chi trả, các con khác, thuế đầy đủ, thu nhập của trẻ em và các trường hợp đặc biệt không được mô hình hóa.","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"Tất cả các mục nhập và tính toán đều nằm trong tab trình duyệt này. Không có gì được tải lên hoặc lưu trữ bởi công cụ này.","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · các quy định và hướng dẫn về cấp dưỡng con cái","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · Tỷ lệ tham chiếu 2026 và các khoản khấu trừ thăm viếng","Norwegian child support regulation":"Quy định cấp dưỡng nuôi con của Na Uy","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"Kiểm tra hướng dẫn NAV hiện tại và máy tính chính thức","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"zh":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"挪威子女抚养费估算器","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"挪威子女抚养费计算器 2026 — 私人协议估算","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"探索挪威 2026 参考费率下简化的每月子女抚养费方案。输入儿童年龄、每位父母的收入、儿童保育费用、居住地和探视次数，以查看假设和估计金额。","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"使用此私人规划估算来讨论一个孩子的每月抚养费。基于年龄的参考数字和访问折扣遵循过时的挪威 2026 表；本页面的语言永远不会改变国家或规则。","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"在此浏览器中运行。您输入的数字不会发送到服务器或由该工具保存。","Example":"示例","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"对于年龄为 6–10 的儿童，儿童保育前的 2026 参考费用为消费 7,523 挪威克朗加上住房 3,811 挪威克朗，减去 2,012 挪威克朗普通儿童福利：9,322 挪威克朗。考虑到父母年收入为 NOK 600,000 和 NOK 400,000 以及探视级别为 2，经过 NOK 1,690 探视积分和四舍五入后，简化的一居室估算约为每月 3,900 挪威克朗。","How the estimate works":"估算如何进行","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"该工具添加 2026 基于年龄的消费金额和住房金额，添加您输入的符合条件的净儿童保育费用，并减去普通儿童福利。对于一个主要住宅，它使用两项输入的年收入来分配此成本，应用 5/6 成本上限和 25% 收入上限，减去 2026 访问积分并四舍五入到最接近的挪威克朗 10。对于合住住宅，预计高收入父母的份额高于 50%。","Common questions":"常见问题","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"这是否设定了具有法律约束力的金额？","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"编号家长可以私下同意，仅由 NAV 做出公开决定。这是一个简化的比较，而不是资产净值决策或其完整计算器。","Does page language change these rules?":"页面语言会改变这些规则吗？","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"编号界面已翻译，但显示的汇率和公式为挪威语，日期为 2026。","Why do the rates have a date?":"为什么费率有日期？","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV 和该部在年内更新参考金额，通常从 1 7 月开始。此版本使用 1 7 月 2026 有效费率；在依赖结果之前检查链接的官方表格。","Scope and limits":"范围和限制","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"仅限挪威；每个计算有一个子项，位于 18 下。这种简化的情景不会重现 NAV 的完整收入定义、税收和支付能力计算、儿童保育支持/税收减免、儿童收入、多子女分配、不寻常的探视时间表、额外支持或国际案件。用户输入的儿童保育金额应是用户知道适用的任何支持或扣除后符合资格的每月净额。收入是简化的年度总收入，而不是官方的资产净值评估。请勿将其用作奖励、法律建议或父母任何一方必须支付费用的承诺。","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"估计私有协议场景","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"仅限挪威规则 · 2026 参考表生效 1 七月 · 检查 17 十月 2026 · 语言不更改国家/地区。","Child age group":"儿童年龄组","0–5 years":"0–5 年","6–10 years":"6–10 年","11–14 years":"11–14 年","15 years and older":"15 岁及以上","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"支付赡养费的父母的年总收入，挪威克朗","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"另一方的年总收入，挪威克朗","Child residence arrangement":"儿童居住安排","One primary home":"一个主要住宅","Shared residence":"共享住宅","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"每月合格的净托儿费用，挪威克朗","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"可选。仅输入您认为在任何支持或税收减免后可能包含的每月金额；该工具无法确定资格。","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"每月普通儿童福利，挪威克朗","Visitation class used for the discount":"用于折扣的参观舱位","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"无折扣/每月少于 2 晚","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"1 级 · 每月约 2–3 晚","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"2 级 · 每月约 4–8 晚","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"3 级 · 每月约 9–13 晚","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"4 级 · 每月约 14–15 晚","Estimate monthly amount":"估计每月金额","Clear entries":"清除条目","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"输入父母双方的年总收入和孩子的年龄组。","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"在此设备上计算的场景。 NAV 决定正式案件。","Entries cleared.":"条目已清除。","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"检查收入、年龄、探视级别和每月费用条目。","Simplified monthly scenario":"简化的每月场景","Estimated monthly transfer":"预计每月转账","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 个月的预计金额","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"每月维护成本基础","Age-based consumption reference":"基于年龄的消费参考","Standard housing reference":"标准外壳参考","Childcare amount entered":"已输入托儿金额","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"减去普通儿童福利","Income share before ceilings":"上限前的收入份额","Estimate before visitation credit":"访问前的估计信用","Visitation credit":"访问积分","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6维护成本上限","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% 每月年收入上限","Parent responsible in this scenario":"在这种情况下负责的家长","Parent entered as paying":"家长输入为付款","Other parent":"其他亲","Higher-income parent":"高收入家长","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"对于合住住宅，该工具将高收入父母的收入份额与 50% 进行比较。","Assumptions used":"使用的假设","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"静态挪威 2026 参考汇率 1 七月生效；没有后台更新。","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"金额四舍五入到最接近的 NOK 10。年度金额乘以四舍五入的每月估算值 12。","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"每次计算一个子项；支付能力、其他儿童、全额税、儿童收入和特殊情况均未建模。","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"所有条目和计算都保留在此浏览器选项卡中。此工具不会上传或存储任何内容。","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · 子女抚养规则和指南","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 参考费率和访问扣除","Norwegian child support regulation":"挪威儿童抚养法规","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"查看当前导航指南和官方计算器","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"},"zh_tw":{"Norwegian Child Support Estimator":"挪威兒童扶養費估算器","Norway Child Support Calculator 2026 — Private Agreement Estimate":"挪威子女扶養費計算器 2026 — 私人協議估算","Explore a simplified monthly child-support scenario under Norwegian 2026 reference rates. Enter child age, each parent’s income, childcare costs, residence and visitation to see the assumptions and estimated amount.":"探索挪威 2026 參考費率下簡化的每月子女扶養費方案。輸入兒童年齡、每位父母的收入、兒童照顧費用、居住地和探視次數，以查看假設和估計金額。","Use this private planning estimate to discuss one child’s monthly support. The age-based reference figures and visitation discounts follow dated Norwegian 2026 tables; the language of this page never changes the country or rules.":"使用此私人規劃估算來討論一個孩子的每月贍養費。基於年齡的參考數字和訪問折扣遵循過時的挪威 2026 表；本頁面的語言永遠不會改變國家或規則。","Runs in this browser. The figures you enter are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"在此瀏覽器中運行。您輸入的數字不會發送到伺服器或由該工具保存。","Example":"例子","For a child aged 6–10, the 2026 reference cost before childcare is NOK 7,523 in consumption plus NOK 3,811 for housing, less NOK 2,012 ordinary child benefit: NOK 9,322. With annual parent incomes of NOK 600,000 and NOK 400,000 and visitation class 2, the simplified one-home estimate is about NOK 3,900 per month after the NOK 1,690 visitation credit and rounding.":"對於一個年齡的孩子6–10， 這2026托兒前參考費用為挪威克朗7,523消費加上挪威克朗3,811用於住房，減去挪威克朗2,012普通兒童福利：NOK9,322。父母年收入為挪威克朗600,000和挪威克朗400,000和探訪班2，簡化的一套房屋估算約為挪威克朗3,900繳納挪威克朗後每月1,690訪問積分和四捨五入。","How the estimate works":"估算如何運作","The tool adds the 2026 age-based consumption amount and housing amount, adds the eligible net childcare cost you enter, and subtracts ordinary child benefit. For one primary home, it allocates this cost using the two entered annual incomes, applies the 5/6 cost ceiling and 25% income ceiling, subtracts the 2026 visitation credit and rounds to the nearest NOK 10. For shared residence it estimates the higher-income parent’s share above 50%.":"該工具添加了2026基於年齡的消費金額和住房金額，加上您輸入的符合資格的淨托兒費用，並減去普通兒童福利。對於一個主要住宅，它使用兩個輸入的年收入來分配該成本，應用5/6成本上限和25% 收入上限，減去2026探訪積分並四捨五入至最接近的挪威克朗10。對於共同居住，它估計高收入父母的份額高於上述50%。","Common questions":"常見問題","Does this set a legally binding amount?":"這是否設定了具有法律約束力的金額？","No. Parents can agree privately, and NAV alone makes a public determination. This is a simplified comparison, not an NAV decision or its full calculator.":"不會。家長可以私下同意，只有 NAV 才能公開決定。這是一個簡化的比較，而不是資產淨值決策或其完整計算器。","Does page language change these rules?":"頁面語言會改變這些規則嗎？","No. The interface is translated, but the rates and formula shown are Norwegian and dated 2026.":"不會。界面已翻译，但显示的汇率和公式为挪威语，日期为 2026。","Why do the rates have a date?":"為什麼利率有日期？","NAV and the Ministry update reference amounts during the year, normally from 1 July. This version uses rates effective 1 July 2026; check the linked official tables before relying on a result.":"NAV 和該部在年內更新參考金額，通常從 1 7 月開始。此版本使用 1 7 月 2026 有效費率；在依賴結果之前檢查連結的官方表格。","Scope and limits":"範圍和限制","Norway only; one child per calculation, under 18. This simplified scenario does not reproduce NAV’s full income definition, tax and capacity-to-pay calculation, childcare support/tax relief, child income, multiple-child allocation, unusual visitation schedules, extra support or international cases. The user-entered childcare amount should be the eligible net monthly amount after any support or deductions the user knows apply. Income is simplified annual gross income, not an official NAV assessment. Do not use it as an award, legal advice or a promise of what either parent must pay.":"僅限挪威；每個計算有一個子項，位於 18 下。這種簡化的情境不會重現 NAV 的完整收入定義、稅收和支付能力計算、兒童保育支持/稅收減免、兒童收入、多子女分配、不尋常的探視時間表、額外支持或國際案件。用戶輸入的兒童保育金額應是用戶知道適用的任何支援或扣除後符合資格的每月淨額。收入是簡化的年度總收入，而不是官方的資產淨值評估。請勿將其用作獎勵、法律建議或父母任何一方必須支付費用的承諾。","Estimate a private agreement scenario":"估計私有協定場景","Norwegian rules only · 2026 reference tables effective 1 July · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country.":"僅限挪威規則 · 2026 參考表生效 1 七月 · 檢查 17 十月 2026 · 語言不更改國家/地區。","Child age group":"兒童年齡組","0–5 years":"0–5 年","6–10 years":"6–10 年","11–14 years":"11–14 年","15 years and older":"15 歲以上","Annual gross income of parent paying support, NOK":"支付贍養費的父母的年總收入，挪威克朗","Annual gross income of the other parent, NOK":"另一方的年總收入，挪威克朗","Child residence arrangement":"兒童居住安排","One primary home":"一個主要住宅","Shared residence":"共享住宅","Eligible net childcare cost per month, NOK":"每月合格的淨托兒費用，挪威克朗","Optional. Enter only the monthly amount you believe may be included after any support or tax relief; the tool cannot determine eligibility.":"可選。僅輸入您認為在任何支持或稅收減免後可能包含的每月金額；該工具無法確定資格。","Ordinary child benefit per month, NOK":"每月普通兒童福利，挪威克朗","Visitation class used for the discount":"用於折扣的參觀艙位","No discount / fewer than 2 nights per month":"無折扣/每月少於 2 晚","Class 1 · about 2–3 nights per month":"1 級 · 每月約 2–3 晚","Class 2 · about 4–8 nights per month":"2 級 · 每月約 4–8 晚","Class 3 · about 9–13 nights per month":"3 級 · 每月約 9–13 晚","Class 4 · about 14–15 nights per month":"4 級 · 每月約 14–15 晚","Estimate monthly amount":"估價每月金額","Clear entries":"清除條目","Enter both parents’ annual gross income and the child’s age group.":"輸入父母雙方的年總收入和孩子的年齡組。","Scenario calculated on this device. NAV decides official cases.":"在此設備上計算的場景。 NAV 決定正式案件。","Entries cleared.":"條目已清除。","Check the income, age, visitation class and monthly cost entries.":"檢查收入、年齡、探視等級和每月費用條目。","Simplified monthly scenario":"簡化的每月場景","Estimated monthly transfer":"預計每月轉賬","Estimated amount over 12 months":"12 個月的預計金額","Monthly maintenance-cost basis":"每月維護成本基礎","Age-based consumption reference":"基於年齡的消耗參考","Standard housing reference":"標準外殼參考","Childcare amount entered":"已輸入托兒金額","Ordinary child benefit subtracted":"減去普通兒童福利","Income share before ceilings":"上限前的收入份額","Estimate before visitation credit":"訪問前的估計信用","Visitation credit":"訪問積分","5/6 maintenance-cost ceiling":"5/6維修成本上限","25% annual-income ceiling per month":"25% 每月年收入上限","Parent responsible in this scenario":"在這種情況下負責的家長","Parent entered as paying":"家長輸入為付款","Other parent":"其他親","Higher-income parent":"高收入家長","For shared residence, the tool compares the higher-income parent’s income share with 50%.":"對於共享住宅，該工具將高收入父母的收入份額與 50% 進行比較。","Assumptions used":"使用的假設","Static Norwegian 2026 reference rates effective 1 July; no background updates.":"靜態挪威 2026 參考匯率 1 七月生效；沒有後台更新。","The amount is rounded to the nearest NOK 10. The annual amount multiplies the rounded monthly estimate by 12.":"金額四捨五入至最接近的 NOK 10。年度金額乘以四捨五入的每月估計值 12。","One child per calculation; capacity-to-pay, other children, complete tax, child income and special cases are not modeled.":"每次計算一個子項；支付能力、其他兒童、全額稅、兒童收入和特殊情況均未建模。","All entries and calculations stay in this browser tab. Nothing is uploaded or stored by this tool.":"所有條目和計算都保留在此瀏覽器標籤中。此工具不會上傳或儲存任何內容。","NAV · child support rules and guidance":"NAV · 子女扶養規則與指南","NAV/Lovdata · 2026 reference rates and visitation deductions":"NAV/Lovdata · 2026 參考費率和存取扣除","Norwegian child support regulation":"挪威兒童扶養法規","Check current NAV guidance and official calculator":"查看目前導覽指南和官方計算器","https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag":"https://www.nav.no/barnebidrag","https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02":"https://lovdata.no/nav/rundskriv/v1-55-02","https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123":"https://lovdata.no/forskrift/2003-01-15-123"}});
